window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4501,"title":"Chapter 4501: Escape","paragraphs":["Bang! Bang! Bang!","Without catching up with Ye Jian, the extremists from Gistan fired three shots to warn their companions.","As it turned out, the originally peaceful night was on the verge of erupting. Weaver and White Crane pressed their ears against the iron door. Their facial expressions were cold as they held their breaths and listened carefully to the chaos outside.","Gunshots, footsteps, angry roars... The people seemed to be chasing something. The two of them, who were leaning against the door, exchanged glances... Something had happened outside.","\"I think it’s Azure Bird,\" Weaver said in a low voice. It was so soft that only White Crane could hear it. \"If it’s really Azure Bird, things won’t be stable for long. Let’s make preparations.\"","White Crane nodded. Then, he turned around and looked at the alarmed villagers of Gistan. His gaze landed on a corner, and a sharp look flashed past his calm eyes.","Weaver’s gaze swept to the same corner almost at the same time. He said softly and coldly, \"We have to catch whatever extremists here. I’m a little suspicious...\"","He glanced at the corner and said, \"Be careful. If there’s really a problem... Even if they’re villagers from Gistan, they have to be dealt with directly.\"","The last sentence was a little brutal.","White Crane calmed down. He also suspected this couple and his comrades. Since both he and Weaver had the same guess, there was a 50% chance of it being true.","The situation outside was getting more and more chaotic. They couldn’t find Ye Jian. When they came back, they found out that Anal and Karaigi were dead. The girls who were originally locked up had all escaped. Their escape made those extremists with ulterior motives furious.","\"Catch that Chinese woman and kill her. We must kill her!\"","\"Don’t let her off! She definitely didn’t run far. We must find her. We can’t let her escape back to China!\"","\"Hurry up and search!\"","Countless flashlights flashed across the night sky in the small village at the border of Gistan where there was insufficient electricity. G3, who was crawling on the hill around the village, put away his binoculars and slowly slid down.","Three hours ago, the special forces of the Xueyu unit, who had secretly entered the country of Gistan, silently dealt with nearly 15 criminals at the frontline. Five minutes ago, they arrived near the village and heard Ye Jian’s gunshot.","G3, who was sliding down the high slope, said to Xia Jinyuan, \"Azure Bird and the other two have probably already taken action. The gunshots are a little chaotic.\"","Han Zheng stared at the location and frowned. He said with uncertainty, \"Their position remains unchanged. It’s hard to judge.\"","Xia Jinyuan looked at the position that had not moved. He climbed up the hill like a cheetah and raised his night-vision binoculars to observe.","Five minutes ago, there were countless lights flashing in the dark village. They could see countless extremists running. Xia Jinyuan narrowed his eyes and quickly slid down the high slope.","Last night, less than 24 hours after the end of one fierce battle, the special forces soldiers welcomed another fierce battle. This was also the first time the intern soldiers of the second battle went overseas to fight.","\"Seal the entrance to the village and block all the exits. The rest of the people will take advantage of the chaos to sneak in and kill everyone they see. It’ll be better to take advantage of the situation. We’ll be able to determine who’s a bandit and who’s a citizen faster.\"","He paused for a moment and said to the intern soldiers who smelled of blood, \"We veterans are better at slitting throats from behind. If we go in now, we can clean up the entire venue. Your performance last night was not bad. I’ll leave the cleanup to you tonight. How about that?\"","The intern soldiers who had carried out two missions in a row nodded, indicating that there was no problem.","An intern soldier raised his question. \"We’ll be fighting in another country now. Q King, aren’t you worried that our whereabouts will be exposed and the border defense of Gistan will be alerted?\""]},{"number":4502,"title":"Chapter 4502: Unable To Escape","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan said calmly, \"When the high-powered screen is turned on, there’ll be no wireless signal within a ten-kilometer radius, and all satellite signals will be intercepted. Also, our soldiers are guarding all the entrances and exits of the village. We’ve also changed our rifles. The bullets are all NATO-made. Besides the camouflage uniform, they can’t find any evidence of Chinese soldiers. Do you think we’ll be exposed if we deploy like this?\"","Since they were infiltrating another country to carry out the rescue, they needed to be well disguised.","Z7 said, \"There’s no problem on my side. I’ve already turned on the high-powered screen. All the satellite signals are intercepted. I’ll guard an opening. Not a mosquito can fly past my eyes.","\"I’ll kill anyone who comes out. No one can escape from me.\" Z7, who was working without raising his head, smiled and said ruthlessly.","G3 smiled and said to the intern soldiers, \"There won’t be any problems here. You just need to focus on returning to the country alive.","\"You’ve been training for more than two years. Your performance last night wasn’t bad. You’ll definitely be able to return to the country alive. Be at ease and take care of those fellows who want to destroy the peace of our country.\" T6, who had been talking to the intern students with a smile, had changed his temperament.","The sniper, E6, looked at the veterans and then at the intern soldiers. He said slowly, \"I’ll guard an opening. In short, the people inside won’t be able to escape even if they have wings.\"","E6 was a man from the Northwest. He could fly helicopters very smoothly. He had thick eyebrows and a knife scar at the end of his left eyebrow. It stretched to the end of his eyebrow. Not only did this not ruin his handsome looks, but it also made him look more unruly and good-looking.","When he suddenly spoke from the corner, the intern special forces soldiers closest to him felt their hearts tighten.","As a sniper, E6 wasn’t used to talking too much outside. If he didn’t speak, he would be even more invisible than K7, who didn’t talk much either. Basically, no one would notice that there was such a person beside them.","This was the highest level of concealment a sniper could achieve.","Hence, when he suddenly spoke, the intern soldiers were so frightened that their hearts skipped a beat.","E6 saw that the intern soldier closest to him, who was about to become his comrade, was frightened by him and apologized in embarrassment, \"I’m sorry. I suddenly wanted to express my opinion and couldn’t control myself.\"","\"Oh, okay, it’s fine.\" The intern soldier didn’t expect this. For a moment, he didn’t know how to reply. He replied dryly with an awkward expression.","E6’s facial features were ordinary. They were well-defined, typical of tough men. He had the typical fearlessness of a Northwestern man. After he finished speaking, he hid in the shadows. His entire body merged with the mountain and the rock, making the intern soldiers’ hearts tighten.","The veterans in the team were all amazing!","When it was time for the combat deployment, Xia Jinyuan divided the 13 veterans in the team. Four veterans guarded a few openings while the rest entered the village and found a high point to guard. The 30 new recruits entered the village in Gistan. After completing this overseas combat, they would become true special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit!","There were dogs in the village. The barking of the dogs made the originally noisy village even more tense. A few extremists rushed out of the ravines and headed toward the village at their fastest speed.","The veterans of the Xueyu unit were the first to move. Right on the heels of that, the intern soldiers entered. This time, they didn’t use rifles to clear the way like last night. Instead, they used pistols and combat daggers with silencers to clear the way.","It was better to keep a low profile when infiltrating another country for combat.","They chose close combat. At the same time, the danger level increased exponentially. There might be cold weapons behind them."]},{"number":4503,"title":"Chapter 4503: Run","paragraphs":["The intern soldiers who went overseas for their first mission brushed shoulders with death several times last night. Although they had some experience, it would be a lie to say that they were not nervous or afraid when facing an overseas mission that might cost them their lives.","Nervousness and fear were the most normal reactions in the face of danger. Everyone had it. No one could escape it. What they needed to do was to overcome their nervousness and fear and complete every mission in the most fearless manner.","Footsteps could be heard everywhere in the restless night, indicating that this small village in Gistan was destined to be restless.","Weaver and White Crane, who were still locked up, also knew what was happening outside.","As expected, Azure Bird ran away with five girls from Gistan.","It was definitely not a problem to escape alone, but it was difficult to escape with five girls.","They had to go out and support Azure Bird.","White Crane whispered his plan to the middle-aged man who wanted to help them escape. At the same time, he also told him who he suspected.","However, the man from Gistan was so shocked that he covered his chest and exclaimed, \"No, no. How is that possible? Are you mistaken?\"","The sound of someone falling to the ground came from outside. Weaver jumped up and stuck close to the iron door. He raised his hand and knocked rhythmically.","Ye Jian knocked back immediately.","She finally found the place!","White Crane said to the man who knew a little Chinese, \"In that case, can you let the two of them lead the way for us?\"","After receiving a reply from her comrades, Ye Jian dragged the door guard to the side. She didn’t manage to find the key, so she didn’t waste any more time. She picked up the replica rifle and slung the rifle she snatched over her shoulder. Then, she aimed the rifle at the iron door and fired three shots. The bullets hit the iron lock and sparks flew.","Since it was already a mess, why not make it even messier? The village was so big. With the three’s skills, they would definitely be able to escape.","The iron lock fell. Ye Jian kicked open the iron door and threw the rifle inside.","\"Be gentle, be gentle. I almost got hit in the head.\"","Weaver, who came out, caught the black shadow head-on. Fortunately, he reacted quickly and reached out to grab it. If not, he would have been hit by the rifle.","It was a little embarrassing for someone who always played with guns to be hit by guns.","The villagers inside were shocked by the scene in front of them. A Chinese woman came over with a rifle. It was so chaotic outside just now. Was it because of the Chinese woman?","It was so sudden that everyone was stunned.","The couple, who had been hiding in a corner and snuggling up to each other while praying for their children, raised their heads as if they couldn’t believe what was happening in front of them.","The middle-aged man, who could speak Mandarin, immediately shouted at the four herdsmen who were kidnapped, \"Run, run! Run! Run with them!\"","They could run now. ’Hurry up and run. Run as far as you can. Don’t look back.’","At this moment, the couple in the corner looked at each other. As if they had thought of something, they suddenly stood up and cried loudly as they rushed over.","Ye Jian and Weaver didn’t understand what the couple was crying about, but White Crane did. He secretly exchanged glances with the middle-aged man from Gistan.","The couple cried and said that they wanted to leave together. They wanted to go out and look for their children. They begged Weaver and the rest to bring them to escape.","\"Bring them along. They can help them escape faster.\"","\"Shamuq can help them escape faster. They can escape together.\""]},{"number":4504,"title":"Chapter 4504: Happy","paragraphs":["The couple’s begging softened the hearts of the other villagers. They felt that they could indeed escape together. They even felt that if they were accidentally caught, Shamuq and his wife could stand up and stop the atrocities outside.","At this point, Weaver and White Crane were certain that their suspicions were correct. The couple had already betrayed them.","Weaver said to Ye Jian, who didn’t know the situation, \"There’s something wrong with the two of them. They snuck in and defected.\"","\"Then let’s bring them along!\"","Hearing this, Ye Jian didn’t hesitate at all. She said to White Crane, \"Let’s bring them along. We’ll deal with them outside.\"","Fortunately, she endured it and didn’t immediately say that she had saved a few girls from Gistan.","\"So brutal!\" Weaver smiled. There was the same brutality in his smile.","White Crane raised his eyebrows. Every time he cooperated with Azure Bird... it was very satisfying.","On the battlefield, Azure Bird didn’t have the emotions of women. She was rational. She was even better at distinguishing between advantages and disadvantages than the male soldiers.","Bringing along Shamuq and his wife was indeed a good idea!","The middle-aged man who could speak Chinese closed his eyes and nodded in agreement.","If... Shamuq was really an accomplice of the people who killed the relatives of the villagers outside, then... it was impossible for the village to keep the couple.","No matter which country it was, the citizens of every country hated the criminals who broke the peace. The villagers of Gistan hated them too.","When the couple saw this, their eyes flickered, and they smiled secretly. They invited the others to escape with them, but they rejected them.","\"Hurry up and leave. Bring them away quickly. Shamuq, please bring them away from here! God will bless you and let you leave safely.\"","After making his decision, the middle-aged man urged the five of them to leave quickly. He reached out and pushed them out of the small cave. \"Follow them and don’t look back! We’ll be fine!\"","These people still needed to stay in the village, so they would be fine. It would be safer to stay here.","The five of them were pushed out of the small cave just like that. The villagers of Gistan held hands tightly and used each other’s strength to ease their nervousness.","\"They’ll definitely escape, right? God will definitely bless them and let them leave safely, right?\"","A kind woman said in a low voice. She clenched her fists and prayed non-stop.","\"This way, go!\"","In front, the couple hunched their waists and urged the three people behind them to follow closely. They were not going in the direction of Tianshan Mountain.","The three of them, who had a strong sense of direction, knew the couple’s intention. They didn’t expose them and let the two of them lead the way.","If they didn’t enter the tiger’s den, how would they catch the tiger?","Since Captain Xia and the rest were already here, they would attack from the outside. The three of them would attack from the inside. They would attack from the front and back and complete the cleanup.","The bullets in the replica rifle were already loaded and could be fired at any time for combat.","The three of them were dressed in casual clothes. Besides the rifles in their hands, they didn’t have any other equipment. They didn’t even have bulletproof vests. They relied on themselves to enter the enemy’s camp to fight.","Seeing that the three people behind them were following closely, the couple strode forward even faster.","The three of them had guns, but the couple didn’t. They had to hand these three to the leader as soon as possible.","As she turned, Ye Jian suddenly saw black shadows sweeping past her left. They were so fast that she couldn’t tell which comrades they were."]},{"number":4505,"title":"Chapter 4505: Cut Off","paragraphs":["The black shadows also noticed the figures running away in front of them. The three special forces soldiers in the dark corner quickly made hand signals. After confirming the plan, the three of them disappeared from the spot like ghosts and rushed in the direction where Ye Jian and the rest went.","The barking of the dog still spread throughout the entire village. The sound of footsteps came and went. Occasionally, a flashlight’s beam would sweep across the night sky. As the people shouted, it shone into various dark corners.","Gunshots came from the other side again. It was the location where Weaver and White Crane were locked up.","The extremists who searched over realized that the other two Chinese people had escaped. They had no choice but to fire their guns again to warn them. Those who were smarter knew that the three Chinese people had not escaped.","Everyone’s attention was on the three people who escaped. As for the Gistan girls who were rescued by Ye Jian, they weren’t important. Their parents were still around. They wouldn’t be able to run far!","The night was even more chaotic. There were still the occasional stray bullets, making this small village in Gistan, which was very close to the Chinese border, be shrouded in a tense atmosphere.","The three special forces soldiers, who Xia Jinyuan called intern soldiers, stuck close to the wall and took deep breaths. It was their turn to attack...","It was three against five.","Shamuq and his wife were about to complete their mission. When they reached a corner, the two of them disappeared like rabbits. Ye Jian and the other two heard the couple shouting.","As for what they were shouting for, White Crane sneered and said to his comrades, \"They’re calling for reinforcements. Comrades, the fierce battle has begun.\"","Before Weaver and Ye Jian could speak, three shadows suddenly attacked with a fierce wind. Weaver whispered, \"F*ck.\" He moved his footsteps and leaned to the left, narrowly avoiding the dagger that stabbed from behind.","Ye Jian grabbed the strong arm tightly and smiled. \"We’re on the same side. My codename is Azure Bird. You must be the intern soldiers of the team.\"","They ended up meeting their own people.","As for Azure Bird... Although more than two years had passed, she had left a deep impression on them. The moment she stepped into the arena, she crushed the soldiers who had entered the Xueyu unit for half a year. They never forgot her and remembered her.","The soldier who tried to kill Ye Jian was No. 16. He was the one who issued the ’challenge’ to Ye Jian back then. His codename had never changed.","Hearing the familiar codename and the female voice, which was a little unfamiliar but also a little familiar, No. 16’s features tightened. He immediately retracted his arm.","It was too dangerous. Just now, he used a killing move. If she didn’t dodge... Azure Bird would’ve been heavily injured even if she didn’t die.","Fortunately, she reacted quickly and was very skilled.","No. 16 retracted his dagger and recalled the scene earlier with lingering fear.","The person who tried to kill Weaver was No. 18. He and No. 16 had been cooperating with each other since they were new recruits. Their tacit understanding had long been formed. He retracted his hand earlier than No. 16. Damn, they had met their own people.","Only White Crane wasn’t stopped. Before No. 26 could do anything, White Crane rushed out to deal with the couple.","The couple shouted at the top of their lungs before being killed by White Crane. His method of killing was very brutal.","Their cervical vertebrae were broken, and they were only left with half a breath. When White Crane turned around and came back, they were no longer breathing."]},{"number":4506,"title":"Chapter 4506: Don’t Worry","paragraphs":["They had to end the battle quickly overseas. Moreover, night attacks were the forte of the Xueyu unit’s special forces.","Weaver smiled at No. 18 and said, \"Not bad. Q King is indeed capable. You guys have improved so quickly in the past few months that Azure Bird and I didn’t even notice the three of you approaching.\"","That was true. Ye Jian saw black shadows just now. Although she knew that they had to be her comrades in the team, she didn’t expect them to discover her, Weaver, and White Crane. They even took the opportunity to sneak over.","Their skills were not bad, and they were extremely well-hidden.","However, Captain Xia clearly told her that the intern soldiers were about to carry out a mission. Before that, they needed to be brought to the border for training. Now that they were going to do it directly... Captain Xia was actually at ease?","Soon, Ye Jian understood why Xia Jinyuan suddenly let the special forces soldiers carry out a mission during their internship. Their reaction speed and actions were top-notch!","What she didn’t know was that the intern soldiers of this combat had already undergone a support mission in the country.","The shouts of the couple alarmed the nearby extremists, especially the leader who had been hiding in the depths. When he heard the shouts outside, he scolded the couple for being stupid and immediately sent people to deal with the three Chinese people.","Hiding in a corner, No. 18 reported their situation to all his comrades through the public channel.","When the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit knew that the three of them had already met Weaver, White Crane, and Azure Bird, they smiled.","They were lucky. There was no need to deliberately look for the three comrades who were ’kidnapped.’","Xia Jinyuan asked No. 26 to pass the wireless communication device to Ye Jian. He needed to talk to Ye Jian, even if it was just to listen to her voice.","The fierce battle started in the middle of the village at the border of Gistan. White Crane fired his first gun. Even though he was holding a replica AK rifle, his first shot accurately hit the head of an extremist. It was a good start.","Ye Jian took over the communication device during the first round of fighting.","\"It’s Azure Bird.\"","Xia Jinyuan and his comrades heard her clear voice.","When Xia Jinyuan heard the familiar voice, a faint smile appeared on his cold face. There was a certain distance between him and Ye Jian after infiltrating the village. If he couldn’t go over, he could only rely on communication.","He smiled and said, \"Fight well. Don’t be too polite.\"","\"I don’t plan to be polite. I’ve already taken care of two of them. I need a couple more comrades sent over. Thanks to a couple of extremists, I accidentally came to their leader. The firepower...\"","As she spoke, No. 26, who was guarding Ye Jian’s back, killed two criminals who rushed in from the back. His back was close to Ye Jian’s back, making Ye Jian, who was on the phone, feel the tension on his back.","This was his first overseas mission, so No. 26, who was on his second actual combat mission, was a little nervous.","Although he was nervous, his hands were very stable. He wasn’t like Ye Jian, whose arms would shake after firing the gun back when she was on her first mission.","\"Well done,\" Ye Jian smiled and said to No. 26. Then, she said to Xia Jinyuan, \"I saved five girls from Gistan. We have to send our comrades to escort them to Tibet.\"","\"Got to the north to the sheep pen.\"","A slightly unfamiliar voice was heard. Ye Jian knew that this was another intern soldier in the team.","Captain Xia was really... too bold. Why did their boss agree to let 30 intern soldiers infiltrate another country to fight?","A total of 46 people, including 30 intern soldiers and 16 veterans, infiltrated the small border village in Gistan. For some reason, Ye Jian thought of the word ’bloodbath.’"]},{"number":4507,"title":"Chapter 4507: No Mercy","paragraphs":["Ye Jian felt a chill on her back. She said in a low voice, \"There are indeed many extremists in the village, but not all of them are criminals. Q King, we can’t...\"","\"Don’t worry, I won’t.\"","Xia Jinyuan guessed what she wanted to say and smiled. \"Let’s clean up some of the guys here and evacuate immediately. This is their country. We can’t be too arrogant.\"","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled. That made sense. She was thinking too much.","The gunshots became more and more concentrated. Ye Jian felt No. 26’s back getting tenser. She ended the call. Before she ended the call, Xia Jinyuan said in a low voice, \"You’re a veteran. Let them learn.\"","This was a disguised reminder to Azure Bird to take care of the special forces soldiers who had come overseas for their first mission.","Actually, Xia Jinyuan didn’t need to remind Ye Jian. Ye Jian would take care of them regardless. As the gunshots became more and more concentrated, Ye Jian raised her gun and fired at two targets consecutively. She leaned against the corner of the wall and asked No. 26, who was fighting close to her back, \"The leader is in this area. The three of you will guard the periphery. Weaver, White Crane, and I will go in and clean up. Can the three of you fight separately? You each have to guard one of the three intersections.\"","\"Yes!\"","No. 26, who was bringing up the rear for Ye Jian, replied calmly, \"Leave it to us. No problem.\"","\"Okay!\"","Ye Jian wasn’t careless. She didn’t have much time to doubt if her comrades could hold on. Since Captain Xia was at ease letting them come out for a mission, she believed in them.","Gunshots came from the center. The extremists, who were still searching, felt their hearts pounding. They quickly realized that it must be the three fleeing Chinese who caused the gunfight.","Realizing that the gunshots were made by the three fleeing Chinese, the scattered extremists started running in one direction and shouting.","\"Quick, hurry up and go to the front! They must be there!\"","\"Don’t let them escape again! Hurry up and surround them!\"","They gathered in one direction. This made it easier for the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit who were in hiding to kill several targets.","They stopped assassinating secretly and found a shooting point. They raised their rifles and fired at the black shadows running with guns.","The special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit would not be soft-hearted when facing extremists who would destroy the peace of the border and even the peace of their country.","The sudden gunshots at a few points in the village stunned the extremists who were running.","What was going on?","What happened? Why were there gunshots in a few places?","\"Something’s gone wrong! Something’s gone wrong!\"","\"Hurry up and inform the leader that soldiers have infiltrated our village!\"","\"This way, they’re shooting here!\"","The village became even more chaotic. Those extremists who thought that they were surrounded by their country’s forces started to escape.","During their escape, a few extremists discovered their companions who were secretly killed and realized that the situation was very disadvantageous to them.","The fierce battle began. The bullets that were fired drew sparks in the darkness and flew in all directions. Some people were shot to death, some fell to the ground and struggled in pain, and some raised their guns to counter-attack in the darkness.","Bang! Bang! Bang! Bang!","The gunshots were no longer sporadic. They were so concentrated that it seemed as if guns could be heard from every corner.","The bullets hit the wall. The bullets dug in and kicked up endless dust. Dust splattered into the eyes. They didn’t even dare to blink, afraid that they would lose their position.","After knowing that there was a ’leader,’ Xia Jinyuan adjusted his combat deployment and brought three veterans into the middle of the village. That was where Ye Jian was. It was also the place with the most concentrated and fiercest firepower on the entire battlefield. He needed to bring troops to support her.","After dealing with the ’leader’ of the village, they would immediately retreat back to their country!"]},{"number":4508,"title":"Chapter 4508: Thunderous","paragraphs":["The intern soldiers who had thrown themselves into the battlefield didn’t have time to be afraid. They raised the rifles in their hands and pulled the triggers again and again.","\"Change magazines, cover!\"","\"Attack from the left and right! Bring up the rear!\"","\"Roger! Advance!\"","\"Left, attack!\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Shoot in front and behind! Advance quickly!\"","On the battlefield, they had no way out. They started to use all the skills they learned during training to fight for their lives and win.","There was no turning back. There was only one path in front of them—fight!","How many people had fought in the past?","The soldiers had already been deployed on the battlefield, and the war drums had already sounded. Even if no one could return, they would still fight!","The bullet that tore through the air with the aura of death brushed past a soldier’s head with a long trail of fire. The tip of his nose seemed to smell gunpowder. He laid down and fired. His entire tactical action was smooth and extremely fierce.","This was the first time the intern soldiers went overseas to fight. They deeply understood the rapid danger of death.","Their hands were covered in sweat. As for their bodies... Needless to say, their sweat had already drenched their helmet bands. Their entire bodies were almost drenched.","Lying on the dusty ground, the counter-attack from the front made it impossible for them to raise their heads. The intern special forces soldier with the codename 26 lowered his head tightly. The tip of his nose was pressed against the ground, and his breathing was filled with dust.","\"Lie down! Don’t look up!\"","Azure Bird’s clear voice came from beside him. It was very stable, and there was no panic. It was as if she was not facing a rain of guns but blank cartridges used for training, where there was definitely no lethality within a certain range.","She was too calm, so calm that she was no different from a veteran who had experienced hundreds of battles.","No. 26, who felt the bullets brushing past him, wanted to ask her if she often carried out similar missions, which was why she wasn’t afraid at all.","If he remembered correctly, Azure Bird was still a freshman when she took down 30 of their male soldiers. She was still a military school student now.","As a military school student, how could she remain calm in the face of bullets that brushed past her head?","No. 26, who was lying on the ground with a bitter smile on his face, was thinking about something randomly. He felt that he needed to find something to think about. If not... he would feel a little scared when he heard the sound of bullets.","Every day, he thought about going to the battlefield and fighting with real enemies. Every day, he thought that he would definitely be a peerless hero on the battlefield. He thought about it every day, even in his dreams.","However, when he really went to the battlefield, he realized that the so-called hero dream was just a daydream.","There were no dreams of being a hero on the battlefield. They were only thinking about how to defeat their enemies and how to return alive.","Now, he finally understood why his captain said that these intern soldiers who had never been on the battlefield and had never really killed enemies were not qualified to call him ’Captain’.","He understood that only soldiers who had been on the battlefield would know how difficult it was to live.","The firepower was still very strong. It was so strong that Ye Jian, Weaver, and White Crane were knocked down by the dense bullets. Weaver and White Crane were together. Behind them were the two intern soldiers. Ye Jian and No. 26 were on the other side of Weaver and White Crane. The three groups of people were in a triangle formation.","18 or 16 people were guarding the two openings. When they realized that the extremists were fumbling over from behind, they raised the rifles in their hands and fired a series of bullets at the black shadows that were running over. Instantly, several muffled sounds of people falling to the ground could be heard. Three extremists fell. A few of them hurriedly hid in a corner and raised their guns to return fire."]},{"number":4509,"title":"Chapter 4509: Firepower","paragraphs":["The two of them brought up the rear. No. 26, who was in charge of the other point, was with Ye Jian now. They were suppressed by the two firepower points in front of them.","If they didn’t move, Weaver and White Crane, who were already in deep combat, would be in danger.","Ye Jian tightened her grip on the replica rifle in her hand and whispered to the motionless No. 26, \"We need to take care of two firepower points in one direction. Cover me.\"","\"I’ll count to three. Shoot blindly at the two firepower points in one direction. Remember not to raise your head. Just shoot blindly the entire time!\"","Hearing this, Number 26’s heart skipped a beat. However, he couldn’t raise his head. He said in a tense voice, \"The bullets are so dense. How can we charge?!\"","Rushing out like this... was no different from courting death!","That was what he thought, but he didn’t dare to say it out loud.","Ye Jian smiled and said casually, \"That’s why I need your firepower suppression. You have a No. 95 automatic rifle in your hand. The performance of your continuous shooting is not bad. You suppress the other party, and I’ll jump forward.\"","Ye Jian’s combat plan made No. 26’s heart tense up even more. Azure Bird would jump in, and he would suppress... No. 26 felt uncomfortable.","\"However, I have to ask you. Do you have the confidence to suppress the other side for me? I won’t have the time to shoot during my leap. I’ll have to rely on you. Do you have the confidence?\" Ye Jian asked him again. Although it was a question, her tone was filled with trust.","Did he have the confidence?","Yes!","Of course!","No. 26 gritted his teeth and replied in a deep voice, \"I have no problems! Leave it to me!\"","\"Okay! One, two, three...\"","As soon as she finished counting down, Ye Jian jumped forward like a struggling spring. No. 26 was suppressing the other side with firepower. Not only did he attract the firepower in front of him, but he also used the bullets to suppress the extremists in front so that they had to lie down.","Ye Jian jumped three times in a row when the other party’s bullets were interrupted. It was so dangerous that the stray bullets brushed past her arm and entered the shooting point she had her eyes on.","No. 26 ended his shooting. The firepower in front shot straight at the corner of the wall where No. 26 was.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Dense bullets made grooves in the corner of the wall. In less than a minute, a bowl-sized gap was made. A thick layer of dust had already fallen on No. 26’s body.","After about two minutes, No. 26 clearly felt that the firepower in one direction had weakened. It was so weak that he could raise his head and change his shooting position.","The trembling voice of No. 17 came from the ear piece. \"How’s the situation on your side?\"","He entered the communication channel and hugged his rifle as he rushed from the corner of the wall to the place Azure Bird pointed out. He panted heavily before he had the time to answer, \"The situation isn’t good. I think we touched the center of the nest. The firepower was the strongest. Just now...\"","He panted heavily and wiped his eyes that were covered in sweat. His voice was so dry that it seemed to have the smell of gunpowder. \"Just now, Azure Bird attacked and took down two firepower points in two minutes. That’s how I managed to escape.\"","As he spoke, No. 26 smiled bitterly. \"Brother, the battlefield... is really not a joke. I could lose my life just like that. My hands trembled when I fired my first bullet.\"","\"It’s the same for me. My hands are still trembling. Just now... Phew...\" No. 17 panted heavily. He had just ended a fierce battle. Now... he was only ten feet away from the corpse of an extremist he had killed. Other than the thick smoke of gunpowder, he could also smell the smell of blood and rust that made him nauseous.","\"Just now, No. 19 and I took care of three criminals from the Republic of Gistan. Now, the two of us are lying beside the corpses.\""]},{"number":4510,"title":"Chapter 4510: Getting Braver","paragraphs":["One could imagine the psychological pressure if they stayed with the criminals they killed.","No. 19 was even supporting himself in a pool of blood. Blood seeped through the camouflage fabric. No. 19 could feel how thick and sticky the blood was.","The 30 intern soldiers who entered the village each had their own combat positions. They completed the peripheral encirclement and provided cover and support to their comrades who went deep into the combat.","No. 26, No. 18, and No. 16 guarded the battlefield with the most concentrated firepower. Xia Jinyuan, who had brought his soldiers to support them, rushed over with a dark expression. He was going toward the three intern soldiers who had been fighting till their hearts were beating like drums. The more they fought, the braver they would become. The more they fought, the less afraid they would be.","\"No. 18, position!\"","Even his voice was cold and sharp through the earpieces. No. 18 immediately reacted and told him the location.","\"How are the other three?\" Xia Jinyuan asked again.","He couldn’t contact Ye Jian, White Crane, and Weaver. He could only find out through the three intern soldiers.","No. 26 replied, \"Azure Bird will take care of two firepower points and cover Weaver and White Crane as they enter the combat. No. 18, No. 16, and I will guard the rear. Although the firepower is dense now, it’s all within control.\"","Knowing that this was their first overseas combat, Ye Jian and the other two didn’t dare to let them attack together. They just needed to guard the back and not let the three of them fall behind.","Xia Jinyuan looked at the direction. He was definitely not far away.","Gunshots kept echoing in the sky. The veterans of the Xueyu unit, who were experienced in combat, gathered all the extremists in one direction, away from the safe zone.","Mobile combat in another country was a huge matter, especially when it was done without other countries knowing. It had to be resolved as soon as possible.","Xia Jinyuan, G3, and K7 rushed over from the left. On the right, there were intern soldiers attacking with firepower. They smashed into the mud house where the leader was.","In the mud house, the leader was around 40 years old. He was wearing a black cap and traditional local clothes as he sat on a gorgeous wool felt blanket. He closed his eyes and listened to the dense gunshots outside. There was no panic on his face.","He kept muttering something. They didn’t know what he was saying. Kneeling in front of him were two extremists, who were also wearing the traditional clothes of Gistan. Like the leader, they were muttering something under their breath as well.","As the gunshots became more and more intense, the leader raised his hand and said in a sinister and cold voice, \"Go, our brave warriors.\"","The two kneeling people prostrated again as if they had completed a baptism. It was a solemn action, but there was a cold and trembling viciousness.","As they got up, red dots flashed in their wide traditional clothes—suicide bombs.","The two of them got up and walked out. They didn’t walk out. Instead, they walked into a room. They didn’t come out after entering.","This was a room with a pointed roof and round earth walls. Although the walls were mottled and peeling, it was the largest private residence in the entire village. There were earth walls around it. The people outside couldn’t see inside, and the people inside couldn’t see outside either.","There were people guarding the four walls. Because they occupied the high walls, Ye Jian and the rest had a hard time attacking. They couldn’t break through the walls even after a few strong attacks. Now that reinforcements had arrived, the three of them could retreat to the side.","\"Let’s take a break. Our comrades are here.\"","Weaver lay beside Ye Jian. He was sweating profusely. He raised his hand to wipe his sweat. He was wearing a short-sleeved shirt, and his arms were sweating too. However, the more he wiped, the more sweat there was. In the end, he simply lifted his clothes, revealing his strong abdomen, to wipe his sweat."]},{"number":4511,"title":"Chapter 4511: Suppression","paragraphs":["With the cover of the night, Ye Jian couldn’t see anything. When she wiped her clothes, there were gray sweat stains. After wiping them, she continued lying down and waited for White Crane to come over.","As the two of them spoke in low voices, White Crane’s voice came from outside. Right on the heels of that, two rifles were thrown over from the other side of the wall. The two of them, who had been staring at the sky and waiting for White Crane to come over, saw the shape clearly under the hazy starlight. The two of them rushed out and took the guns.","Guns and backpacks were thrown over. They were tactical vests and wireless communication.","The two of them took the rifles and hugged their backpacks tightly. Without saying anything, they quickly organized their equipment.","When White Crane climbed over the wall, the two of them were still tidying up their equipment.","\"The target location is high, and the firepower is fierce. We’ll attack directly by throwing out bombs.\" White Crane, who had climbed over the wall, didn’t even catch his breath. He first told the two of them the situation outside. \"We’ll attack the firepower at the back door and kill the leader at the front. Then, we’ll retreat immediately.\"","Ye Jian, who was wearing her wireless communication equipment and adjusting the channel, said, \"It’s been half an hour. The gunshots are loud. I’m afraid they’ve alerted the border defense sentinels of Gistan.\"","\"Yes, let’s end this quickly.\"","After White Crane finished speaking, the gunshots outside seemed to be even more intense. According to the rules of combat time, they had to complete their mission in an hour. Now, half an hour had passed. It was time to end the retreat.","More and more extremists were killed. Blood stained the dusty ground in several places. The rushed footsteps left deep and big shoe prints.","\"Someone is coming out...\"","When the veterans guarding the periphery saw the armed extremists trying to escape, they aimed at their vital points and pulled the trigger without hesitation.","The veterans of the Xueyu unit were guarding outside. They were sensitive to the battlefield and would not be careless when they needed to shoot. These people would definitely not be able to escape. The soldiers were afraid that they would enter China’s territory.","As for the villagers of Gistan, they shrunk their bodies when they heard the endless gunshots. Their eyes were filled with fear.","They didn’t know what was happening outside. The gunshots made them so frightened that they prostrated on the ground and kept praying. The young children were carried by adults. Their eyes were wide open, and they didn’t know what was happening outside. The young children who were still learning how to speak were coaxed by their young mothers. Their cries were low and high at times before they fell asleep...","The darkness hadn’t passed. Everything was still going on.","White Crane jumped over the wall and landed on the ground on his heels. Ye Jian, who was at the back, jumped down the wall last. As she landed, Ye Jian felt a heart-wrenching pain in her back. She didn’t stop and rushed out with her gun.","No. 16, No. 18, and No. 26, who were in charge of receiving, walked in the middle. The six of them focused their firepower on the attack point.","Bang, bang, bang!","The continuous gunshots made their eardrums ring. The special forces soldiers were already used to it. They aimed and fired continuously.","\"Firepower suppression at the back door!\"","Xia Jinyuan’s cold voice came from the earpieces. The dense sound of bullets from the back door instantly turned into a rain of bullets. The fire-colored trajectory of the bullets could actually light up a corner of the back door.","\"Suppress, I’ll jump forward!\"","The assaulter, Weaver, tightened his rifle. His back was hunched like a large beast waiting for an opportunity to move. His cold and sharp eyes stared at the corner in front of him. Then, he looked at a concave corner diagonally opposite the corner. He needed to rush to the concave corner to complete his shooting.","Hearing that, the three intern soldiers pulled the trigger until their fingers almost spasmed.","In such a situation, the probability of getting hit was quite high!"]},{"number":4512,"title":"Chapter 4512: Ending","paragraphs":["However, they had to restrain the firepower and provide an opportunity for their comrades in front to attack. They had no choice but to do so!","\"Okay, leave it to us. Be careful.\"","The cold female voice reached everyone’s ears. There was no dissuasion, only cover.","Weaver placed his life in the hands of his comrades. The comrades protecting him had to be protected as well. On the battlefield, they were comrades who could entrust their lives to each other.","The eyes of the extremists hiding on the wall were bloodshot. They didn’t know who these people who infiltrated the village were. They had been living here with their leader for more than half a year. Even the company’s military didn’t find them. However, something happened to the three Chinese people who they kidnapped tonight.","The special forces soldiers, including Xia Jinyuan, didn’t know who the leader of the extremists was. If they knew, they would be shocked.","The leader of this invisible place was the leader of the largest extremist corporation in Gistan. Half a year ago, he was surrounded by the military of Gistan and had no choice but to escape from the second-largest city in Gistan to the border between Gistan and China. He planned to enter China’s territory.","Now, his hiding place had been destroyed again. The battle this time was even more ferocious than the encirclement last time. The leader sitting in the house wasn’t as calm as before.","With the cover of firepower at various points, Weaver forcefully jumped in. A few smoke bombs were thrown out from the front door. Under the cover of smoke and firepower suppression, K7, G3, and Xia Jinyuan rushed out in a few seconds...","At the same time, No. 17, who was guarding a point in the village, noticed a dark shadow passing by. He confirmed that he wasn’t seeing things. Someone had indeed walked past quickly.","\"We’ve discovered something. An unknown target has appeared. An unknown target has appeared... We’re moving toward the east.\"","The entire combat area was divided into the east, west, north, and south combat areas. The east area was where Weaver and White Crane were locked up.","\"Roger that. Roger that. East side copy that.\"","The intern soldier in charge of guarding the east side immediately replied. His finger, which had been on the trigger, curled up slightly as he looked around with a sharp gaze.","Boom... Boom...","An explosion sounded. In the flames, Ye Jian heard screams coming from the high wall.","Xia Jinyuan, G3, and K7 successfully threw their grenades over the high wall that had been difficult to take down. The three grenades were thrown in at the same time. The power was so great that the ground shook.","\"Break the door!\"","Bang!","As the grenades detonated, several special forces soldiers surged up from the dark and broke through the door at the fastest speed to kill the remaining extremists.","The huge explosion made the extremists, who were still stubbornly resisting, look up. When they saw the location of the explosion, they let out furious roars that made their eyes almost pop out.","That was the place where their leader lived. It was the sacred ground that received the blessings of God. Now, it had been blown up! It had been blown up!","\"Kill them. We must kill them!\"","\"Warriors, rush out with me and kill them! Kill them all!\"","The destruction of the sacred ground made the remaining people completely lose their minds and shoot crazily in all directions.","An intern soldier slowly adjusted his aim until the red light hit a vital spot. He pulled the trigger calmly.","Another extremist was eliminated. The bullet passed through his back and through his heart before bursting out of his chest. There was no chance of survival for the extremist whose heart had been shattered.","The extremists who were trying to run toward the ’sacred ground’ fell to the ground one after another. The smell of blood in the pungent smoke became stronger and stronger, and the chaotic gunshots gradually weakened... The fierce battle was coming to an end."]},{"number":4513,"title":"Chapter 4513: Danger","paragraphs":["A sweating extremist who had one leg hit by shrapnel rushed out of the room and shouted.","After exhaling twice, he realized that there was no one in the room. The short tables placed on the carpet were overturned, and the cups and bowls on them were rolled all over the floor. The person sitting on the carpet had disappeared.","The extremist was stunned for a moment. An incredulous expression gradually appeared on his rough face. As his footsteps became chaotic, he picked up his gun and strode into the room inside.","There was no sign of him either.","The leader who once said that he would live and die with all the warriors was gone. The extremist turned around and rushed out of the room with a furious expression. The moment his figure appeared at the door, he was greeted by a few bullets that were fired at the same time.","Bang... Bang...","Three bullets were fired at his chest and abdomen. The extremist holding the gun in his hand was stunned. He fell to the ground angrily.","Outside, dozens of corpses lay on the ground. Blood flowed like a river.","After a round of fierce battle, Ye Jian, who had relaxed a little, laid on the wall and stared at her surroundings with a torch-like gaze in case someone sneak attacked her.","The special forces soldiers who barged in quickly controlled the entire event location. K7, G3, and Xia Jinyuan, who entered the rooms to search, didn’t find the so-called ’leader’. They searched several rooms but couldn’t find him.","\"The leader might have escaped. Keep an eye on the outside. If you notice anything, shoot. Azure Bird, cover our retreat.\"","Ye Jian replied, \"Roger that.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t manage to catch the so-called leader. He didn’t search anymore. Instead, he led his troops and retreated.","The commotion they caused was extraordinary. In order to avoid trouble, they should leave as soon as possible.","Ye Jian, who was outside, heaved a sigh of relief when she heard that. The attack was completed. There were no casualties among their team.","They didn’t find the leader. He might have been killed... or he might still be alive.","No. 17 noticed a black shadow passing by. As he reported, he gestured to No. 19, indicating for him to follow and keep an eye on them.","No. 19, who was following closely behind, didn’t notice any more black shadows. However, he saw two figures, one tall and one thin, appearing from an unknown corner.","No. 19 had already aimed at the taller figure. Bang...","The single shot hit the vital point. It was clean and neat, not giving the other party a chance to live.","When the taller figure saw this, he suddenly raised his hand and buckled it around his waist. He took a deep breath and aimed at No. 19 with one eye, preparing to shoot again.","Suddenly, No. 17’s anxious and shocked voice was heard.","\"Shoot! Shoot!\"","\"Detonate the equipment!\"","\"Shoot!\"","\"Retreat, retreat, retreat!\"","The sound was like a war drum, but No. 19 only heard the first few sentences. Then, a huge explosion was heard. No. 19’s eardrums were shaken as if thousands of bees were drilling into them. His mind was blank on the spot, and he was stunned.","Urgent questions came from the channel. No. 17’s voice was hoarse. \"19! 19! Are you f*cking alive? Answer me!\"","\"Stop shouting! Shut up! What’s going on inside? Make a sound!\" Outside, Z7 stared intently at the village. It was obvious that it was a suicide explosion just now. They had a chance to kill the guy directly, but the bomb was detonated because of a wrong judgment.","No. 19... Nothing should happen to that kid!","Xia Jinyuan, who was retreating, had a dark expression on his face. It was as if hail was about to fall. \"No. 19, please answer if you hear me. If you hear me, please answer!\""]},{"number":4514,"title":"Chapter 4514: Kill The Fish And Leave","paragraphs":["The explosion had already passed. No. 19, who was so shocked that his eardrums seemed to be pierced, vaguely heard his comrades shouting anxiously. The sounds were a little distant and empty. They seemed to come from the horizon or from the depths of the ground.","\"I-I’m fine...\"","It took him a Herculean effort to answer vaguely. Even though it was just two words, it made the special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit heave a sigh of relief.","Xia Jinyuan closed his eyes lightly. When he opened them again, his eyes were cold. He asked, \"Did you kill an extremist just now?\"","It was a question and an affirmation.","\"Yeah.\"","No. 19, whose brain was still buzzing, replied that he was the closest to the explosion point and the worst affected. The greatest blessing was that he found a good shooting position and fired without hesitation when he discovered the target. The powerful detonation equipment didn’t enter the range that could kill him. At this moment, other than being stunned until his mind went blank, he didn’t even have any external injuries.","\"Not bad. You saved yourself.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who had never praised an intern soldier in public, praised No. 19 on the battlefield for the first time.","No. 19, who was praised, blinked hard. He slowly retracted his rifle. Everyone could hear his laughter through their earpieces.","When the team members heard his slightly silly laughter, their hearts, which had been in their throats, gradually returned to their original positions.","Just now... when No. 17 was asking if No. 19 was alive, the air among them froze. A huge rock smashed into their hearts. Everyone’s hearts seemed to have stopped beating.","They were always one step away from being sacrificed. They could talk one second, but in the next, they could separate.","\"Retreat, retreat! Everyone, retreat! Starting from the center point, cover and guard the periphery!\"","\"Roger that, Roger that!\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Retreat, retreat!\"","The special forces soldiers who felt the wave of suicide bombs wiped their sweat and quickly retreated from every corner.","Xia Jinyuan, whose back was drenched in cold sweat, sighed at Ye Jian, who was leaving with him. \"Bringing them is many times more worrying than bringing you to the battlefield. It’s so much easier to bring you to the battlefield. As for them, I suspect that I’ll go bald in advance.\"","The originally tense atmosphere was completely ruined by his words. Ye Jian couldn’t help but laugh.","The image of a ’bald’ Xia Jinyuan appeared in her mind. That scene was too eye-catching. Ye Jian was so frightened that she quickly shook her head and threw the image out of her mind.","\"There are many of them. And of course, they’re worried. However, they’re much stronger than me. The first time I used a gun to kill my enemies, my entire body was shaking. They can still fight. They’re much stronger than me.\"","Ye Jian, who was drenched in sweat, followed him closely and retreated out of the entrance to a village.","At the outermost area, E6, who had been lying on the ground for almost an hour without moving, suddenly moved. There was finally movement in the position he was in charge of keeping an eye on.","Someone appeared on the uneven ground. He was very vigilant and just revealed his eyes. He stood still and carefully observed his surroundings.","He thought that his escape was successful. There was even a sinister and proud smile on his face.","This place had been discovered. He had to leave this place and go to another place.","E6 slowly adjusted his aim and locked onto his target. He turned on his earpiece and said calmly, \"You haven’t caught the leader? Then I think there’s a big fish on my side.\"","\"Kill the fish and leave immediately.\" Xia Jinyuan, who was about to retreat to the edge of the village, leaned against the uneven wall. In the night, he stared around with sharp eyes. He held his gun in one hand and signaled his comrades to evacuate with the other."]},{"number":4515,"title":"Chapter 4515: Follow Me","paragraphs":["He and Ye Jian were in charge of bringing up the rear. They alternated with K7 and G3 to cover the retreat of the intern soldiers.","\"Roger that,\" E6 said calmly. He stared at the target in front of him who was starting to reveal more than just half his head. White Crane fired the first shot in the fierce battle while E6 fired the last shot.","The trigger was pulled, and the bottom of the bullet was ignited. The bullet fired from the gun barrel dragged the tail of the fire, tearing the air outside into two and heading straight for the target.","Bang!","The half of the head that appeared was blown up. A faint smell of blood wafted to E6’s nose as the night wind blew. He continued to lie on his stomach, motionless as if he had melted into the night.","After the last shot was made, the small village at the border of Gistan finally regained its peace. Outside, the four herdsmen who were rescued grabbed the hands of the special forces soldier who was in charge of protecting them as they left the village. They were so excited that they didn’t know what to say.","The wind from Tianshan Mountain blew past the village at the border of Gistan. It blew away the smoke that enveloped the village, but it couldn’t blow away the strong smell of blood.","The special forces soldiers retreated out of the village and cleaned up the dead extremists.","The wind blew, and the stars in the sky were still shining brightly. As time passed, there was movement in the quiet border village. The villagers of Gistan slowly walked out...","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit, who were walking from the village to the frontline, saw the fire at the foot of the mountain. It was a fire that was made from pouring oil on dry grass. As soon as the sparks touched it, it started burning. The fire lit up a wide area. They could even see the roofs of the surrounding rooms.","\"Not a bad idea,\" T6 said with a smile. His voice could be heard on the channel.","V8 said calmly, \"If we don’t leave now, the pursuers will be here soon.\"","It would take three hours to return to the border from the village. They had to hurry.","The low laughter of the team members came from the channel. The intern soldiers were the loudest.","There was not much communication between them anymore. The group of 46 people made use of the time to return to their country.","The 46 special forces soldiers crossed the steel bridge of the Ukersh River at 1:36 am. At 1:38 am, all the members crossed the bridge. No one was sacrificed.","The 30 intern soldiers from the Xueyu unit finally felt that they were on solid ground. They didn’t feel like they had gone overseas to fight.","They didn’t rest and continued moving forward. When they were about to reach the border defense company, Xia Jinyuan gave an order. Everyone could finally sit down and rest.","After three consecutive days and two nights of non-hibernation mobile combat, the physical fitness of the special forces soldiers, including the veterans, had reached their limits. After sitting down, none of them wanted to get up.","The 30 intern soldiers sat together while the 16 veterans sat together. Ye Jian didn’t sit down immediately. Instead, she whispered to Xia Jinyuan, \"Help me treat the wound on my back. I jumped down from the high wall and was scratched by a sharp stone.\"","Xia Jinyuan turned on the miniature flashlight in his hand, and the expression on his handsome face changed.","\"Follow me.\" He bit his cheek and didn’t say anything else. He held Ye Jian’s hand and walked away.","The tired comrades weren’t paying much attention. Only E6, who was closest to them, looked up and glanced at their interlocked hands. Although he found it a little strange, he didn’t think too much about it.","The intern soldiers were resting. Most of the veterans sized them up. Some veterans reminded them to treat their abrasions in time to avoid inflammation.","They would definitely get some abrasions. The veterans’ reminded them to check their own injuries first. If they couldn’t reach their wounds, they should ask their comrades to help them."]},{"number":4516,"title":"Chapter 4516: Raising A Daughter","paragraphs":["E6 slowly wiped the rifle in his hand and looked at them. He turned his head and said to Z7 beside him, \"They can graduate now. Their performance is not bad.\"","\"There are no cowards among the soldiers trained by Q King.\" Z7 smiled and sighed. \"Q King’s painstaking efforts weren’t in vain. They can all go out to carry out missions now. In the future, they won’t be intern soldiers anymore. They’ll be comrades who’ll fight alongside us.\"","\"Why do I feel like we’re watching our daughter grow up? Is there something wrong with me?\"","\"You’re sick. They’re of a different gender. But we do have a daughter who just grew up... Azure Bird.\" E6 raised his chin and leaned toward Z7 with his clean 95 rifle. He looked at the two elegant figures not far away and whispered, \"Look in front. Our captain brought Azure Bird out single-handedly. We all say that he acts like he’s raising his daughter. Now that Azure Bird can fight alone, should we interview the captain later on how he’s feeling?\"","Raising a daughter... The captain acting like a father.","Z7, who had witnessed how his comrade and friend, Xia Jinyuan, wooed Azure Bird, tried his best to hold back his laughter. He said seriously, \"It’s feasible. We’ll ask later.\"","At that time, Little Six would probably vomit blood. Raising a daughter and acting like a father. That was like saying Azure Bird was a child bride and he was an old man!","Z7 would like to watch the show. When the time came, the ’old father’ would definitely have colorful expressions on his face. It would be very lively!","Ye Jian didn’t know that she had become the daughter raised by Lieutenant Colonel Xia. She didn’t know that the awkward moment would become a good opportunity for Xia Jinyuan to announce their relationship.","After treating his elbow injury, Z7 put away his sanitary bag and smiled at E6. \"Let’s go and talk to Azure Bird. I haven’t chatted with her in a long time. I miss her.\"","\"What do you want to do? Are you planning something bad?\" E6 stared at Z7 vigilantly. \"Put away your tricks. If you dare to have ulterior motives toward Azure Bird, be careful of our fists.\"","E6, who didn’t like to talk in front of outsiders and had a weaker presence than K7, ’warned’ his comrade.","It couldn’t be helped. Z7 was the best at coaxing people in the entire brigade. He had as many girlfriends as the total number of his comrades.","Azure Bird was the only female soldier in the team. E6 was really worried that one day, Azure Bird would be coaxed by this bastard’s sweet words.","After chatting for a few nights, everyone raised their fists and warned Z7. They even warned Z7 that he had to stay three meters away from Azure Bird. Even if he had something to communicate with her, he had to be accompanied by his comrades.","Z7, who was amused by E6’s expression, raised his eyebrows and revealed a flirtatious smile. \"I’m not doing anything. I don’t have any bad ideas. I just want to chat with Azure Bird.\"","E6 looked at him in disbelief. \"You’re a little scheming. It’s definitely not as simple as just chatting with Azure Bird. Tell me, do you want to harm Azure Bird?\"","Z6 really just wanted to chat with Azure Bird. He didn’t have any other thoughts.","How dare he touch Little Six’s woman? No, he really didn’t dare to. He still wanted to live for a few more years!","Facing his comrade’s doubts, Z7 felt that it was necessary to clear his name. \"Do you think our captain will let me off if I want to do anything to Azure Bird? Will you let me off? Do you think I’m tired of living and want to harm Azure Bird under your noses?","\"I really don’t have the guts, and I’ve never had that thought! Also, Weaver and White Crane are both here. What else do you think I can do?\"","E6 thought for a moment. That made sense. With Q King around and a group of their comrades guarding Azure Bird, Z7 wouldn’t dare to do anything to her."]},{"number":4517,"title":"Chapter 4517: Like The Sun","paragraphs":["After taking a few steps, E6 suddenly sighed. \"Do you think Azure Bird will be won over by any one of our comrades in the future? Which bastard will be so lucky?","\"If someone in our team really snatches Azure Bird away, we’ll take turns beating him up!\"","Z7 sized up his comrade who really dared to say it. He nodded and agreed seriously, \"That’s right, that’s right. We have to take turns beating him up. At that time, whoever doesn’t dare to beat him up will be a coward!\"","As for which ’bastard’ was going to be beaten up, Z7, who always liked to join in the fun, didn’t dare to say it. He was afraid that he would be beaten up by the fellow who snatched Azure Bird away to be his wife.","His strong desire to live told him that he could provoke anyone but Little Six!","Xia Jinyuan had already treated Ye Jian’s wound. The moment the two of them walked out, they saw Z7 and E6 walking toward them.","The four of them punched each other’s fists. Z7 smiled and said to Ye Jian, \"Kidnapping you was the biggest mistake in their lives. Even the secret service has to thank the three of you.\"","Ye Jian had been in the military for many years. Besides getting kidnapped when saving Zhou Yijin, she never thought that she would be kidnapped one day. However, the three of them were the ones who were willing to be kidnapped.","\"I didn’t expect it either. It’s a different feeling,\" Ye Jian replied with a smile. Under the faint starlight, her picturesque eyes seemed to be painted with the best brush. Every stroke was beautiful. Every frown and smile was like the bright sun. There was no gloominess after the battle.","No. 26 whispered to his comrade beside him, \"Azure Bird is very powerful. When I was cooperating with her earlier, she was as calm as a veteran. I was a little afraid at first, but when I saw her like that, I wasn’t afraid anymore.\"","\"Are you saying that she has already carried out missions like what we went through today many times like the veterans?\" No. 25 glanced at Ye Jian quickly and said in a low voice, \"That’s not right. She’s still studying.\"","\"It’s not in compliance with the rules, but it’s not against the rules. Look at her, then look at the ten of us. We can know at a glance if it’s the first time she carried out a similar mission.\"","No. 26 was the only intern soldier who cooperated with Ye Jian in combat. He was the only one who saw Ye Jian kill the enemy at a close distance. All these made him believe his judgment.","\"Look at the veterans’ attitude toward Azure Bird and the way they speak. We can actually see some clues. Previously, we thought that Azure Bird got in through the back door just to train in the team like last time. We were actually wrong.","\"Azure Bird doesn’t need to use any backdoors. She’s a member of the Xueyu unit. She’s comrades with the veterans. She kills enemies and trains with them.\"","With No. 26’s analysis, the other intern soldiers gradually fell silent.","After a few seconds of silence, No. 18 said, \"No. 26’s analysis is correct. I also think that Azure Bird is a special forces soldier in the brigade. With Azure Bird’s ability, she doesn’t need to get in through the back door at all.","\"Q King and the veterans have all said it themselves. No one in the team can compare to Azure Bird’s shooting and sniping skills. With such skills, does she need to get in through the back door?","\"Besides, what’s the use of getting in through the back door? Who’s willing to get in through the back door? This isn’t a place where you can muddle along. The veterans fight with their lives to get their military ranks. How could those who want to muddle along get in through the back door and come to our unit? Do they want to die?\"","Previously, most of the intern soldiers were more or less put off by Ye Jian’s appearance. In addition, they didn’t know Ye Jian well and hadn’t fought together. They didn’t see her as their comrade. They even secretly wondered if Ye Jian had used the back door to sneak into the Xueyu unit."]},{"number":4518,"title":"Chapter 4518: No Need","paragraphs":["Now that they were analyzing, it was like the fog was cleared and they could see the moon again.","That was right.","The Xueyu unit wasn’t a military unit that could be promoted just by fooling around. Those who really wanted to fool around wouldn’t get in through the back door.","Even if she wanted to die, she wouldn’t be able to sneak in.","Since she didn’t get in through the back door, Azure Bird relied on her own strength to enter the team and become a qualified special forces soldier.","They vaguely heard the voices of a few veterans. They looked up and saw the veterans bowing slightly in unison because of Azure Bird’s height, including their captain.","That inadvertent action allowed them to see the veterans’ tolerance for Azure Bird and their admiration.","Even the veterans respected Azure Bird. Did she still need to get in through the back door?","There was no need for that!","Back then, she was the one who wiped out 30 top soldiers from the various military units. Did Azure Bird still need to get in through the back door?","There was no need for that!","\"She’s much stronger than us. That’s why the veterans admire her. Look at us. We don’t even dare to get close to the fire. As for her, she carried the corpses with us just now. Her movements were more agile than ours. This shows that her mental fortitude is much stronger than ours.\"","\"Stop saying that Azure Bird got in through the back door. It’s embarrassing.\"","After No. 26 finished speaking, the intern soldiers around him fell silent.","The night at the border was very quiet. It was so quiet that they could hear the breathing of their comrades around them. Some of the intern soldiers who received the recognition of the veterans sat quietly while others lay flat and rested. Although their facial expressions were relaxed, there was still a hint of post-war emotions in the depths of their eyes.","This was the first time they killed enemies. This was the first time their hands were stained with blood. This was the first time they saw dead bodies lying beside them. This was the first time they stepped on the bloodstained ground. This was the first time they faced death directly... All these first experiences brought them countless emotions.","Ye Jian sat down and looked at them. She seemed to see herself in the past.","She sighed softly and said to the veteran who emitted the faint smell of iodine, \"They’re a little similar to me in the past, but they’re many times stronger than me in the past.","\"When I faced death directly for the first time, I was very calm and didn’t think too much about it. However, I had nightmares for several nights before I slowly recovered.","After all, she was a special forces soldier who had undergone systematic training. Back then, when she was studying and training, she was a little stunned when she went to the battlefield.","Although they were silent now, they didn’t feel lost because they knew what they were doing.","Z7 looked at the intern soldiers sitting far away. There was only a faint light from the fire. He didn’t agree with Ye Jian. \"Back then, you were very powerful. Your first appearance stunned us.\"","\"That’s right. The first time we worked together was in Tongzhou. At that time, I was still wondering if you could do it or not. I didn’t want you to be a burden. Reality proved that I made a huge mistake. You were so good that my jaw almost dropped.\"","White Crane recalled their first cooperation back then. It was still fresh in his memory. \"After I came back, I told Pigeon and the others. They didn’t believe me and thought that I was making up a story to tease them.","Speaking of working with Ye Jian for the first time, more than ten veterans had endless things to say. Now that the intern soldiers were on guard, it felt good for them to sit and chat.","After reporting the news of their return to the country, Xia Jinyuan walked over and saw the veterans chatting with his girlfriend. He strode over and sat down to join in.","After resting for half an hour, Xia Jinyuan stood up first. His cold voice carried the might of a soldier as he said, \"Gather.\""]},{"number":4519,"title":"Chapter 4519: Eat Sugar","paragraphs":["The command was given. Besides the two intern soldiers in charge of guarding, everyone else gathered as quickly as possible.","Xia Jinyuan said everything he needed to say in one go. He was not stingy with his praises when integrating with the new blood of the Xueyu unit. Facing the special forces soldiers who could hold their own, Xia Jinyuan saluted them with his back straight. This salute expressed his joy and recognition of them.","His salute instantly made the corners of the special forces soldiers’ eyes tear up. When the veterans applauded, tears rushed out. Alas, they felt a little embarrassed, but they couldn’t control themselves.","After this battle, the intern soldiers were no longer intern soldiers. They were comrades who could fight alongside the veterans.","Ye Jian looked at the straight figure standing in front of her. Her gaze softened.","That was her captain, her comrade, the love of her life, and the power of the Xueyu unit.","Her gaze was met with Xia Jinyuan’s sharp gaze. When Ye Jian saw it, she immediately retracted the gentleness in her eyes and stood upright.","Now, she was a soldier and he was the captain.","Under the hazy morning light, a group of soldiers in camouflage uniforms walked through the grayish-brown mountains and arrived at a small river formed by the snow water of Tianshan Mountain. Xia Jinyuan looked at his location. It was 40 kilometers away from the border of Gistan. They could wash up and sleep for a few hours.","Not only was there gunpowder on their bodies, but there was also a thick smell of blood. They needed to wash it off.","They took out toiletries from their backpacks. There was a stainless steel cup that was used as a bowl and a cup. There was a small towel, a toothbrush, and toothpaste. One by one, they jumped into the river barefooted and washed up.","\"Stand in a line, stand in a line. No one is allowed to go upstream!\"","To avoid drinking the water that had been used to wash their feet, the experienced Z7 shouted at the top of his lungs at his comrades who were running upstream.","With his shout, the other comrades who didn’t run reacted. When the few others came back, Z7 scooped a cup of clear snow water that could be seen on the cobblestones of the river bed and shouted, \"Splash them! Splash them! What naughty people. They actually wanted us to drink the water they used to wash their feet.\"","A handful of water had already been splashed. With Z7’s lead, the water splashing battle began.","Seeing this, Ye Jian immediately felt that there would be another ’big battle’. She ran back to the shore at lightning speed.","A pair of big hands grabbed her wrist firmly. With a low and sexy laugh, he pulled Ye Jian back from the shore.","\"Why are you running? The stones are slippery. Be careful not to fall.\"","After pulling his girlfriend back, Xia Jinyuan didn’t let go immediately. He held her tightly until he pulled Ye Jian to stand beside a pile of backpacks.","The team members went down to wash up. As the captain, he was in charge of guarding.","At first, he wanted to pull Ye Jian along to guard the area. However, Ye Jian ran too fast, and he didn’t manage to pull her back in time.","Now that she was in his hands, he wouldn’t let go so easily.","Oh, right, when they were gathered just now, she even flirted with him. He almost couldn’t control himself.","Ye Jian looked at her comrades splashing water on each other in the river. She was so happy that she didn’t realize that Xia Jinyuan was still holding her hand tightly.","She didn’t realize that it was just as Xia Jinyuan wanted. They held each other’s hands tightly and stood by the river bank. Using the undulating Tianshan Mountain, they stood side by side and watched the team members splashing water.","This water splashing battle must have been arranged by Captain Xia to relieve the pressure on his comrades who had killed enemies for the first time."]},{"number":4520,"title":"Chapter 4520: Bring You To Play","paragraphs":["The water droplets that splashed up were illuminated by the rising morning sun until they were as resplendent as diamonds. They were thrown high into the sky with a stream of light, drawing a dazzling light in the morning sun before landing back in the river. They gathered and flowed into the distance.","The veterans gestured for their young captain to come down. They waved their wet hands vigorously and shouted at the shore, \"Captain, come down, come down! Fight with them.\"","\"They’ve just left their nest and they’re already thinking of turning the world upside down. You have to come down and support us. 30 against 14. There’s no chance of winning. We need help urgently.\"","The person who shouted was T6. He wasn’t surprised at all when he saw Captain Xia and Azure Bird holding hands on the shore. He was smiling so widely that his eyes looked like a child.","He knew about the true relationship between the two people on the shore, so he didn’t think that there was anything wrong with them holding hands. After continuous mobile combat, he relaxed and played happily. When he saw the two of them holding hands, he didn’t think of reminding them and even shouted.","T6, who was screaming and asking for reinforcements, was thrown into the water by two intern soldiers who had gone through hardships to become proper soldiers. The tall man fell into the river that was so cold that the top of his head trembled. Water splashed everywhere. In an instant, he was pressed down by his two comrades and shouted for help.","T6, who was speaking, didn’t realize that there was a problem with the couple holding hands on the shore. The team members who pounced on him were also careless and didn’t pay much attention to the shore. They only cared about throwing these veterans who bullied them back then into the water to vent their anger.","They weren’t really angry. They just felt that... Damn it, they could finally bully them openly. They didn’t have to be so submissive as they were in the past, when they couldn’t even say anything even though they were angry. Finally... they had made a comeback.","With T6 being thrown into the river, V8 was thrown into the river too. Even Vice-Captain G3 was no exception. They were all thrown into the river and tortured by the intern soldiers.","K7 and E6, who had fast reactions, had long realized that there was something wrong with the gazes of these team members. They quickly went ashore early and narrowly avoided a calamity.","If they were slightly slower or caught off guard, the veterans would’ve been in trouble. T6 had said that it was 30 against 14, but it had become 30 against 8. Their numbers were overwhelming.","\"F*ck, where are you rubbing? Don’t rub my pants!\"","\"Are you trying to rebel? Aren’t you afraid of my fists?\"","\"F*ck! Who scratched my feet? Aren’t they afraid of contagion?\"","\"No, no, no. I’m afraid of tickles. Hahaha... Damn it, help. I can’t take it anymore!\"","The clear river that didn’t even reach their calves was filled with laughter. It became a paradise for the young special forces soldiers who had been fighting for three days and two nights.","The flames of war and gunpowder were washed away by the clear river. The thick smell of blood faded as the river water continued to wash it. Finally, it disappeared.","Ye Jian saw the veterans screaming as they were bullied by their new comrades. From time to time, she would hear some inappropriate sounds. Although it was a little awkward, it didn’t make her want to avoid it. Instead, she smiled until her eyes curved like crescent moons. She didn’t even hear the man beside her calling her a few times.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia saw that all her attention was on the river and raised his eyebrows. Then, he bent down and brushed his thin lips against her earlobe. He said softly with a smile, \"Do you want to go down and play too? I’ll carry you over and we can splash water together.\""]},{"number":4521,"title":"Chapter 4521: Relationship Exposed (Part One)","paragraphs":["Her comrades in the river were having too much fun. Ye Jian had never seen someone as steady as them play like children in the river. She was completely caught off guard when the man beside her suddenly spoke to her at such a close distance. She was caught off guard and felt his thin lips close to her ears.","His deep voice, which was as clean as the snow on Mount Tianshan, drilled into her ears and landed in her heart.","It was unknown if Xia Jinyuan did this on purpose, but when he leaned over to speak, E6 laughed and looked over. He even shouted, \"Captain Xia, hurry up and go down. We...\"","He couldn’t finish his sentence, and his eyes were about to pop out.","He was too shocked, and he was standing on a huge rock on the riverbed. E6 ended up slipping and falling.","K7 reached out his hand to support his comrade who was sliding down the big rock. He looked up to the left calmly.","E6, who had stabilized himself, shouted, \"Captain, you molested Azure Bird!\"","K7 silently retreated to the side. He needed to stay away from this kind of comrade who was both blind and dumb. He didn’t want to be implicated.","It wasn’t that E6 didn’t have good eyesight. The main thing was that because of his conversation with Z7 not long ago, his words came out unfiltered.","This time, it was Ye Jian’s turn to be shocked. She was suddenly kissed by the man beside her and seen by her comrade. He even... shouted that she was molested by Captain Xia.","She needed to do something!","Ye Jian knew what she should do, but after suddenly being exposed, her mind went blank. She only did a subconscious action—jump away!","She wanted to jump away from the man beside her. Hurry, hurry, hurry... Before more comrades noticed her, she had to jump away!","This action made Ye Jian even more tragic.","Previously, when the rest were in the water, they didn’t notice that the couple were holding hands. Now, Ye Jian jumped away. Lieutenant Colonel Xia seemed to be caught off guard by her sudden jump. He held her hand and said, \"Be careful.\" Then... he pulled Ye Jian, who was as frightened as a little white rabbit, into his arms. He used both hands to hug her.","The moment he pulled Ye Jian, who was about to ’jump away’, into his arms, Lieutenant Colonel Xia let go of his hand that was holding hers agilely. Then, he wrapped both arms around Ye Jian’s waist.","Oh right, he moved his hands up, allowing everyone to see the sight clearly.","The momentum was too strong. It was so strong that E6’s mouth was wide open. It was so strong that the other comrades, who were still playing in the riverbed, were all shocked.","This time, even T6 was stunned. A mouthful of cold river water poured into his mouth, causing him to cough violently.","Oh, oh, oh, oh... Oh my god!","It was too explosive... It was too explosive!","They were hugging on the spot and acting intimately in front of everyone!","It was too manly!"]},{"number":4522,"title":"Chapter 4522: Relationship Exposed (Part One)","paragraphs":["T6, V8, G3, K7, and Z7, who knew about the couple’s relationship, only felt that the sight was explosive. They also caught a hint of abnormality from their captain’s abnormal actions. Although comrades like Weaver, White Crane, and E6, who didn’t know about it, felt that something was wrong, they all based their reactions on E6.","\"I bet Azure Bird will punch the captain in the face.\"","E6 whispered to K7, who was a few steps away from him.","He represented the fact that he didn’t know what his comrades were thinking at this moment.","The comrades who were playing in the river stood up silently. A few veterans, like White Crane, Weaver, and the others who didn’t know anything, finally got up from the river.","Drip, drip, drip...","The water droplets in his wet clothes dripped into the water like rain. The river flowed, and the comrades standing in the river waited silently...","They waited for Azure Bird to punch the face of the captain who molested her.","At this moment, Ye Jian, whose entire body was as stiff as a rock, was dumbfounded. Her eyes, which were as clear as water, widened. Her beautiful face was filled with shock. As for her brain, it was a blank slate.","Besides the instigator, Lieutenant Colonel Xia Jinyuan, everyone else was in a daze. They were dumbfounded and shocked as they stood waiting.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was the only one who was sober, lowered his head and frowned. There was a hint of displeasure on his handsome face. \"The shore is filled with angular rocks. Aren’t you afraid that you’ll hit your head on a rock and bleed?\"","Although he was unhappy, his voice was gentle.","K7 nudged E6 and said calmly, \"Azure Bird might’ve sprained her ankle. Go take a look.\"","\"An ankle sprain? Oh, okay, okay.\"","Out of trust in his comrade, E6 nodded obediently... He really went over.","K7 nodded slightly. He encouraged and cheered for E6’s bravery.","As E6 ran toward the two of them who were hugging, Z7, who was standing in the river, blinked. His weak voice floated into G3’s ears. \"Last night, E6 told me that Azure Bird is like the daughter raised by our captain. Azure Bird is the daughter, and the captain is the old father.\"","G3 turned his head bit by bit like a rusty robot running low on engine oil. \"And then? What did you say?\"","His instincts told him that the guy in front of him, who had as many girlfriends as their entire team, wouldn’t have done anything good.","Z7 smiled. \"He said he wanted to ask our captain what it felt like to have raised a daughter with so many achievements.\"","As expected, he didn’t have any good intentions.","G3 raised his head and rubbed his forehead. He moved his long legs in the water. The sound of water splashing could be heard. The distance between the two of them was shortened to about half a meter. \"How did you answer?\"","They whispered to each other like thieves.","\"I agreed. And I gave him a suggestion. I told him to ask when Azure Bird was around. It’d be best if both parties involved were present. After interviewing the old father, he could interview the daughter, Azure Bird. The effect would be better.\"","Z7’s suggestion was highly approved by G3. To show his approval, G3 gave Z7 a thumbs-up. \"This award is for you. Please accept it.\"","\"Yes.\" Z7 nodded reservedly. When he saw the figure running over happily, he smiled and said, \"When do you think he’ll interview them?\"","\"With K7’s help and E6’s trust in the captain, I think we might be able to see the most exciting interview in history very soon.\""]},{"number":4523,"title":"Chapter 4523: Relationship Exposed (Part One)","paragraphs":["G3’s professional analysis made Z7 nod. \"I believe in your analysis. Now that we’ve washed and played, I’m a little tired. Why don’t we go up and rest?\"","\"Sure.\" G3 nodded.","The two friends went ashore hand in hand.","T6 and V8 had sharp eyes. Due to their many years of camaraderie and tacit understanding, the two of them looked at each other and raised their heads to the shore. Their gazes conveyed the same meaning—’Shall we go up?’","After raising their heads and confirming their gazes, the two friends went ashore hand in hand.","The comrades, who were waiting for Azure Bird to beat up her captain, saw E6 suddenly barge into their vision and destroy the image of the two protagonists hugging. The comrades blinked. What did he want to do?","What was E6 doing here?","Could it be that he wanted to help Azure Bird beat up the captain?","How bold was he?","E6 didn’t dare to. His footsteps were like the wind. He stepped on small stones. Ye Jian was stunned.","\"Captain Xia!\"","Ye Jian, who was in a daze, sobered up. She was shocked and panicked. She finally came back to her senses. When she saw E6 running toward her, the smart Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Thank you, Captain Xia. I’m fine. I just sprained my ankle.\"","Her ankle seemed to be a little sprained, and she was speaking loudly. Ye Jian was afraid that E6 couldn’t hear her clearly, so she said, \"Captain Xia, please help me. I’ll check if I’m injured.\"","\"You really twisted your ankle. Let K7 check it. We have a military doctor here, so you don’t need to check it yourself.\"","How could E6 not hear what Ye Jian said? He heard it too. After saying that, he added, \"K7, that quack, said that you might have sprained your ankle just now. He was right.\"","\"Did you sprain your ankle? Quick, we’ll help you sit down first...\" He enthusiastically helped Lieutenant Colonel Xia share the heavy responsibility of helping Ye Jian. Then, he praised Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s quick reaction just now. E6 smiled and said, \"An old father’s reaction is still the fastest. If not, your daughter might’ve hit her head today.\"","He lowered his head and reached out his hand.","Ye Jian choked on her saliva and coughed.","If she didn’t misunderstand, the old father E6 mentioned was Captain Xia, and the daughter was her?","’E6, you have good eyesight!’","Ye Jian wasn’t worried that her hug with Xia Jinyuan would affect the team. Instead, she was worried... about how Captain Xia would deal with E6.","With his arms around her waist, Lieutenant Colonel Xia raised his eyebrows. He looked at E6 with a faint smile in his dark eyes. \"Old father? Me?\"","His voice might sound a little amused, but the words contained blades.","As a special forces soldier, E6’s strong desire to live suddenly rose. His outstretched hand felt as if it was about to touch a huge fire. It was so hot that he quickly retracted it and smiled at Lieutenant Colonel Xia. \"I don’t think there’s a need for the two of us to hold her. With your strength, you can carry Azure Bird directly.\"","\"K7, come and take a look at Azure Bird. You were right. She sprained her ankle!\"","His strong desire to live made E6 even smarter. He pulled K7 into the center of the hurricane. ’Comrades, comrades, it’s time for us to fight together again!’","K7 expressed that he didn’t want to fight at all. He was so tired and wanted to sleep.","He waved his hand and replied indifferently, \"Azure Bird is more familiar with gun injuries than me. She can settle her own matters. I’m a little tired. I’ll sleep for a while.\""]},{"number":4524,"title":"Chapter 4524: Relationship Exposed (Part One)","paragraphs":["This was the first time Ye Jian heard K7’s long explanation since she joined the team!","It couldn’t be helped. K7 had to explain at length because of his strong desire to live. He didn’t want to either. Reality forced him to lower his head.","E6 took a step back and said in surprise, \"I didn’t expect you to be a doctor. Captain, accompany Azure Bird. We have to take care of the female comrade in our team.\"","\"I won’t accompany you. I don’t know anything and will only cause trouble. Thank you for your hard work, Captain. I’ll go to sleep too. Goodbye, Captain.\"","In the past, E6 wasn’t afraid even when his engine malfunctioned when he was piloting a helicopter... At this moment, his captain’s smile awakened his strongest desire to live.","He had to leave quickly. He had to leave this troublesome place quickly. If he was a second late, he might really lose his life!","Ye Jian kept moving her hands toward the big hands that were hugging her waist. She secretly pulled them forcefully. With E6 in front of her, she couldn’t move too much. She had to maintain her expression to the end. She was clearly anxious, but she still had to smile.","She was really tired. She had never been so tired.","Xia Jinyuan was really angered by the mention of ’old father’. His liver, lungs, heart... His organs were hurting, and he was about to have an acute myocardial infarction!","Old father?","Old father?","Old father?","He was his precious woman’s old father?","What about his real father-in-law?","Even if he was the little fox’s father, he was still a young father, okay?","\"Come back.\"","The voice of the man who was about to get an acute myocardial infarction was cold. It froze E6 in place like a rivet.","After taking a few steps, K7 froze and turned back.","Although the captain didn’t say his name, the captain tacitly let K7 know that the words ’come back’ were meant for him and E6.","K7, who came back, saw that T6, V8, G3, and Z7 were laughing till they were in stitches. Z7’s condition was the most serious. His facial features were deformed.","Did he think he could escape?","Ye Jian finally pulled away the hands that were around her waist. She used too much strength, so much so that her face turned red. But she didn’t look like she used too much strength. She looked more like she was embarrassed.","Weaver nudged White Crane and said excitedly, \"Let’s hurry up and go over. I have a feeling that there’s going to be a big show!\"","White Crane, who came from a scholarly family, was not in a hurry at all. He wrung out his clothes and smiled gently. \"Let’s go. If we continue soaking in the river, our skin will wrinkle.\"","He said to his 30 comrades who had quietened down, \"Gather, gather. The captain and Azure Bird haven’t washed up.\"","\"Okay!\"","The comrades who had been standing in the river like pillars for at least three minutes were like running horses. They moved their long legs and ran toward the shore.","They didn’t know what was going on at all. They only felt that the veterans seemed very excited, so they were excited too.","Weaver patted White Crane’s shoulder silently.","Not bad, he even took care of their new comrades.","White Crane maintained his gentle smile.","That was right. In the future, they would be comrades who ate, slept, and bathed together. Of course, he had to take care of them.","The sound of their comrades going up the river made Ye Jian glance at them from the corners of her eyes. She prepared to let Lieutenant Colonel Xia handle this. She said calmly, \"Captain Xia, I’ll go down and wash up. You guys talk.\"","She had to leave. She had to leave. Captain Xia had suffered a huge blow. He might do something even more severe. And this matter... was about her!","The smart Ye Jian wanted to run away!"]},{"number":4525,"title":"Chapter 4525: Relationship Exposed (Part Five)","paragraphs":["But how could she succeed?","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was faster, quickly grabbed her wrist and coaxed her gently, \"You sprained your ankle, but you’re still moving. Be good and don’t move.\"","If his daughter left, there were some things he couldn’t say.\" Lieutenant Colonel Xia saw what his girlfriend was thinking and smiled evilly. Then, he raised his eyebrows. Ye Jian immediately felt that something was wrong. Her eyes narrowed even more as she stuttered, \"You... You... aren’t my father.\"","\"Of course not. My father-in-law is still in the capital city. You’re my...\"","Howl...","Ye Jian, who rushed over to cover Xia Jinyuan’s thin lips, realized that there was an earth-shattering howl in the depths of her heart. She covered Xia Jinyuan’s mouth at lightning speed.","She knew what he wanted to say. He couldn’t say it. He couldn’t!","E6 was speechless.","What was he seeing?","What did he miss?","What did he do?","Would he still be alive today?","Would he be able to see the sun tomorrow?","Oh my god!","No matter how blind he was, he knew that something was wrong. He also knew that he had caused trouble!","At that moment, E6’s expression turned bitter. He instantly begged Lieutenant Colonel Xia for mercy. \"Captain, I’m sorry. I’m stupid. I was wrong.\"","’K7, you scheming bastard, you’ve harmed me!","’Z7, get over here. You’ll be the death of me!’","At this moment, E6 wanted to cry but had no tears. He had a feeling that he would die with hatred!","Xia Jinyuan’s clear eyes reflected the morning sun. His eyes were bright, but his gaze was dark. His girlfriend had already thrown herself into his arms, so he naturally had to hug her openly.","\"Ah...\"","While Ye Jian was exclaiming, he carried Ye Jian like a princess and said to E6, \"Do you see anything?\"","At this stage... their relationship was obvious.","The comrades who came ashore were so shocked that they froze on the spot. Oh my god, what were they seeing?","Their captain was carrying Azure Bird... He was carrying her!","Weaver and White Crane stepped ashore barefooted. The explosive scene in front of them shocked the two of them so much that they slipped and almost fell.","Damn it!","They were already hugging like this!","G3, K7, T6, and V8 were stunned. They really... really didn’t expect this!","Today was a good day for their relationship to be made public!","Congratulations, congratulations. Their captain was finally upright. There was no need to pretend that he was single anymore.","It wasn’t easy!","Ye Jian, who was in a panic, buried her head in her arms. Her face was as red as a tomato. Why was she still hiding?","There was no need.","She suddenly remembered that the man who was carrying her had once said that he would find a suitable opportunity to tell their comrades about their relationship. Was it time to announce their relationship now?","That seemed to be the case.","They were mistaken as a father and daughter pair.","Ye Jian, who was in a passive position, was no longer so flustered. She even raised her hand proactively and firmly hugged the neck of the man who had always been helping her, loving her, and guiding her.","The moment she wrapped her arms around his neck, she felt at ease.","The man hugging her tightly was her boyfriend and her future husband. She loved him deeply.","Xia Jinyuan smiled. He lowered his head and looked at his blushing girlfriend gently. \"I’m very happy. Very happy.\"","He was glad that she didn’t escape again. He was glad that she bravely reached out her hands and appeared in front of their comrades to announce their relationship.","Ye Jian nodded. Her heart was pounding. She whispered, \"I’m happy too.\""]},{"number":4526,"title":"Chapter 4526: Very Sweet PDA (Part One)","paragraphs":["All these years, because of Ye Jian, their relationship had been going on secretly. For her, he was willing to stay by her side. He wasn’t angry or resentful because of this. He stayed by her side silently and tolerated everything.","Now, they could finally say it openly. They didn’t have to hide anymore.","The moment he said it, Ye Jian only knew that she was really happy. She was so happy that the corners of her eyes were slightly red.","Xia Jinyuan smiled until his handsome face was no longer cold. He raised his head and asked E6 with a smile, \"Do you see anything?\"","E6’s heart pounded as he nodded. \"I see it. The captain and Azure Bird are a couple.\"","Yes, she and Captain Xia were a couple.","E6 was about to cry. He didn’t know how many times he had slapped himself.","It was his fault for having a cheap mouth!","An old father raising a daughter!","He was in trouble!","The captain was like the King of Hell. With his methods, he might have hundreds of ways to deal with him.","E6 was bitter!","How tragic!","Well, they would suffer together. His comrades wouldn’t be able to escape!","E6, who had regained his intelligence, immediately flattered Xia Jinyuan, \"Captain, you and Azure Bird are a couple. I wish you and Azure Bird a happy life in advance!\"","Not bad. This was very smart of him!","Xia Jinyuan smiled in satisfaction. As for Ye Jian... her face continued to turn red.","After flattering him, E6 patted his thigh again and said in enlightenment, \"I was wondering why Z7 insisted that I interview you two together last night. As it turns out, he’s as blind as me!","\"K7 was still around just now. You were clearly chatting with Azure Bird, but he insisted that Azure Bird sprained her ankle and asked me to help. He was just out to ruin your plan!","\"Those two people are just terrible!\"","If he couldn’t see the sun tomorrow, neither will those two. If they were in trouble, they had to bear it together. No one could escape!","Ye Jian, who was blushing, whispered, \"Captain Xia, put me down first.\"","It was obvious that Z7 and K7 did it on purpose. They wanted to watch the show. However, no one expected E6 to say it out loud. He didn’t even give Captain Xia a chance to step down.","Ye Jian didn’t blame Z7 and K7. The veterans in the Xueyu unit were the same. They were all people who liked to watch the show.","This time, with Captain Xia’s personality, the three of them wouldn’t have a good time.","Xia Jinyuan naturally knew about it too. He didn’t expect K7 to be so good at playing with people. Even E6, who was considered a smart person, was nothing in front of him. K7 was able to fool E6 with just a few words.","Actually, they didn’t want his relationship with Ye Jian to be exposed. They wanted to focus on the show.","Unexpectedly... Hehe.","\"The rock is a little slippery. Stand properly.\" Xia Jinyuan placed Ye Jian down carefully as if he was protecting a treasure. He was afraid that Ye Jian would fall. His voice was so gentle that E6 shuddered.","He was too gentle and soft. She treated Ye Jian like a glass doll.","In the past, Ye Jian was sent to the hospital during training because of him. Now, he knew how to cherish her.","Also, that affectionate look on his face didn’t suit his style. A tiger turning into a kitten. Damn it, he couldn’t accept it!","E6, who had successfully dragged his comrades down, silently looked away. As a single person, the PDA in front of him made him feel suffocated. It was as if he had eaten grass.","Ye Jian stood still and brushed her short hair that was messed up by the wind uncomfortably. Although she was very uncomfortable, the shyness on her face was no different from a newlywed.","Fortunately, the mental fortitude of the special forces soldiers was good."]},{"number":4527,"title":"Chapter 4527: Very Sweet PDA (Part Two)","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan held her hand and stood still. He raised his eyes slightly and looked ahead. He saw his comrades standing there as if they had been immobilized. They were staring at the two of them. It was obvious that they had not woken up from their shock.","There were probably some people who still weren’t completely aware.","He raised her hand at Z7 and smiled. \"Come here, come here.\"","\"Go, it’s your turn. All the best!\" G3 immediately let go of his hand. At the same time, he pushed Z7’s back and revealed a motherly smile. \"Don’t be afraid. You’re not fighting alone.\"","Z7 was about to cry.","Little Six of the Xia family had successfully straightened himself out. So why was he the one who was afraid in the end?","Why did he have to be implicated in their relationship?","Couldn’t he just leave quietly?","\"If I’m not wrong, our captain and Azure Bird... have such a relationship.\" No. 17 was quick-witted. He brought his hands together and said, \"They’re in the sort of relationship where they can kiss.\"","\"I don’t think so. It doesn’t seem like it! Why haven’t I heard the veterans talk about it before? There must be a mistake.\"","\"When E6 ran over just now, I thought that he liked Azure Bird. I thought he was very angry when he saw the captain molesting Azure Bird, so he ran over to look for the captain to even the score.\"","The back of the head of the new special forces soldier was smacked.","\"Don’t tell the captain that. Otherwise, he’ll teach you a lesson.\"","\"Don’t argue, don’t argue. Let’s continue watching. The captain asked Z7 and K7 to go over. What are they doing? I feel that it’ll be even more exciting.\"","\"Let’s just watch. Don’t express your opinion casually. It’s best to shut up!\"","\"Shut up. Don’t say anything. Think about the captain’s inhuman methods!\"","The 30 new special forces soldiers were in awe of their captain, Lieutenant Colonel Xia. They tactfully remained silent and watched with sparkling eyes.","The excitement continued. They couldn’t miss it!","Weaver and White Crane, who were holding hands, stood beside G3 and looked at him thoughtfully. They said in an affirmative and serious tone, \"You must know something.\"","\"You’ll know what I know very soon. Don’t talk. The excitement is yet to come. I regret not bringing a bag of popcorn. If not, I could be eating it right now. That would be satisfying!\"","G3 sighed and shook his head. There was no popcorn to eat. It was less fun.","T6 and V8 walked over from behind and sighed in unison. T6 said, \"I wonder if the three of them will survive tonight. We’ve been comrades for many years. Let’s help them tidy up a little after this so that they can keep their dignity.\"","\"With Azure Bird around, the ferocious beast will turn into a cat. Nothing big will happen. At most, the training mission will get heavier.\"","\"That’s right. I was worried for nothing.\"","\"The excitement is coming. Hurry, hold your breath and shut up!\"","Z7 walked in front of Lieutenant Colonel Xia. Before he could say anything, Xia Jinyuan smiled and asked, \"I’m an old father? Azure Bird is my good daughter?\"","\"I was wrong. I admit my mistake. I’m sincerely sorry!\" So what if he had a backbone? If it was for survival, he could throw it away. Z7 had thrown his backbone aside for survival!","Xia Jinyuan gave him a smile that made his hair stand on end. Then, he turned his head and looked at K7. He sized him up and sighed. \"I didn’t expect our military surgeon to be the real final boss. Impressive.\"","K7, who had regained his coldness, glanced at the captain coldly and said calmly, \"You’re welcome.\"","\"I’m sure the two of you don’t know my relationship with Ye Jian. Come, come, take a good look...\" An old father raising his daughter... Lieutenant Colonel Xia couldn’t get past this hurdle. He hugged Ye Jian’s shoulder and said to her, \"Baby, I need to check my identity. I really don’t want to be your father!","\"Close your eyes. Give me five seconds.\""]},{"number":4528,"title":"Chapter 4528: Very Sweet PDA (Part Three)","paragraphs":["E6 was single. When he heard his captain say ’close your eyes and give me five seconds’, his brain seemed to slow down. As soon as he heard it clearly, he realized that the damage dealt to single people was the worst. He said softly in front of Ye Jian, \"Captain, we all know now. We know it’s true. Why don’t you let everyone disperse first while you and Azure Bird continue for five seconds?\"","Please let the single people go. If this continued, he wouldn’t need to be punished by the captain. He would be hurt on the spot.","A single man couldn’t bear to see anything. He couldn’t bear to see anyone in love!","K7 and Z7 decided not to say anything.","The more they said, the more mistakes they would make. It was better to be silent.","As for E6, if he wanted to say something, they would let him. It was his fault for being clueless. He could continue his performance.","Since Xia Jinyuan decided to publicize their relationship today in front of their comrades and sweep away his potential ’love rivals’ in one go, he had to make sure that everyone would remember everything that happened today. Even if they had any thoughts in the future, as long as they thought of today, they wouldn’t take the initiative. They would obediently trample their thoughts to death.","The veterans were a little distracted by the only female soldier in the team, let alone the new comrades.","Most importantly... the average age of these guys was only 24 years old. They were just three years younger than him!","Lieutenant Colonel Xia was at his prime age. Just because someone called him an ’old father’, he actually felt a sense of danger.","Ye Jian, who was being hugged by him, blinked. A bad feeling rose in her blissful heart. She persuaded him calmly, \"Captain Xia, calm down! I don’t mind, so you don’t mind it either!\"","\"No, I can’t get through this. Five seconds is enough. Just five seconds. In five seconds, I’ll let everyone know that my identity isn’t that of an old father but...\" He hugged Ye Jian’s shoulders and pulled her into his arms in an extremely domineering but gentle posture. He lowered his head and kissed her...","Look clearly, look clearly! This group of imbeciles kept finding trouble for him every day, causing him to feel a sense of danger because of his age. How could an old father kiss his daughter like this?","He wasn’t his woman’s old father. He was her boyfriend!","Ye Jian had already guessed what he wanted to do. When he really did it... she was still stunned. Her eyes, which were so clear that they could reflect the blue sky, widened. Her lips were kissed by him, and then their tongues intertwined...","Her heart was beating furiously, and her blood circulation was accelerating. Perhaps it was because it flowed too quickly, but she felt warm. In an instant, Ye Jian’s earlobes and face turned slightly red.","Oh my god!","Ahhhhh!","He kissed her!","He kissed her!","Damn it!","He kissed her!","Their captain kissed Azure Bird!","The 30 new recruits stretched their necks collectively. They were shocked by the sudden gesture. No. 9 grabbed the arm of No. 8 tightly. He was so excited that his eyes lit up. \"Ah, they’re kissing! The captain is mighty!\"","\"Oh my god, why did you grab me? Hurry up and let go. I’m not your girlfriend!","\"Let go, let go. You’re strangling me. I’m going to die from your strangulation!\"","\"A couple, they’re a couple! Our captain and Azure Bird are really a couple! They even kissed...\""]},{"number":4529,"title":"Chapter 4529: Very Sweet PDA (Part Four)","paragraphs":["Why were they so excited?","They were locked up in the deep mountains and forests for more than two years. They only watched the news on television and watched the military channels for entertainment. Occasionally, they would go to the other side of the mountain for a holiday. When catching birds, they had to study whether it was a male or female. When they suddenly saw the live version of a romance movie, even if it was just a kiss, it became the most exciting thing in their eyes.","Their hormones were surging, and their adrenal cortex was erupting like a volcano. They wanted to calm down, but they really couldn’t.","They couldn’t remain calm. Actually, the veterans were the same. They were just a little more reserved.","White Crane, who was standing in front, turned around and looked at his new comrades behind him. They were so excited that it seemed like they were the ones hugging a lady. He felt a little embarrassed and covered his forehead. He said helplessly to G3, \"The officer’s job must be done properly. The marriage of the veterans hasn’t been settled yet, but another group of bachelors is here. Let Q King apply for a few more social gatherings.\"","\"Definitely, definitely. You have to hurry up too. I have a wife and children now. Haha...\" G3, whose marriage and children were settled, smiled annoyingly. White Crane rubbed his fists and smiled as he looked back.","G3 hugged his helmet and raised his hand to pat White Crane’s shoulder. He glanced at V8, Weaver, and the other veterans. \"You’re not fighting alone. You won’t be lonely with company.\"","\"They’ve been kissing for more than ten seconds. Why haven’t they let go?\"","White Crane unclenched his fists and looked at the figures hugging and kissing in front of him. The breeze was gentle, and the morning sun was just right. It was suitable for them to relax.","If Azure Bird punched their captain’s back, he thought he would be in a better mood.","After a few seconds, Xia Jinyuan finally ended the kiss that declared his sovereignty. However... it didn’t mean that it was over.","\"Close your eyes, baby.\"","The man’s clean voice came from his thin lips. Ye Jian’s face was so red that she looked like she was drunk. Before she could catch her breath, the second kiss came.","It was useless for Ye Jian to struggle. She even used her teeth to bite his tongue... but it didn’t stop Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s passion.","It couldn’t be helped. He hadn’t been able to openly date her for a long time. He had to dodge other people’s line of sight even when holding hands. Now, he could finally tell everyone about it. Even someone as calm as Xia Jinyuan couldn’t help but feel excited.","He was extremely excited. He was grabbing the back of Ye Jian’s head with one hand and holding Ye Jian’s slender waist with the other.","The two of them kissed again. Z7, who was shocked by the first kiss, trembled. The captain was amazing!","He kissed her once, but it didn’t work. He even kissed her a second time. Azure Bird couldn’t resist at all. She hit and kicked him, but the bull-like Little Six continued to kiss her... He was a 27-year-old virgin. He was bold and unrestrained. Z7 admitted defeat. He was convinced!","After he finished sighing in his heart, Z7 immediately commented, \"Congratulations, congratulations. You’re Ye Jian’s boyfriend and Ye Jian is Xia Jinyuan’s girlfriend. Everyone will know in the future! Please kiss for a long time! We don’t mind at all!\"","E6 wasn’t the only one who could tell. The comrades who went ashore could tell. Everyone could tell what their relationship was now.","They kissed again and again, but Azure Bird didn’t beat up the captain who molested her. What did this mean?","This meant that the two of them were in love, that they were in a relationship, and that they were really boyfriend and girlfriend."]},{"number":4530,"title":"Chapter 4530: Very Sweet PDA (Part Five)","paragraphs":["The only female soldier in their team, the treasure of the team, Azure Bird, was monopolized by their captain just like that. His kiss wasn’t a kiss; it was to instill fear in the enemies and implant a seed of love.","E6’s face, which had been tanned by the training, turned red like a teenager peeking through the crack of the door.","This was too... exciting, but also... so hurtful!","Did the captain consider his feelings as a bachelor?","Where did their camaraderie go?","Where did their brotherhood go?","Where did their life-or-death relationship go?","They were all fed to the dogs!","E6, who was deeply ’hurt’, covered his face with his hands and peeked through his fingers.","Tsk, tsk, tsk, tsk. Their captain wasn’t human. He was a beast. He had said that he would only kiss for five seconds, but three and a half minutes had passed and he still hadn’t let go.","Oh my, there were still sounds!","It was a French kiss!","He saw Azure Bird fluttering like a bird caught in a net. Her small arms were fluttering. Hahaha... Why did he want to laugh again?","E6 covered his face and stole a glance. Z7, who had finished his narration, admired the sight with interest. He continued to say to K7, who was still calm in the face of the exciting scene in front of him, \"Tsk, tsk, tsk. Do you see that? This is the tragedy of old virgins.\"","K7, who was also an old virgin, glanced at Z7’s neck. Z7 subconsciously covered his neck that felt as if it had been cut by a surgical knife and silently took three steps away from K7.","The more he spoke, the more mistakes he would make. He forgot that K7 beside him was also a sad old virgin.","Ye Jian punched until her arms were sore, but she couldn’t stop Xia Jinyuan’s deep kiss. She closed her eyes and was so embarrassed that her toes curled up.","\"Your nose is bleeding!\"","\"I’m young and energetic. I haven’t seen anything like this in a long time. I’m just a little agitated. It’s okay, it’s okay. I just need to wipe it.\"","\"Quick, go into the river and splash some cold water to stop the hemostatic. If that won’t do, take a shower.\"","These excited and sneaky voices floated into Ye Jian’s ears bit by bit. They slowly cleared Ye Jian’s dizzy brain.","Without any hesitation, she raised her leg and stepped on Xia Jinyuan’s instep with the heel of her military boots. She stopped hitting his back and placed her arms on both sides of his waist. Then, she twisted...","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was completely immersed in the kiss, was caught off guard. His handsome face twisted. Finally, the French tongue kiss ended.","Ye Jian was already drenched in sweat after escaping from his clutches. She was so embarrassed that she wanted to escape again. However, she couldn’t let him face it alone. She gritted her teeth and controlled her two legs that wanted to run at any moment. She got closer to Xia Jinyuan.","Her right hand wasn’t idle. She continued to pinch Xia Jinyuan’s waist. As she pinched, she maintained a smile and gritted her teeth. \"Captain Xia, I’ll remember this. I’ll teach you a lesson when we get back.\"","\"Alright, alright. You can do whatever you want when we get back. You can make the decision and I’ll obey.\" Xia Jinyuan felt sweet even when he was in pain. In the face of his girlfriend’s ruthless words, he was very perceptive and maintained a firm policy of not resisting and not refuting. He would do whatever his girlfriend said!","It couldn’t be helped. He was ruthless to her during training. He had to give in to her in life.","If he didn’t listen obediently in life, it was equivalent to personally giving the girlfriend he finally wooed to another man.","Ye Jian felt helpless when he showed weakness. She glared at him and retracted her hand.","Xia Jinyuan smiled like a cat that had stolen a fish. He held Ye Jian’s hand tightly and said in a clear voice, \"Come, come, come. Comrades, let me introduce you to my future wife. From now on, I’ll end my single life and live a good life with a woman. Give me a round of applause!\""]},{"number":4531,"title":"Chapter 4531: The Response To Love","paragraphs":["Applause... To be honest, not many people wanted to give it to him. Even if there was applause, it was for Azure Bird, Ye Jian. How much courage did she use to accept their captain? She must have avoided him and wanted him to disappear!","However, applause still sounded. It was quite enthusiastic. Some of the 30 new comrades even applauded while shouting, \"Good, good, good.\"","Good, good, good!","It was said that rabbits didn’t eat the grass beside their nest. Yet, their captain ate everything!","He ate that particular blade of grass!","Hmph!","Applause? Sure!","They would punch him too, okay?","Of course, it wasn’t good... But in order to survive, they had to pretend. Even if they had to grit their teeth, they had to applaud!","\"Come, come, come. Clap, clap. Let’s clap for this historic moment.\" E6, who had always been driven by his strong desire to live, took the lead. He clapped his hands first and even shouted for all the comrades to clap.","Clap! Clap! Clap!","Clap! Clap! Clap!","The applause was very enthusiastic, but Ye Jian felt that it didn’t sound like applause. Instead, it sounded like... a slap in the face. She stared at Captain Xia and gave a fake smile. She wanted to turn around and run, but she didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","\"Captain Xia, you really need a beating.\"","Amidst the applause, Ye Jian tiptoed and sighed. \"I want to beat you up, let alone our comrades who are forced to clap by you.\"","Asking them to give an applause? Captain Xia should show some respect!","The shameless Xia Jinyuan revealed his teeth with a smile. His handsome face was bright like a pine tree in the mountain, like bamboo under the moon. He exuded an elegant and noble aura. \"I’m happy today. They don’t have the guts to beat me up.\"","It was rare for him to indulge himself. Ever since he joined the military and took over the Xueyu unit, he had been restraining himself. He was afraid that if anything went wrong, a life would be lost.","After taking in the 30 new recruits, the 30 of them were like 30 mountains pressing down on his shoulders. The burden was so heavy, but even if he couldn’t breathe, he gritted his teeth and continued walking. He knew that they would often go overseas to carry out missions. He understood the strengths and weaknesses of the 30 new recruits within a week. Then, he arranged their daily training. Even if he didn’t return to the team that year because of Cobra, the training of the 30 new recruits in the team had never been delayed.","Day after day, year after year, he would only indulge himself when she was by his side.","The little fox always said that it was her fortune to meet him. Actually... His gentle eyes looked at the beautiful face that was like a blooming hibiscus. Xia Jinyuan reached out his hand and rubbed her head gently. Instantly, the applause reached a high point.","He smiled and said, \"During this short period, just be with me.\"","After this short period of time, there would be more than 40 days of high-intensity training with a mortality rate. After letting himself go, his heart would continue to tense up. He was still the captain of the Xueyu unit, the captain who could beat and scold his girlfriend during training.","It had been a long time since he was so happy and presumptuous. He wanted to rest for a while.","As he spoke with a smile, Ye Jian’s heart ached for him.","He had been holding her hand tightly. He had done so much for her. She had to do something for him and say something. She couldn’t just let him act alone. She had to respond to him.","She loved him deeply, so it was normal for her to respond."]},{"number":4532,"title":"Chapter 4532: I’ll Protect My Man","paragraphs":["Just as he was about to say something, Z7, who was clapping against his will, took advantage of the fact that Xia Jinyuan wasn’t paying attention. The captain was busy enjoying the enthusiastic applause. He moved closer to Ye Jian and whispered, \"Azure Bird, my applause is for you, not him. Whether our brothers can live a good life depends on you. Please take good care of him. Whether we can live to see the sun tomorrow will depend on you.\"","He had offended the captain too much, so he had no choice but to find a backer.","Ye Jian smiled and turned her head. \"No, no, no. My man and I will definitely stand on the same side. So, brother, if you have the guts to instigate E6 to challenge Captain Xia’s temper, you should have the guts to accept Captain Xia’s punishment.\"","\"Even if the heavens want me to die!\" Z7 sighed sorrowfully. The applause was louder and harder. He hoped that the two of them would show mercy when they saw him clapping so hard.","He really knew his mistake this time!","Xia Jinyuan was looking at the comrades in front of him and enjoying their enthusiastic applause. However, after Ye Jian answered Z7, he held her hand even tighter.","He heard Ye Jian’s reply and knew it was a good response. The love he could face with her was so intoxicating. He was willing to be led by her for the rest of his life. He had to protect his life well and accompany her for the rest of his life until his hair turned white and he was buried in the soil.","Ye Jian lowered her head and looked at their interlocked hands. She was no longer shy. She took a step forward and raised her head slightly. Her clear voice was like a wind chime swaying in the wind. It floated into the ears of all the comrades happily. \"Hello, comrades. I’m Ye Jian. In the future, your captain will be my man. I’ll protect my man! Thank you!\"","...","Her man was under her protection... Such a domineering declaration shocked all the comrades. The applause got louder. How domineering! As expected of Azure Bird. She was so domineering!","\"Okay!\" \"Okay!\"","\"The domineering Ye Jian!\"","\"Ye Jian, if I want to find a girlfriend in the future, I must find someone like you! I want to be protected by my wife too!\"","\"Dream on. There’s only one Ye Jian. Where are you going to find someone like Ye Jian?\"","Xia Jinyuan was also shocked by his woman’s domineering declaration. Why did he feel that his body was floating?","His feelings could be summarized in one word—happy!","The most beautiful love in the world was one that was reciprocated.","This time, the applause didn’t stop for a long time because of Ye Jian’s domineering declaration. Although they were complaining, they gave their blessings from the bottom of their hearts. They sincerely wished their captain and Azure Bird a happy life together!","The sky was clear, and the mountains were towering. A couple in camouflage uniforms stood side by side in the mountains and rivers. They would fight side by side and climb to the peak together.","The applause stopped. The liveliest moment passed quietly. Ye Jian, who hadn’t completely washed up, hugged her helmet and rushed into the river with a red face under the smiling gazes of her comrades.","Her declaration was very domineering, but her confidence didn’t last long. Now, her tender face was flushed red. She urgently needed to calm down.","The clear river water flowed. Ye Jian bent down to wash her face. She looked at the face reflected in the waves. Her eyes were beautiful and her lips were red. She didn’t dare to look at herself anymore!","The clear river water flowed. Ye Jian bent down to wash her face. She looked at the face reflected in the waves. Her eyes were beautiful and her lips were red. She didn’t dare to look at herself anymore!"]},{"number":4533,"title":"Chapter 4533: Annoying Little Fairy","paragraphs":["Ye Jian kept washing her face in the river while Xia Jinyuan was surrounded by the comrades. They only had one thing to say to him—’Captain Xia, please teach me how to get a girlfriend!’","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was sitting in the middle, hugged the steel gun tightly and looked around. He cleared his throat and said, \"First, pester her until she softens her heart, then chase her until she has nowhere to run. Finally, confess your love so that she can never leave you again.","\"I’ll give you my insights. Use them well. You might get what you want one day!\"","\"That’s not right. I used to pester a girl too. In the end, the girl said this—’Can you stop being so annoying?’ I was greatly hurt and never dared to woo a girl again.\"","\"Z7, you’re experienced in love. Come and teach him.\" Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to tell his comrades about his love with Ye Jian. This was his and Ye Jian’s privacy. He couldn’t say it.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was still acting like he had a lot of experience just now, immediately invited Z7 over. In terms of wooing a girl... He really didn’t have any experience. All his experience was used on Ye Jian, and it was only effective on Ye Jian.","That was because he only bent down and spoke gently to Ye Jian. He never took any other women seriously or even looked at them.","Z7 was pushed out just like that and became the ’love counselor’ of the 30 new comrades. Xia Jinyuan stood up and left the discussion area.","As he stood up, a few veterans stood up too.","\"I was shocked today. I didn’t expect you to be a couple with Ye Jian.\" White Crane rubbed his temples, indicating that he still hadn’t digested the ’shock’. \"It was too sudden. Captain, did you just get together with Ye Jian and are afraid that she’ll run away? Were you rushing to announce your relationship with her?\"","Xia Jinyuan smiled and replied, \"Wrong. I confessed to her when she was in grade eleven, and we were together when she graduated from grade twelve. We’ve been together for more than three years.\"","When Ye Jian was still in grade eleven, he confessed to her. The year she graduated... they got together. V8 held it in for a long time and spat out one word to express his feelings, \"Beast!\"","\"If I don’t act like a beast, should I wait for my love rivals to line up? You need to attack when it’s time. If not, you’ll regret it.\" Facing the word ’beast’, Xia Jinyuan remained calm and said confidently, \"Fortunately, I acted in time and successfully wooed Ye Jian. If not, I’d still be single like you.","\"Don’t say that I’m a beast. You should be a beast too. T6 is already engaged. You have to hurry up.\"","V8 was speechless. He didn’t want to talk anymore.","White Crane was refined. He couldn’t scold anyone, so he could only shut up.","The captain had foresight. He could only admire him!","Weaver didn’t want to say anything either. He actually didn’t notice anything. He didn’t notice anything at all. He even discussed who would snatch Azure Bird away. No matter how much he thought about it, he didn’t think the captain would be the one!","This thief was too cunning!","\"I’m sorry I didn’t tell you guys before. I’m sorry, brothers. She’s shy. What she said in front of us today has exhausted all her courage. Brothers, don’t disturb her. I’m afraid she’ll feel awkward.\"","They walked to the upper reaches of the river and sat in a circle. The few of them sat together and looked at the endless snow mountains in the distance. They listened to Xia Jinyuan’s sincere plea. He was the only one who spoke. The other veterans listened quietly."]},{"number":4534,"title":"Chapter 4534: New Henpecked Husband","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan deliberately left the topic to Z7. Before he left, he even gave Z7 a look to tell the veterans what he was thinking.","They were all brothers who had gone through thick and thin with him. There were some things he needed to say clearly.","There was a reason for this. He had been hiding their relationship for a few years, so he definitely had to apologize to his brothers. Since he had said it clearly, his brothers naturally understood why he had hidden it for so long.","\"I still have to ask for your help to remind the others not to say too much. I’m afraid that they won’t know their limits. It’s clearly a good thing, but some might feel sour over them and anger her. When the time comes, I’ll probably have to kneel down and admit my mistake.\"","Everyone listened attentively and nodded solemnly, indicating that they would take these words to heart. In the end, the veterans couldn’t help but laugh.","A fist landed on his shoulder. White Crane smiled and said, \"Alright, I know that you’re henpecked. I’ll show you some courtesy.\"","\"I really want to see you kneel. I hope I have the chance to watch the entire process.\"","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and glanced at Weaver. \"Don’t think too much about unrealistic things. You don’t have much brains to begin with. It takes the most brainpower to think.\"","\"Captain Xia, how did you woo Ye Jian? She’s a good woman. How did you ruin her? Based on your mouth, you should be single for the rest of your life!\" Weaver glared at him in doubt.","Xia Jinyuan raised his head and laughed. \"Brother, I place all my gentleness on her. So how could I have any good things left to say to you?\"","...","Fine, he wouldn’t continue chatting. The more he talked, the more his heart hurt.","\"Ahhh, I want to find a girlfriend.\"","\"Ahhh, I want to find a girlfriend too!\"","\"Ahhh, let’s find a girlfriend together!\"","\"Oh sh*t, I’m not going to find a girlfriend with you. We can’t both have the same girlfriend!\"","\"You’re asking for a beating!\"","\"Fight, fight, fight!\"","The sun was shining brightly. A group of iron-blooded men who fought for their country stood under the mountain ridge. The smoke on their bodies had yet to dissipate. They raised their hands and placed them on each other’s shoulders. Together, they raised their heads and shouted at the edge of the mountain. They shouted until their faces turned red. They bent their backs and laughed.","It was a very happy day that passed very quickly. The special forces soldiers, who had already gotten into the bulletproof military transport vehicle, hugged the rifles in their hands tightly and embarked on their journey again as the car shook.","Xia Jinyuan drove while Ye Jian sat in the front passenger seat. Occasionally, they would look at each other and smile.","This was good. This was really good.","The sun started to set in the west. The huge red fireball was in front of their vehicles. Five bulletproof trucks chased after the sun tirelessly.","Someone stood on a weathered rock and set up her camera to find the best position to take a photo of the beautiful sun setting in the west. Suddenly, a vehicle barged into the camera’s view. It was driving alongside the sun.","Click... Click...","The person taking the photos kept pressing the shutter and taking photos one after another.","Then, she put away the expensive camera and jumped off the rock. She quickly found another scenic spot. This time, there were five vehicles in the frame. Although it wasn’t a desert, it captured the magnificent scenery in the desert.","In the vehicle, Xia Jinyuan retracted his binoculars and turned on the microphone. He said calmly, \"Someone is taking photos on the right. Go and see who it is.\""]},{"number":4535,"title":"Chapter 4535: Holding Hands","paragraphs":["The five bulletproof trucks drove in the direction of the desert. They arrived at the Army Aviation’s helicopter landing point around noon in the day. They took the helicopter first before driving to the desert. They had just entered the edge of the desert.","The rough sand and gravel covered the hard soil. It was a desert scenery. It was rough and desolate. The dry surface was blown up by the sandstorm.","There were very few people around. Most of the soldiers in the military unit went for outdoor training. It was rare for people to come here to take photos. Now, the person was even chasing after their vehicles. Out of the vigilance of a professional soldier, Xia Jinyuan immediately ordered the members of the fifth vehicle to go and take a look.","If it were an ordinary cameraman, they would ask the person to leave. If it were a fellow with ulterior motives, the person would be sent to prison for ten days to half a month before being interrogated.","The members of the fifth vehicle received Xia Jinyuan’s order and immediately replied, \"Roger that. Target locked. The fifth vehicle will turn right and leave the team.\"","\"Roger!\"","The fifth bulletproof military truck turned right at a mountain fork and headed toward the target they had locked onto.","Ye Jian, who was in a deep sleep, didn’t know what was going on. She had been tired enough these few days. There was such a huge energy-consuming scene in the day. She couldn’t stand it anymore. Although the desert scenery was spectacular, she was sleeping soundly as the truck swayed.","After the fifth truck left, the other trucks stopped to replenish their fuel. Ye Jian, who was hugging her gun while sleeping, suddenly woke up. Her first reaction was to jump up from her seat and ask in a low voice, \"Why did we stop?\"","\"Someone is chasing after our trucks and taking photos secretly. The fifth truck drove over to take a look.\" Xia Jinyuan pulled the handbrake and saw that her helmet was tilted to the side. There was even a sleeping mark on her left cheek. He couldn’t help but smile. He reached out and helped her adjust her helmet. \"Did you sleep well? You didn’t sleep for long. It’s not a big deal. It can be solved quickly.\"","Ye Jian immediately snuggled back into her seat. She yawned and stretched out her hands and legs. She smiled and said, \"I’m not sleeping anymore. I’ve been sleeping for a few hours. Let’s get off the truck and look at the beautiful scenery of the desert.\"","\"Okay, let’s get down and move around.\"","Xia Jinyuan nodded at what she said. The love in his eyes was so great that Ye Jian didn’t dare to look at him directly. She even reminded him softly, \"Captain Xia, don’t... look at me like that. I’ve drawn enough hatred today. If this continues, I’m really worried that I won’t be able to cover you.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who had already pushed open the door and was about to get out, sat back down and leaned toward Ye Jian. His skills were too good. Every move was completed quickly and fiercely. Ye Jian was so shocked that she thought that he wanted to do something in the car. She hid in the corner.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t let her dodge. He unbuckled her seatbelt and raised his hand. He pinched the tip of her nose and said arrogantly, \"I’ll cover you.\"","Xia Jinyuan was very arrogant.","\"Don’t think too much. I know what I’m doing.\" He pinched the tip of her nose and patted her helmet. The young lieutenant colonel pushed open the door and got out with a kick.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled when she saw the change in his gaze. She got down from the compartment too.","She wouldn’t tell him that just now, when he got out of the car handsomely, she was electrified. It was fine as long as she knew and was secretly happy in her heart.","At this moment, the sun had already set on the mountaintop. Only half of it was visible. With the other half as the center, large amounts of golden sunlight dyed the place, but the range of illumination was limited. The sky around them was already darkening.","Ye Jian, who was leaning against the front of the truck, opened the military canteen and drank a few mouthfuls of the snow water from the river. The cold water seemed to have the fragrance of snow, making her feel refreshed when drinking it."]},{"number":4536,"title":"Chapter 4536: Qin Ying Has Character","paragraphs":["At the end of the sky, the undulating mountains were covered in gold. In the sky, one could see hills connected together. The wind blew from the other side of the mountain with sand, sweeping past their ears with a sound that seemed to have come from ancient times. As the sand rose, they seemed to see thousands of horses galloping, creating a magnificent scene that only belonged to this place.","The place where they stopped was considered an oasis. There were low bushes with spikes around them. There were bushes growing there. A faint sound came from the bushes. Ye Jian couldn’t help but narrow her eyes because of the sand. She looked at the source of the sound and saw two sand mice flapping their short legs and eating the bushes quickly.","There were many small animals in the oasis. Sand jumpers were the most common. If they were lucky, they could even see wolves.","The path they were walking on had border defense sentry posts. In front of them was a depopulated zone. There were almost no signs of human habitation. Hence, there were many more small animals in the oasis than tourists. The animals even seemed much bolder than usual.","Footsteps were heard. Ye Jian, who was leaning against the front of the truck, didn’t need to turn around to know who it was. She pointed at the two sand jumpers who hadn’t left and smiled. \"Shouldn’t they be timid? Why are they so bold?\"","\"If they have yet to discover you, they’ll naturally be bold,\" Xia Jinyuan said. The two sand jumpers, who were nearly two meters away from them, fled into the depths like arrows. Their speed was very fast, and there was even a wisp of sand smoke.","Ye Jian laughed and glanced at the man who was walking closer. \"You scared them away.\"","\"If you like them, I’ll catch a few for you to play with later. They can be our dinner too.\"","It was impossible to prepare military food in advance for dozens of days of desert training. Besides water resources that would be airdropped, they would have to hunt. Wild rabbits and snakes could all be food. As for whether it was too brutal or not, it was not a consideration.","They were willing to protect small animals, but in order to survive, they had to store their stamina.","The resting team members had already crawled into the bushes to find food to fill their stomachs tonight. With their skills, it wouldn’t take long for them to return with a good harvest. Wherever they passed... all the small animals within a few kilometers fled and didn’t dare to approach again.","The fiery red sun had completely set, and the sky was about to turn dark. The wind that blew seemed to be stronger than before. Farther away on the mountain, there was a huge gray wind that seemed to be rolling something over.","Xia Jinyuan, who was leaning against the front of the truck with Ye Jian, had a satisfied smile on his handsome face at first. In the next second, his expression darkened. He turned around and placed his hands on the front of the truck to climb up. After observing for a few seconds, he said to Ye Jian in a low voice, \"Give me the binoculars!\"","Ye Jian immediately walked over, opened the truck door, and took out the binoculars.","Xia Jinyuan took the binoculars and looked at the end of the sky for about 30 seconds. He jumped up from the front of the car. \"There’s a sandstorm. Get in!\"","Sandstorm?","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes and replied, \"Yes.\" She quickly hugged her gun and jumped into the truck.","She had never driven a bulletproof military truck before, so she could only sit in the front passenger seat. Xia Jinyuan didn’t get into the truck immediately. Instead, he informed all his team members to gather immediately.","Before the team members who went to the bushes to settle their dinner could return, Xia Jinyuan climbed onto the roof of the truck and raised the rifle in his hand to fire three shots at the sky to warn them.","The deep sound of gunshots alarmed the team members who had left. Three gunshots were a warning. This meant they had to leave during training. It meant that something had happened.","The six team members didn’t delay for a second. They picked up the sand jumpers and snakes they caught and ran back to the team.","Xia Jinyuan contacted the members of the fifth truck and asked about the situation."]},{"number":4537,"title":"Chapter 4537: Please Let Go","paragraphs":["T6’s laughter came from the wireless earpiece. \"Captain, something very, very interesting happened here. I’ll tell you about it when we come back. Hahaha, I’ll be able to laugh for a year! No, our brothers will be able to laugh about this for a year.\"","\"A sandstorm is coming. Return to the team quickly!\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t smile. The sandstorm that came at a high speed covered the sky. They were at a bottleneck. It was very likely that the sandstorm would turn into a tornado. A sandstorm in the desert could be so powerful that it could send cows, sheep, and people flying.","\"Alright!\"","T6 stopped laughing and said seriously, \"The fifth truck will return to the team immediately!\"","\"Return to the team! A sandstorm is coming! Everyone, return to the team!\"","The fifth truck was not far away. Soon, they heard the sound of wheels rolling over rough gravel as the truck drove over from the narrow brown hill. All five trucks were gathered and quickly drove away from the bottleneck that led into the desert.","After the fifth truck returned to the team, Xia Jinyuan asked around and found out that it wasn’t a spy. It was a photographer with an access pass. Her surname was Qin. She probably had a powerful background. If not, how could she have gotten an access pass to this military restricted area?","Xia Jinyuan wasn’t afraid of a powerful background. He just found it troublesome.","As he drove, he frowned and said, \"It’s not convenient for us to bring her. We’ll send her back to her original spot after the sandstorm ends.\" He paused for a moment and said, \"Find the nearest shelter.\"","Bringing an outsider along was a huge problem for them. If it weren’t for the sandstorm, they would have let her go on the spot and ignored her.","However, the sandstorm came too coincidentally. It was impossible for them to sit back and do nothing. They could only bring her along first.","Ye Jian didn’t pay much attention to it. These things were handled by the captain.","T6, who was sitting in the front passenger seat, was still laughing. His neck was red. \"Captain, let me tell you, something big is going to happen this time. V8 was targeted by the photographer in front of all of us.\"","Xia Jinyuan braked on the spot. The terrain in front was not flat to begin with, and the car ride was bumpy the entire time. He suddenly braked, and everyone in the car fell forward. Ye Jian fell so hard that she barely managed to hold the dashboard with both hands.","\"What happened?\" Xia Jinyuan’s expression darkened. He stepped on the accelerator again and looked for a shelter. \"Is there no problem with her identity?\"","It was not Xia Jinyuan’s fault for being suspicious. It was because of the mention of V8.","\"Her identity is confirmed. I have all the documents. As for what happened, none of us understand. She’s quite beautiful. But for some reason, she’s pestering V8. E6 was so angry that he almost vomited blood. He even asked me why he wasn’t the one who was told to go capture the photographer. In the end, the good opportunity was snatched up by V8.\"","T6 slapped his thigh and laughed wildly. E6, who was driving, had a resentful expression.","It was lively at the back of the truck. The seven special forces soldiers looked at each other and lowered their heads. They laughed until their stomachs cramped.","Poor V8 was struggling on the verge of death...","\"Sit further away! There’s a difference between men and women. If you do this... I won’t be able to hug the gun. Miss, I’m begging you. Sit up straight.","\"Why are you still squeezing? You’re almost squeezing me out of the car!","\"Miss, what are you doing ? Do you think someone who has fainted can move around like you? Stop pretending. I’m begging you.","\"Brother, can I change seats with you? I have nowhere to sit.","\"Don’t hug my arm. You, you, you... Let go of me! My gun, my gun!\""]},{"number":4538,"title":"Chapter 4538: The Man Who Was Molested","paragraphs":["The entire truck was filled with the sounds of V8 struggling. He didn’t dare to speak too loudly, afraid that his comrades would notice him. However, the more he did this, the more he was pestered.","\"Did you faint? Stop pretending and sit up straight! Oh my god, I’m afraid of you. I’m really afraid of you! It was my fault just now. I shouldn’t have been too ruthless. I apologize. Please sit up straight!\"","V8 kept begging for mercy from the bulletproof truck. He was even shy. How could he not be shy?","They suspected that the photographer was a spy, and in the end... he was now stuck to her!","It was all his fault!","If it weren’t for his quick reflexes, he would have been molested by her!","Ten minutes ago, V8, who was wearing sunglasses and had a cold facial expression, went behind the suspected ’spy’ and took her down.","Her actions were fast and fierce. Even though he could tell that she was a woman, V8 didn’t show any mercy. He grabbed her hands and pressed her to the ground. He said fiercely, \"Don’t move. If you move again, I’ll cripple you!\"","At that moment, V8 was very manly and had a fierce aura.","After his comrades quickly checked the person’s luggage, identification, and even her laptop, V8 felt awkward.","She wasn’t a spy. She was a serious cameraman who had obtained permission to enter and leave this area. Besides a bunch of landscape photos, there were also... battlefield photos.","Eight members were sent out. V8 was in charge of capturing the ’spy’. Two were on guard, and two stayed behind. Two checked the luggage, and one assisted V8. In the end, V8 ended up treating the photographer called Qin Ying rudely.","V8 let go awkwardly. The eight people with steel guns and goggles lined up and apologized to the photographer, Qin Ying. At the same time, they told her not to chase after their trucks and take photos. It would be easy to misunderstand that she was a spy.","Who was Qin Ying? She was the photographer who carried her expensive equipment all over the country. She wiped the dust off her face and glared coldly at the soldiers who suddenly appeared. She walked in front of V8 without saying anything and only said, \"It was you just now, right?\" She raised her boot and kicked V8’s calf.","V8 wanted to endure it, but he felt that the force of her kick was strong, so he dodged it. After avoiding it... the woman in front of him sneered and pounced on him like an octopus.","\"You dodged me? You pressed me to the ground and made me eat dust. Do you still have the face to hide?\"","Qin Ying pounced on V8 in a valiant posture and used her close combat skills. Her fists were like raindrops as they punched V8.","T6 and the other seven had never seen such close combat before. They were all dumbfounded.","V8 was dumbfounded too. He was still holding a gun in his hand. This woman pounced on him with her legs hooked around his waist. It was as if she was sitting on him. The woman’s tender body made him lean back repeatedly to prevent himself from being accused of taking advantage of her later.","He dodged, but she hit him even harder. In the end, she hit him until his helmet fell off...","After his helmet fell, the scenery changed. It became like this. She was a domineering woman bullying a man!","He kept squeezing, dodging, and shrinking toward the truck’s door. He was clearly more than 1.8 meters tall, but he still couldn’t get rid of the woman beside him!","In the end, V8 had no choice. He touched the lock of the door and warned the photographer who would sit on his lap if she squeezed any more. \"If you continue like this, I, I, I... I’ll jump off the truck. Let me tell you, I’ll really jump off the truck!\""]},{"number":4539,"title":"Chapter 4539: Bullied","paragraphs":["All the comrades in the truck heard him.","V8 had turned off the wireless communication device. When he was dodging just now, he accidentally touched it and turned it on. His words about jumping off the truck were transmitted to everyone’s ears through the public channel.","Everyone was stunned.","What was going on?","Jump off the truck?","What were the brothers in the fifth truck doing?","Besides the brothers in the fifth truck who knew what was going on, only Xia Jinyuan knew why V8 would want to jump out of the truck. He wanted to keep a straight face, but he couldn’t. The corners of his mouth twitched a few times. He said helplessly to Ye Jian, \"The photographer who just got into the truck has taken a fancy to V8. It seems she’s been leaning on V8 the entire time. How powerful must she be to force V8 to want to jump out of the truck?\"","Ye Jian laughed when she heard that. \"No way. Is there another reason? They didn’t injure the photographer just now, right? Why don’t we stop the car and I’ll go over and ask? It’ll be more convenient for women to ask certain questions.","\"Also, she’s sitting alone with eight burly men. She’s not familiar with them at all. If it were me, I would feel awkward too.\"","She was even pushing V8 to the point where he wanted to jump off the truck. Although she heard V8 saying that he wanted to jump off the truck, it was hard to believe that the photographer was the one responsible for it. There had to be another reason.","\"The sandstorm is coming. Let’s find a place first.\" Xia Jinyuan didn’t agree. Time was tight. Everything could wait until they got out of the car.","In the end, V8 didn’t manage to jump out of the truck. Qin Ying, who had been acting valiantly all throughout, laughed and finally let V8 off.","There was no hurry. There was still a long way to go.","\"I’m sorry. I have this problem where I feel guilty after hitting someone and need to find a sense of security. I’m sorry to have troubled you.\"","At this moment, Qin Ying became normal. She brushed her hair and apologized sincerely. She smiled at V8 and said, \"I’m sorry to have made things difficult for you. Please forgive me.\"","Qin Ying, who was wearing a pair of slightly tight light blue denim pants, a white shirt, and a pair of light camel-colored sand boots, apologized generously. Her wild and elegant temperament made the special forces soldiers who were watching the entire process clear their throats and reply, \"It’s okay. We were in the wrong first.\"","What else could V8 say?","He couldn’t say that he had been taken advantage of by a woman, right? He shifted his body uncomfortably and said calmly with a straight face, \"Just sit properly. You don’t have to apologize to us.\"","She just had to stop squeezing next to him!","Qin Ying raised her eyebrows and turned her head. Her makeup was clean as she had only lightly filled in her eyebrows. She stretched out her fair hand and smiled. \"Then let’s shake hands and make peace. We won’t fuss about our mistakes just now.\"","V8 stared at her fair hand and pursed his lips awkwardly. In the end, he held it.","The contrast between his tanned hand and her fair hand made her hand look even paler.","Qin Ying retracted her hand. She didn’t move closer to V8 until they reached the shelter. She didn’t do anything rude either.","She didn’t say anything she shouldn’t. She only asked where she could place her equipment. Then, she took out her phone and played the snake game quietly until they got out of the truck.","V8 opened the truck door and got out first. Normally, after he got out of the truck, his comrades would take care of themselves and didn’t need his help. V8 was naturally the same. He had just taken half a step when he suddenly smelled a faint perfume that smelled like flowers. He retracted half a step and turned around.","He raised his head and looked at the photographer who was about to get off the truck. He reached out his hand and said unnaturally, \"Erm, get off...\"","Qin Ying smiled and jumped down from the truck. She said, \"Thank you, but it’s not that high.\"","Then, his comrades who got out of the car winked at V8. V8 secretly raised his leg and squeezed out a word through his mouth, \"Scram!\""]},{"number":4540,"title":"Chapter 4540: Five Years Of Love","paragraphs":["V8, who was carrying a gun, was so awkward that he only wanted to stay away from this photographer. He couldn’t take it at all. He didn’t dare to stay with her anymore!","The trucks drove for about three kilometers before turning into a shelter. The sandstorm that swept over from the sky was right in front of them. There was already a layer of yellow dust on the windshields of the trucks.","\"Get off, get off!\"","Xia Jinyuan was the first to jump down from the truck in front. Right on the heels of that, the door of the truck opened and eight comrades got down quickly. The other trucks stopped, everyone got down immediately.","The sandstorm arrived. Yellow sand filled the sky and swept over. V8 said to Qin Ying in a low voice, \"The sandstorm will arrive soon. Hurry up!\"","Qin Ying looked at the young officer whose stiff and cold eyebrows were revealed under his helmet. She pointed at the team member who was carrying the desert camouflage cloth and said calmly, \"I know. Hurry up and go.\"","V8 glanced at her and didn’t say anything else. He picked up his rifle and immediately went back to his work.","To prevent the trucks from being covered by sand and dust, the five trucks had to be covered.","Qin Ying didn’t go alone. She stood in the sand less than a meter away from the others. When the young officers threw the desert camouflage cloth over, she joined them and pulled the camouflage cloth that was fluttering in the wind. She covered the car tightly.","V8 tied the tether to the wheel and was about to tie the second wheel when he realized that a woman was kneeling on the ground. She pulled the tether tightly and crawled under the wheel. Then, she stuffed the tether out of the gap between the rims and buckled it to the other end.","She didn’t need any help the entire time and completed the task alone.","After she finished, she didn’t say anything else. She covered her eyes with one hand and ran toward the shelter.","V8 frowned. He took off his helmet and chased after her. He apologized and put the helmet on Qin Ying’s head. Then, he wrapped one hand around the back of her neck and hugged her shoulder tightly to protect her as he sprinted toward the shelter.","The yellow sand was everywhere. The wind carried gravel along with it too. It would hit the soldiers’ helmets. V8, who didn’t have a helmet, was hit on the forehead by the sharp gravel. Blood flowed out and was covered by the yellow sand that hit his face. It actually had a hemostatic effect.","V8 didn’t make a sound when he bled. Qin Ying knew that the young officer who was shielding her while running must have been hit in the head or even injured.","Five years... How many days and nights had it been? That photo she took was developed several times a year. The first photo faded because of her fingers. Now, there was a photo album in her backpack. It was filled with photos of him alone. It was also the only photo. The number of his photos that she had developed in the past five years was equivalent to the number of photos in the photo album.","Even if the photos were worn out, she couldn’t bear to throw them away.","She couldn’t find him for a long time. She didn’t manage to see him again. It was as if he didn’t exist in this world. She thought she would have to wait another ten years...","Unexpectedly, there was a silver lining. She was forced to get married by the madam of her family and escaped to the desert to relax. She also took a few sets of photos to cover her living expenses. Unexpectedly... she met him again!","She hadn’t been able to find the person she was looking for, but she met him this time!","How could she not be excited? She was so excited that she ignored all womanly reservations and hugged his head to kiss him fiercely. She wanted to kiss him, but she suddenly stopped and kissed his face instead.","The kiss on his face was enough to make her so excited that she was drunk. She was really drunk. She was so drunk that she couldn’t believe that she had really met him. She was so drunk that she kept pestering him while secretly pinching her thigh to confirm that she wasn’t dreaming.","She wasn’t dreaming. She wasn’t dreaming. With her bruised thighs as evidence, she really wasn’t dreaming!"]},{"number":4541,"title":"Chapter 4541: Stay Away","paragraphs":["Although he was a little different from the person in her photo, the moment he grabbed her and hugged her, she knew he was a Chinese soldier in the photo who would never give in!","She confirmed that he was the person she was looking for.","\"Is everyone here? Is everyone here? Team, gather the number of people!\" G3 rushed in and shouted. Just as he finished shouting, T6’s tense voice was heard. \"My team is still short of V8 and that photographer.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, V8’s voice was heard. \"Report.\"","T6 instantly relaxed when he heard the voice. The photographer who was supposed to be the first to come here was nowhere to be seen. This made him slightly worried.","Now that the two of them were here together, they were safe.","The comrades from the first truck were at the innermost part of the natural cave. Ye Jian was patting the dust off her face and body. Xia Jinyuan patted the yellow sand off her back and said in a low voice, \"Go and understand her situation. Then, tell her we’ll send her back to her original spot immediately after the sandstorm.\"","\"Okay.\" Ye Jian nodded. After the yellow sand on her back was patted clean, she patted off Xia Jinyuan, who was also covered in yellow dust. In order to avoid suspicion, the two of them deliberately chose a dark corner. In addition, the yellow sand covered the moon and no sunlight could be seen. The two of them were invisible.","With the darkness as a screen, there was the intimacy between lovers.","No one came over to disturb them. They patted the sand off each other.","Neither of them spoke.","It was because Qin Ying was present.","\"Let them treat your head injury. Thank you for just now.\" Qin Ying’s calm voice came from the sound of patting. She was very calm, as if she was an independent woman who had been through many things and wouldn’t take any small matters seriously.","The voice floated from the front to the end. Ye Jian paused for a moment and narrowed her eyes. She recalled where she had heard this familiar female voice before.","She slowly patted the yellow dust off Xia Jinyuan’s back and recalled it until she remembered.","\"Captain Xia, I’ve met her before.\"","\"You’ve met her before? Where?\" Xia Jinyuan turned around abruptly. \"Were you photographed too?\"","\"No, I saw her at the airport. She’s... Qin Xiu’s sister.\" Ye Jian was quite right. After going around in circles, she realized that Qin Ying, who was suspected to be a spy, was actually Qin Xiu’s sister.","If she was Qin Xiu’s sister, they could confirm that there was no problem with her.","But she still couldn’t follow them. They had to send away the people who should be sent away.","\"You don’t have to do anything. We’ll just leave when the sandstorm stops. Rest for a while.\" Xia Jinyuan didn’t plan to let Ye Jian meet Qin Ying. Ha, it was better for her to stay away from his love rival’s sister.","Ye Jian smiled and made a sound of acknowledgment. She seemed to have seen through his plan.","V8, who took the helmet, acknowledged Qin Ying’s words in a low voice. Then, he turned around and asked T6 to wipe the wound on his forehead. He didn’t ask Qin Ying how she knew that his forehead was injured. Firstly, it was awkward. Secondly, it was unnatural. Thirdly... he was still shy.","Qin Ying could feel that the young officer was very uncomfortable with her. He was like a young man, and he was even nervous when he spoke. Tsk, what a pure soldier.","It was better to let her keep such an innocent soldier. She didn’t want him to be harmed outside.","She had been looking for him for five years. If he had been snatched up by another woman, she might as well cut her hair and become a nun. Why get married at all?","No matter how smart V8 was, he couldn’t predict himself being targeted. He didn’t expect to be pestered in the evening after he shouted for a girlfriend.","V8, who didn’t think too much about it, was still focused on staying away from Qin Ying."]},{"number":4542,"title":"Chapter 4542: Provocation","paragraphs":["After patting the yellow dust off her body, Qin Ying didn’t look for V8 immediately. She was still very excited. There were many things she wanted to say to the young officer she had been looking for for five years. She had been thinking about what she should say and what kind of good impression she should leave him if they met again one day.","In the end...","Qin Ying, who was silently wiping the dust off her face, recalled her actions. Even though she had always been carefree, she couldn’t help but cover her face in regret.","She was a little too enthusiastic just now. She wondered if she scared the innocent special forces soldier away.","He was probably frightened.","He even wanted to jump off the truck.","So what if he was frightened? She wouldn’t give up just because he was frightened. For five years, she only had this man in her mind. For the past five years, she would always see that man in her dreams. Giving up was impossible.","The sandstorm outside was frighteningly huge. The shelter they were in was already considered good, but there was still sand gushing in. Qin Ying, who was standing at the side quietly, gradually realized that something was wrong.","This group of well-trained soldiers was like mutes. They hadn’t made a sound since they came in.","It was probably not that they had not made a sound but that they were communicating very softly.","Because she was present, they had no choice but to communicate in low voices.","If they didn’t communicate, how could she get the personal information of the young officer she had been having a crush on for five years? Even if she did not get his personal information, it was good to know which military unit he served in.","The special forces soldiers who were secretly communicating cleaned themselves up. G3 was in charge of arranging for people to be on guard while V8 took the initiative to stand on guard.","G3 laughed until the corners of his eyes were about to cramp. He said in a low voice, \"Didn’t you say that you wanted to find a girlfriend earlier in the day? Why are you so timid now? There were seven or eight of you guys, but she chose you. Young man, your future is bright.\"","\"Nonsense. I pressed her to the ground, so she took revenge on me.\" V8 was unmoved. He said carefully, \"Don’t say anything in front of her. I have my dignity.\"","\"Alright, I won’t say anything more. But I want to ask you if she’s your type. I know that Ye Jian isn’t your type.\" It wasn’t for nothing that they had been comrades for so many years. G3 hit the nail on the head.","V8 was silent for a while. He laughed and said, \"Don’t fool around. It doesn’t matter to me since I’m a man. But she’s a lady. Her reputation is very important.\"","\"Alright, I’ll leave. You guys can rest.\"","V8 didn’t answer the question. G3 deliberately provoked him, saying, \"You don’t like this, and you don’t like that. Maybe you like Ye Jian!\"","\"F*ck, I still want to live for a few more years!\" V8 jumped up like a grasshopper. He didn’t waste any more time talking and fled with his gun.","Ye Jian was not bad. Her personality and temper were very good. However, she had a cold aura around her. It was good to be comrades. As for being his girlfriend... She was most suitable to be Captain Xia’s girlfriend.","Not everyone could be ’loved’ by everyone. No matter how outstanding Ye Jian was, she wasn’t V8’s type.","Of course, Ye Jian didn’t need other men to show their love to her other than Captain Xia.","What kind of person did V8 like?","G3 remembered the few months when V8 first joined the military unit. If he wasn’t so capable, J5 would have wanted to send him back to his original military unit.","He was very timid and didn’t dare to communicate with others. When he spoke, it was as if his voice was squeezed out. His voice was as soft as a mosquito. If his gender wasn’t listed as ’male’ on his files, they would’ve thought he was a woman!"]},{"number":4543,"title":"Chapter 4543: Matchmaking","paragraphs":["Later, he heard from V8 that it was because he had a strict upbringing since he was young and was disciplined too much. He only knew how to study and didn’t even have the right to make friends. Joining the military was V8’s greatest resistance to his parents.","Until now, V8 still had a grudge against his family. The other comrades went home when they had leave, but V8 would only take the initiative to give up his leave. He also told Captain Xia very clearly that he didn’t want to go home at all.","The captain had talked to him many times, but the only reply he received was that the military unit was his home. He was very happy. Going home was torture for him. He didn’t want to experience it again.","After that, Major General Yang called V8’s family personally. No one knew what he said, but Major General Yang said to the team, \"In the future, the military unit will be his home. You will be his family. No one can persuade him to go home to visit.\"","Until now, that conversation was a mystery. Even Captain Xia didn’t manage to find out.","V8 was lonelier than anyone else. As comrades, they had always hoped that he could find a woman who was passionate enough to dissolve his loneliness. For instance, the photographer who forced V8 to blush was good!","She was so enthusiastic, outgoing, and even proactive... G3 really wanted to pack V8 up and give him to Qin Ying.","Before packing him up and giving him away... he needed to confirm if the beautiful photographer had any thoughts about V8.","G3 turned around and told Xia Jinyuan his thoughts. As Xia Jinyuan had met Qin Ying a few times, it was inconvenient for him to show his face. After thinking for a while, he smiled and said, \"Qin Ying has a powerful background. Her mother values family background very much. However, Qin Ying has always been at odds with her mother... You can give it a try. You can ask Qin Ying first.\"","\"Ask T6 to come over. I’ll ask him some questions. We have to do things properly. We can’t embarrass V8.\"","V8’s situation was special. They had to handle it carefully.","Ye Jian’s understanding of V8’s personal situation was limited to him. As for his family situation, she didn’t know anything about that. Hearing that, she frowned slightly and said worriedly, \"Why am I not confident in this? I’ve seen Mrs. Qin before. She’s a mother who has a strong desire to control everything around her. This concerns Qin Ying’s marriage. She definitely won’t let Qin Ying off.","\"If Qin Ying really likes V8, V8 will slowly fall in love with her too. In the end, Mrs. Qin will come forward and break up the couple. Captain Xia, let’s not end up doing something bad despite our good intentions.\"","\"Qin Ying has never listened to her family’s arrangements. She carves her own path. As long as she doesn’t give up, the Qin family can’t do anything to Qin Ying.\"","Xia Jinyuan held Ye Jian’s hand and rubbed the back of her hand with his fingers. Then, he said, \"Not everyone is as lucky as us to receive the blessings of the elders in the family.","\"If the two of them really like each other, they won’t give up.\"","That was right. Not everyone was as lucky as her and Captain Xia. Some relationships became more true after experiencing storms, while others couldn’t withstand any storms. If the two of them really got together, she hoped that the two of them would last.","However...","Ye Jian sighed softly and smiled bitterly. \"Why do you think that the two of them can give it a try? It wasn’t a pleasant first meeting. I can’t imagine Qin Ying having a good impression of V8.\"","It was too inexplicable.","\"That’s why I need to find T6 to confirm what happened before taking the next step.\" Xia Jinyuan narrowed his eyes slightly. There was a hint of resignation in his clean voice. \"I can’t let go of any opportunities. I have to try.\"","Otherwise, they would all be old bachelors..."]},{"number":4544,"title":"Chapter 4544: Divine Help","paragraphs":["T6 came over very quickly. When he knew that even the captain wanted to matchmake the photographer and V8, he recalled everything that happened.","After listening carefully, Xia Jinyuan thought the once complicated matter had become simple. He picked out the crux of the matter and said with interest, \"You said that Qin Ying pounced on V8 and hit him until his helmet fell. Then, Qin Ying was stunned for a moment before hugging V8 to kiss him...\"","T6 was amused. \"That’s right. We were all dumbfounded by her kiss.\" Although it had a while, T6 still felt very happy when he thought of the scene.","He didn’t expect V8 to have such a day!","Back then, when the two of them became partners, Captain Xia had a serious private conversation with T6. He hoped that his ’madness’ could affect V8 and let this child who lacked love feel a family’s gentleness and adoration.","At that time, T6 really wanted to beat up the captain who had been here for less than a month.","After a long test, the captain had proved his skills. V8, who lacked love, could finally laugh. He was no longer a child who lacked love.","Now that he was fancied by a beautiful photographer, T6 wanted to matchmake them more than anyone else.","Seeing that the captain had such an intention, there was a chance!","\"Captain Xia, we have to give him a push. I bet that beautiful photographer will definitely have a good impression of V8 if we help him\".","However, V8 was able to say that there were differences between men and women in the car. It wouldn’t be easy for him to pursue this photographer!","In the dark, Xia Jinyuan narrowed his eyes like a scheming official. He thought for a moment and smiled at G3. \"A woman chasing a man. Can Qing Ying...\"","Xia Jinyuan felt his back hurting. He immediately changed his words. \"Whether she can woo V8 or not depends on us. Ask Qin Ying what she wants first. If she’s interested, everything will be easy!\"","Ye Jian, who was standing behind him, calmly retracted her hand.","\"Go ahead. Ask her about everything before she leaves. If there’s a chance, we’ll help her. If not, forget it.\"","Xia Jinyuan rubbed his back and waved his hand, indicating for his comrades to do what they needed to do.","G3 and T6 didn’t see the movements clearly. They relied on their minds to understand and did their own things.","Qin Ying had been sitting alone. No one approached her. She sat on the ground and leaned against the uneven rock surface. Her gaze landed on the edge of the cave entrance. She could see two figures there. One of them was the man she had been searching for a long time.","At this moment, Qin Ying was not as unrestrained as before. Her gaze was as calm as the moonlight. It was faint and gentle.","After calming down, she no longer did astonishing things due to her surprise. At this moment, Qin Ying was like a painting. She had the carefreeness left behind by the river of time.","No one knew what she was thinking. They sat there quietly and watched her. They didn’t have the heart to disturb her. Occasionally, her eyes would move slightly. A scorching fire could be seen in the depths of her pupils. The light that instantly burst out seemed to be able to illuminate everything.","Qin Ying didn’t change her posture for a long time. She maintained her gaze and looked outside without moving as if she was in a meditative state.","Someone was approaching. The heat caused Qin Ying to retract her gaze. She twisted her neck slightly and looked at the black shadow walking over. After confirming that the black shadow was walking toward her, Qin Ying stood up."]},{"number":4545,"title":"Chapter 4545: You Have To Take The Initiative","paragraphs":["G3 smiled and reached out his hand to introduce himself. \"Hello, I’m Xulin’s vice-captain. Please forgive me for offending you previously.\"","He took the initiative to talk to her and said the name of the person she liked. Did he notice something?","If he really noticed something... Qin Ying’s gaze moved slightly as she reached out her hand and smiled. \"Hello, I’m Qin Ying. You’ve already apologized to me several times, so I won’t take it to heart. I still have to thank you for bringing me along. If not, I’m afraid I’d be hugging a pile of equipment and flying freely in the air, waiting to land.\"","Generous, dignified, humorous, and carefree... With just this exchange, G3 became even more determined to pair the two of them up.","\"That’s good, that’s good. We were afraid that you’d mind. Now, I can tell Xulin that you’re not angry. He can rest assured.\"","\"I should be the one apologizing. I overreacted and almost forced him to jump off the truck.\" Qin Ying smiled humorously. \"I wanted to talk to him, but he didn’t give me a chance at all. Before you came, I was thinking about how to apologize to him.\"","\"Hahaha, there’s no need to apologize to him. Miss Qin, I have a question that I need to ask you.\" G3 suddenly changed the topic and became especially serious. \"Please answer me truthfully, Miss Qin.\"","The moment was here!","Qin Ying nodded. \"Please go ahead.\"","\"Miss Qin, do you know Xulin?\"","\"I met him once five years ago. I know him, but he doesn’t know me. So it can’t really be said that I know him. It’s just that he appeared on my camera at that time.\"","On camera? When? What was V8 doing at that time?","G3’s expression changed, but his voice was still the same. \"Miss Qin, were you taking photos of the scenery that time too?\"","\"No, I was on a battlefield. I took a photo of him in Nierbo. Don’t worry, I was a photographer for the Military Times at that time.\"","Qin Ying could feel the change in G3. She didn’t need G3 to ask in detail. She took the initiative to explain clearly, \"At that time, I wanted the accompanying war reporter to follow closely and interview the young soldier who had half of his face covered in blood but was fearless. In the end...\"","Recalling that scene, Qin Ying, whose heart was still palpitating, looked at the figure standing in front of her again. Her voice softened. \"In the end, when I pressed the shutter and turned my head, he disappeared from my camera in less than ten seconds.","\"So, although I’ve met him, I don’t know him. Although his photo has been saved in my laptop for five years, I didn’t know his name until today. I’m sorry, but I want to ask for his full name. Can you tell me?\"","There was actually such a relationship!","G3 smiled. \"Xulin’s surname is Yang. He’s Yang Xulin. I hope you can remember him. After five years, I didn’t expect you to recognize Xulin at a glance. I have to say that you’re good at... recognizing people.\"","Recognizing people... These two words were interesting.","Qin Ying agreed and smiled. \"Although it’s been five years, the memory feels like it just happened five days ago. If not, how could I have recognized him at a glance?\"","\"We met again five years later, and I couldn’t control myself in a moment of excitement. Thinking about it now, it was especially awkward. I hope you can say a few words to Xulin. As for me, I can’t remember what I did at that time. I hope Xulin won’t have any psychological trauma.\"","\"Of course, of course. Miss Qin, do you still want to contact Xulin in the future?\"","\"What do you think? Do you really think that I have a good memory? No, no, no. My memory is actually very bad.\""]},{"number":4546,"title":"Chapter 4546: Delightful Betrayal","paragraphs":["\"Hahaha, good, good. You guys will definitely keep in contact in the future. However, Xulin is very introverted and has never had a girlfriend. He’s quite innocent. I’m afraid he’ll anger you in some aspects. Please forgive him.\"","\"I, Qin Ying, can’t list out my advantages in other aspects. I just know that I’m patient and passionate about pursuing life.\"","\"That’s great. I think you’ll definitely become good friends with Xulin.\" G3 was smiling so hard that the corners of his mouth were about to split open.","\"Of course. I will try my best to make Xulin accept me as his female friend.\" Qin Ying smiled and replied. \"After all, this is the first time I’ve taken the initiative to contact a man.\"","As expected, she was innocent. She had never had a boyfriend before. She was introverted, but when she met Qin Ying, she didn’t act like it.","After the exchange, both sides were very happy.","It didn’t sound like V8 and Qin Ying would become boyfriend and girlfriend in the future. Qin Ying didn’t say that she had liked V8 for five years. G3 didn’t ask Qin Ying to take the initiative to make a move on V8 either. He didn’t say anything, but the two of them knew what he meant.","Their words seemed to be something completely unrelated, but they could understand each other’s true meaning.","As for V8, he didn’t know that he had been sold to Qin Ying by his comrades just like that. He stood there motionlessly and carried out his duty as a sentry.","The power of the sandstorm outside was weakening bit by bit. The night sky that was covered by the yellow dust gradually became clearer and brighter. The resplendent stars flickered, making the entire desert glitter.","Qin Ying continued to sit at the same spot and watch. She waited for V8 to finish his sentry duty. She was holding a photo that had been developed. Before she left, she would pass the photo to him. Her contact information was attached to the photo.","After completing his mission, G3 smiled and said to Xia Jinyuan, \"Their five-year relationship is really unexpected. I didn’t expect a beautiful woman to have been searching for V8 for five years. Captain Xia, there’s a chance.\"","\"From the looks of it, there’s indeed a chance. It depends on how things develop. Did you remind Qin Ying to take the initiative? It’s difficult for V8 to take the initiative.\"","Xia Jinyuan was very happy too. As the captain, he was also part-time matchmaker, elder, parent, and other positions. He had the heavy responsibility of solving all the bachelors’ problems in the team. Alas, there was still a long way to go. He would solve one problem at a time.","When Qin Ying left, the team realized that she had a satellite phone. The person who picked her up was so anxious that he almost contacted the Qin family. Fortunately, the call was connected in the end, and he heaved a sigh of relief when he knew that she was safe.","The team had turned on the high-power screen. Even the satellite communication was intercepted by Han Zheng. Only then did Qin Ying know that the person who picked her up was about to go crazy.","If she hadn’t taken out the satellite communication, the signal interference would have continued.","\"I left an apology letter with your vice-captain. After the training ends, I hope you can take a good look at it. I’m sorry about what happened in the truck. Please forgive me. If you can’t forgive me now, I hope you can forgive me on account of my apology letter.","\"Yang Xulin, my name is Qin Ying. I’m a woman who lives independently and carries camera equipment. There’s still a long way to go. We’ll meet again.\"","Before leaving, Qin Ying stood in front of V8, who had finished his sentry duty. She introduced herself seriously. At the same time, V8 was shocked again.","How did she know his name?","Who told her?","There was still a long way to go. They would meet again?","Why did he suddenly feel like a little white rabbit that was being targeted?"]},{"number":4547,"title":"Chapter 4547: Sooner Or Later","paragraphs":["\"You...\"","V8, who usually shouted from time to time that he wanted to find a girlfriend, was completely speechless. He stuttered until he couldn’t say a word. Qin Ying didn’t give him a chance to speak either. She carried her huge backpack that was about half the height of a person and waved her hand as she slid down from the top of the cave.","The moonlight was bright, and the stars were clear. V8, Yang Xulin, saw the young photographer who made him helpless sliding down with her big backpack on his back. Then, he suddenly turned around. He was so shocked that he subconsciously shrunk back. He didn’t want her to see him standing there stupidly and looking at her.","Qin Ying smiled. Why was this innocent man still hiding? ’Stop hiding. Your vice-captain sold you to me.’","\"Goodbye!\"","Qin Ying turned around and placed her hands beside her mouth in the shape of a trumpet. She shouted, \"Remember, there’s still a long way to go.\" ’Sooner or later, you’ll become my man!’","Of course, she couldn’t say this out loud.","V8 wiped his cold sweat. He couldn’t take it. The demons in the mountains probably looked like her!","Sigh!","A faint sigh suddenly came from behind. V8 was so shocked that he turned around abruptly. He let out an exclamation and shrank back.","\"Logically speaking, you should’ve sent her off. I didn’t expect her people to find us here directly. It’s not convenient for us to show our faces, so we can only let her leave alone. I’ll let you send her off next time.\"","T6, who had walked over at some point in time, shook his head regretfully. \"Look at her. She’s carrying a backpack that’s half the height of a person and is as heavy as her. I’m really worried that she’ll collapse one day. What about you? Are you worried?\"","\"Then you can worry about it.\" V8, who was frightened, glared at his comrades and walked in.","He was hungry and needed to eat something to fill his stomach.","As for the apology letter that Qin Ying mentioned, V8 didn’t ask G3 about it. G3 didn’t mention it either. He only took it out after the training ended and they returned to the military unit.","Qin Ying left. The 46 special forces soldiers had their raw dinner. They camped here and rested for the night. The next day, they gathered at four in the morning and headed to the depths of the desert.","Although the 30 special forces soldiers had successfully carried out two combat missions, they weren’t at the red level. From the moment they entered the desert, the 46 special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit split into teams. Ye Jian joined the red team and fought the 16 veterans who pretended to be criminals. They would attack from time to time.","The desert combat with 16 veterans was a huge test for the 30 special forces soldiers. On the first day, five special forces soldiers were ’killed’ by the veterans.","The next day, four more people were ’killed’. On the tenth day, six veterans were ’killed’. 16 people from the red team were ’killed’. That meant more than half were ’killed’.","During the day, the desert was very hot, and at night, it was very cold. The 46 special forces soldiers trained day by day in this extremely harsh environment. On the 20th day, everyone lost at least five kilograms. Their cheeks were sunken, but their eyes were getting sharper day by day.","On the 30th day, their skin started to peel again. Even Ye Jian was no exception. Sunburn was an extraordinary pain. At night, it was as if countless needles were pricking them.","No one complained. No one withdrew. They persisted until the training ended.","Ye Jian was the same as the male soldiers. She suffered the same way as the male soldiers. She was kidnapped halfway and even had her neck cut by a dagger. In the end, she was successfully rescued by her comrades from the red team."]},{"number":4548,"title":"Chapter 4548: The Refugees Return","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was kidnapped and successfully rescued. It could be said that this was the best retaliation for the 30 special forces soldiers against the veterans. Ye Jian finally understood why the veterans walked silently in the desert that was filled with coarse sand and gravel. When the red team stepped on it, no matter how light their footsteps were, there would be rustling sounds.","It was a very simple solution. Every time they launched a sneak attack, they would use sterile gauze to cushion their feet. Then, they would wrap their backpacks around their feet. Everywhere they passed, they would be silent like a cat.","The veterans wouldn’t tell the red team about these outdoor survival skills in advance. Even Ye Jian didn’t know about it. The red team needed to enter the desert to train and find out about it themselves.","This training was the largest and longest outdoor training for the red team. The shooting of live ammunition and blank cartridges made the red team’s special forces soldiers walk on the line of death almost every day.","The veterans who disguised themselves as fugitives really acted like fierce, cold, and fleeing criminals. They were criminals who attacked to escape, and others could never imagine how crazy they would be. The special forces soldiers of the red team were tense every day and did not dare to relax for a moment.","Everyone participated in this training that had a mortality rate. Along the way, all kinds of injuries appeared one after another. A month later, both sides were injured. The most serious ones had their calves cut by sharp gravel. It was so deep that their bones could be seen.","Even so, as long as they could stand up, they had to continue training.","Ye Jian had also suffered a heavy blow to her back. When she jumped down, she staggered and fell onto a rock. She hit her chest on the spot. Her organs seemed to have shifted. There was a taste of blood in her throat. She stood on the spot for at least five minutes before she dared to move her body slowly.","She was afraid of hurting her spine.","It wasn’t like the members of the Xueyu unit had never hurt their spine during training. It was extremely harsh and brutal training. It was a training that didn’t have any humanity. Getting injured was a common occurrence.","As the captain, Xia Jinyuan treated everyone equally during training. Ye Jian was his soldier. He would treat Ye Jian the way he treated the male soldiers. He also told the veterans to treat Ye Jian the same way.","The veterans didn’t give Ye Jian any special treatment. She was a soldier. As for her being the girlfriend of the captain... that was her personal life.","The 43 days of training ended. Everyone’s training clothes were worn down, and there was an indescribable smell. The desert lacked water. Bathing... was a luxury.","When the Army Aviation sent a helicopter to pick them up, the two captains were shocked. The training of the Army Aviation was harsh enough. However, this team of comrades looked even more like refugees than refugees. There definitely was a big gap between them.","\"We can’t say that our regiment is the toughest in the future.\"","Looking at the ’refugees’ walking over, the co-pilot expressed his shock to the captain in a low voice.","As the sun set in the west, the red sun’s rays fell on the horizon at the end of the desert. A group of ’refugees’ walked through the desolate mountains. They carried heavy rifles and lined up neatly to board the helicopter that would bring them away from the depths of the desert. Although their clothes were ragged, they were like sharp swords that had been polished to the point of breaking.","After returning from the desert, 46 people got off the aircraft. Six people were left behind to watch over the equipment. The other 40 people rushed into the bathroom and only came out after using half a bar of soap.","When he got off the plane, Xia Jinyuan pulled Ye Jian to the side and took off her helmet. He stared at her face carefully. Ye Jian was puzzled by his stare. \"What are you looking at?\""]},{"number":4549,"title":"Chapter 4549: A Husband Doesn’t Mind His Wife’s Ugliness","paragraphs":["\"Nothing. I just want to tell you that if you want to visit the Army Aviation tomorrow, you’d better wear sunglasses.\" Xia Jinyuan tried his best to hold back his laughter and helped Ye Jian put on her helmet again. Then, he put on the dark goggles and patted her shoulder. He smiled slightly. \"You’re in a single room, so take care of yourself.\"","Ye Jian understood something, and her face turned hot. \"Hurry up and leave!\" She glared at him and almost fled.","Although the two of them were boyfriend and girlfriend... Because they were boyfriend and girlfriend, even though she didn’t pay much attention to her attire, she was still very awkward at this moment!","She had to clean up this mess!","Xia Jinyuan’s low and deep laughter came from behind. He said, \"I still like you no matter how ugly you look. I like you very much. A husband doesn’t mind his wife being ugly, silly girl.\"","This doting... made Ye Jian run even faster.","The naughty young lieutenant colonel laughed even louder, attracting the attention of his other comrades. When they saw Ye Jian running away, their gazes instantly turned sharp.","\"Why are we looking over? It’s even more infuriating!\"","\"Go, go, go. Stay away from him!\"","\"The training is over. It’s time for us to feel frustrated.\"","\"Hahaha, no matter how frustrated I am, it’ll only be for 12 hours. Ye Jian will have to return to school tomorrow.\"","\"Oh, that’s right!\"","\"Don’t be envious. I’ll give you a surprise later.\" G3 hugged V8, who was grinding his teeth too. \"A huge surprise is waiting for you. Wash yourself clean and we’ll have a good chat.\"","V8 didn’t react in time. He clicked his tongue and said in disbelief, \"Usually, the big surprises in the team are all missions.\"","G3 stared at V8 as if he was a monster. He patted the back of V8’s head again. \"If you don’t grasp the opportunity this time, I’ll... cut you later!\"","His cold gaze swept past V8’s lower body.","V8 was speechless and walked faster.","Ye Jian, who was walking at the front, didn’t feel the sharp gazes. She was a female soldier who was arranged to visit the family building of the Army Aviation.","Although it was called a building, it was actually the top floor of the barracks. The Army Aviation was too remote. The family rooms were basically empty all year round.","Ye Jian was afraid that her backpack would dirty the other things, so she placed it on the ground. She grabbed the edge of the sealed bag that she kept specially and rushed into the bathroom at the fastest speed.","She should wash up first before taking out her clothes!","When the male soldiers walked out of the bathroom, Ye Jian was still struggling. She rubbed until her skin turned red. She rubbed until the soap was so small that she could hold it firmly with one hand. Finally, she turned off the showerhead.","After putting on her clothes and standing in front of the mirror, Ye Jian, who never dressed up, thought for the first time that she should buy a foundation to increase her fairness.","Even though Ye Jian’s skin did not tan easily, she was not spared this time.","There were three shades on her face. Her forehead was slightly tanned. The fairest shaded was from her nose bridge to the point above her eyebrows. It was in the shape of goggles. From her nose bridge to her chin, it was tanned. Ye Jian looked at herself in the mirror and couldn’t help but twitch her lips.","After she went back, she still had to go to another school for military training. How could she go now when her appearance was laugh-inducing?","\"Little Ye, you’re the flower of our military school. Even if you go to another school, you’ll be a bright and beautiful school belle. Let the university students from other schools see how beautiful our school belle is!\"","Thinking about her conversation with the director and looking at herself in the mirror, Ye Jian rubbed her forehead with a headache.","The school belle had become a beggar."]},{"number":4550,"title":"Chapter 4550: Can’t Look At Him","paragraphs":["Ye Jian stared at herself in the mirror. She couldn’t bear to look at herself. What should she do? How should she answer the director?","No wonder Xia Jinyuan told her to wear sunglasses before coming out. With her current appearance, sunglasses had become an indispensable concealer!","However, that was on the premise that she had sunglasses!","She needed square sunglasses that were like goggles... But she had nothing.","After looking at her reflection for a while, Ye Jian walked out of the bathroom helplessly. Without sunglasses, she could only walk out like this. Fortunately, they didn’t need to gather. Fortunately, she could rest after washing up. As for visiting the Army Aviation... Forget it, she wouldn’t think about it anymore.","She believed that there would be more opportunities to visit the Army Aviation in the future and see all kinds of military models at a close distance.","The sky outside was already dark. At 10:30 pm, the Army Aviation wasn’t training anymore. All the soldiers returned to their dormitories and started studying.","The camp was quiet, and the night was silent. The sky was like an arc that enveloped the entire land. Ye Jian stood in the sunlight and listened to the chirping of the insects in the summer. She used half a bag of detergent to wash all her clothes until they smelled fragrant.","Before she slept, she went to the bathroom to look at herself in the mirror. Her funny three-colored face made her close her eyes as she applied the aloe vera gel prepared by the Army Aviation. The sight hurt her eyes...","She didn’t even go down for dinner. She ate a few biscuits and drank a few cups of water. Her body touched the bed for less than a minute before her breathing became steady.","She couldn’t take it anymore after 43 days of high-intensity training.","The male soldiers didn’t send anyone to call Ye Jian. They were already so tired. They just needed to sleep well.","The male soldiers in the six-person room were almost all asleep, except for the captain and vice-captain.","The street lamps in the Army Aviation camp weren’t all lit up. In some areas, the lights were directly extinguished. Xia Jinyuan and G3 walked out of the dormitory and came to the unlit area. They talked about some things that happened during the 43 days of training. The two of them would summarize it first and then go back to submit a report to Major General Yang.","After chatting about the training, they chatted about V8.","V8 didn’t take G3’s words to heart at all. He didn’t even have dinner. At this moment, he was sleeping soundly. No huge surprise could compare to a good sleep.","He was so tired that he wasn’t in the mood to accept the huge surprise.","G3, who had been sleepy for a long time and couldn’t hold on anymore, yawned. He rubbed his sore temples and sighed. \"I’m counting on Miss Qin to take the initiative. If we count on V8, it’ll just be like what you said. He’ll probably stay single for the rest of his life.\"","\"We agreed to have a chat tonight after washing up, but he slept comfortably after I hung up the clothes.\"","He said that he wanted to find a girlfriend, but when he really had the chance, he acted as if nothing had happened and didn’t care at all. Instead, others were the ones worried about him.","Xia Jinyuan was also very sleepy. His eyelids had already started to flutter. Hearing that, he chuckled lightly. \"If we really ask him to look for her, do you think he’ll look for her? He might not be willing to take a step forward even if we point a gun at his head. He has lost his pursuit of life long ago due to excessive restrictions from his parents.","\"Otherwise, why would he rather stay in the military unit for training than return home?","\"Don’t be too anxious. I know a little about Qin Ying. She’s a woman that even Mrs. Qin can’t do anything to. Since she’s been looking for V8 for five years, she won’t let go until she takes him down.\"","\"You can tell Qin Ying about V8 in private. She doesn’t have to worry about his family background. V8’s family background is not bad. Although they’re not as good as the Qin family, they’re still famous locally.","If not, his parents wouldn’t have been so strict with V8 since he was young. It was for no other reason than to maintain his family background."]},{"number":4551,"title":"Chapter 4551: Image","paragraphs":["G3 frowned when he heard Xia Jinyuan mention her family background. \"What’s Qin Ying’s background? Is her mother a strong woman?\"","\"Ambassador Qin, do you remember him? They’re biological siblings. The Qin family is a family of diplomats. If Old Master Qin is meeting the great leader, the great leader has to take the initiative to shake hands with him.\" Just like Old Master Xia at home, they were all high-ranking figures who had a huge influence on that era.","G3 gasped silently.","Her background was extraordinary!","\"You think there’s a chance?\"","\"Everything depends on the person.\" Xia Jinyuan raised his wrist and looked at the time. In the blink of an eye, it was midnight. \"Let’s go back and rest. We’ll leave the Army Aviation before ten tomorrow.\"","In the afternoon, they would take a plane and leave. Ye Jian would fly back to Xiang City alone while the 45 of them would return to the base.","The Army Aviation camp became quieter. The sentinel standing guard looked straight ahead. Accompanying him were only the lights, mosquitoes, and the gradually weakening night insects.","Ye Jian went to bed at 11:30 pm. When she woke up, it was already 8:00 am. More than 40 days of cruel pursuit training made her biological clock not work on time.","The male soldiers were in a similar situation. They were slightly better than Ye Jian. If someone woke up in one room early, the other comrades would wake up too. Ye Jian, who was resting alone in a room, woke up naturally.","Ye Jian, who was washing up, looked at herself in the mirror again. She felt that she was much more pleasing to the eye than yesterday. It seemed that the aloe vera gel distributed by the Army Aviation was quite effective. Before she left, she wanted to see if she could get a few more bottles.","The camouflage uniform on the balcony had been exposed to the wind for a night. It had already dried under the morning sun. Ye Jian, who missed breakfast, simply wore her helmet and walked out of the room in her camouflage uniform. There were five minutes before departure.","It couldn’t be helped. Last night, she was too embarrassed to face Xia Jinyuan’s laughter. She could only choose to compromise.","When she walked out, Ye Jian felt at ease.","When Xia Jinyuan saw his girlfriend appear, the image of what she looked like the day before flashed past his mind. He couldn’t help but smile.","Ye Jian’s eyes, which were hidden behind her goggles, kept observing him. When she saw this, her heart fluctuated again. This was the first time... she wanted to maintain a good image in front of her boyfriend.","The Army Aviation had already made arrangements for the bus to send the 46 people to the airport. They knew that this military unit that entered the desert for training was special, so they arranged the time to receive and send them off. They didn’t alert many soldiers in the regiment.","The regimental commander wasn’t in the camp. He was leading the patrol team to complete a normal air patrol. He would only return after 15 days.","The military had already made arrangements in advance.","In less than five minutes, they were all on the bus. Xia Jinyuan was the first to get in, and Ye Jian was the second to get in. When she passed by the first row, she wanted to ignore the man who was already sitting in the first row. The other party saw through her thoughts in advance and reached out to grab her wrist. He pulled her to the seat and smiled. \"Sit properly. Don’t move.\"","It was too late to get up. The comrades behind came up one by one. Every time they came up and saw the two people sitting side by side, they would smile knowingly. The veterans even made a gun gesture with their hands and pointed at the captain.","Besides V8, everyone who passed by would look at the two of them.","G3 was the last to come up. He took off his helmet and sat on the left side of the aisle in the same row as Xia Jinyuan.","Ye Jian froze when she saw this.","Right on the heels of that, Xia Jinyuan took off his helmet too. He then turned to look at Ye Jian.","Ye Jian didn’t want to take it off!","\"Are you afraid that I’ll see you like that?\""]},{"number":4552,"title":"Chapter 4552: Stimulated","paragraphs":["While she was hesitating, she heard a certain fellow’s low laughter. She really wanted to slap him. Could he not tell?","She didn’t see the cold expression on the man’s face.","Xia Jinyuan could naturally tell, but she had to get used to it. She had to experience it once. If she minded it too much, it would make things difficult for her.","\"Then bring it with you. You can take it off when we reach the airport. However, let me say one more thing. As a soldier preparing for future wars, even if you’re disfigured, you should stand upright in the world. What do we rely on? We don’t rely on our faces.","\"You can choose not to take it off now. But you’ll have to face it when you reach the airport. Do you want to face it early and adjust your mentality, or do you want to receive more attention later and make yourself more awkward?\"","Although his voice was gentle, the words he said were sharp. Ye Jian pursed her lips tightly.","She slowly touched the helmet buckle. With a click, the buckle was unbuttoned. She took off the helmet and placed it on her knees. She raised her hand to smoothen her short hair. Xia Jinyuan never thought that Ye Jian would only take three seconds to complete her mission.","Xia Jinyuan smiled and rubbed her head. \"It’s my fault for laughing at you yesterday. It was the first time I saw my little fox like that. It was just a little rare. If I had a camera, I would have taken photos.\"","\"Yesterday, you were still laughing at me for being ugly. My psychological trauma has multiplied.\"","Ye Jian turned her head and looked out of the bus window. Although she had taken off her helmet, she still didn’t have the courage to face her boyfriend.","Seeing this, Xia Jinyuan reached out and grabbed Ye Jian’s face. Ye Jian was shocked but couldn’t escape.","\"I’m very sorry. I’m also telling you very seriously that no matter what you look like, you’ll always be my favorite. So, don’t feel awkward.\"","His voice came slowly. Ye Jian only wanted him to let go and nodded with all her might. \"I understand, I understand. Let go quickly!\"","\"Do you really understand?\"","\"Absolutely!\"","Their comrades reminded them from behind, \"Excuse me. The gap between the two seats is a little wide. I’m afraid I’ll jump out of the bus if I have to continue watching this.\"","Ye Jian was too embarrassed to speak.","\"You can close your eyes. It’s beneficial to relax your mood and relieve the fatigue in the eyes,\" Xia Jinyuan replied gentlemanly. He defeated his two comrades perfectly.","Normally, he could hold her for a long time and kiss her a few times. It was too strange for him to always hold her face in the vehicle.","He released his hand. G3 looked at him for a while before he finally found a chance to speak. He said, \"Captain...\"","Xia Jinyuan immediately turned sideways when he heard that. G3, who had leaned over too, smiled softly and said, \"I’ve handed over the letter. He was agitated when he found out that a beautiful woman has had a crush on him for five years.\"","Before the matter was settled, besides T6 and Ye Jian who knew some inside information, the two of them didn’t want all the team members to know in case V8 felt awkward. It wasn’t easy for this child to change.","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows. \"Was he happy? Frightened? Why do I feel like he was frightened?\"","\"A little. He wanted to return the photo to me when he got it. He said that he wasn’t worthy.\" G3 shook his head helplessly. \"I regret it now. I should’ve waited until we returned to the military unit before handing the letter and photo to him.\"","\"What’s the difference between giving it to him early or late? If you give it to him early, he can express his stance sooner and let her know.\"","After Xia Jinyuan finished speaking, G3’s eyebrows twitched. He asked, \"You mean to make Miss Qin give up? V8 will definitely reject her.\"","It couldn’t be. It wasn’t easy for him to have a chance. Were they going to let it go just like that? It wasn’t like their captain."]},{"number":4553,"title":"Chapter 4553: Can You Bear To?","paragraphs":["The scheming Lieutenant Colonel Xia wouldn’t let go of this chance. He wasn’t worried about the future development at all. It was mainly because he had confidence in Qin Ying.","He crossed his long legs and smiled evilly. \"No, it’s so that Miss Qin, who’s rejected, can think of a countermeasure early. If he accepts her, there’s basically no need for any countermeasures. If he rejects her, she’ll need to think of a countermeasure and plan her next step.","\"It’s better for him to answer early so that Qin Ying can make plans.\"","Why was he able to be the captain at such a young age?","One could tell the reason from this small matter.","Thinking about and dealing with problems were never one-faceted. It was all-rounded.","G3, who didn’t expect this, gave his captain a thumbs-up. \"Amazing! You’re really amazing! Then I’ll contact Miss Qin in private so that she can encircle him. If he wants to escape, he can only jump into Miss Qin’s hands.\"","\"Not bad. Do a good job at this. I’ll wait for your good news.\" Xia Jinyuan accepted his comrade’s praise and smiled back.","Although Ye Jian had turned her head to look at the scenery outside the window, she was filled with admiration. The man she liked was extraordinary. He could think of what other people thought of, and he could also think of what others didn’t.","It was a six-hour drive from the Army Aviation to the airport. They left at 10:00 am and arrived around 4\"00 am. Ye Jian would fly to Xiang City at 6:00 pm. The members of the Xueyu unit would take off half an hour later. The six-hour journey meant that Ye Jian and Xia Jinyuan would be spending their last six hours together during the summer vacation.","At this moment, Xia Jinyuan realized that although their relationship was public, his girlfriend... was even shyer than before!","She was afraid that her comrades would see them holding hands.","The unexpected change stunned Lieutenant Colonel Xia for a long time. In the end, he had no choice but to show his domineering move. He held Ye Jian’s hand tightly and snorted. \"Whether we hold hands or not, they’ll think that we’re holding hands. In that case, why don’t we hold hands?\"","\"Six hours... We won’t meet again until the winter vacation. Maybe the school has plans for you. Little fox, can you bear it?\"","Could she bear it? Actually, she could bear it.","However, after being coaxed and begged by his gentle voice, Ye Jian’s heart softened instantly. She stopped struggling and allowed him to hold her tightly. Her ears were already red.","Xia Jinyuan was elated. \"It’s still the same as before. Your ears always turn so red...\" After holding hands, there would definitely be other actions. Lieutenant Colonel Xia turned his body and gently pinched Ye Jian’s earlobe that was getting redder under the sunlight from outside the bus window. \"It’s soft, hot, and feels good.\"","\"I heard from the older generation that having fleshy earlobes is a blessing. OUr baby will be a lucky person in the future.\"","A lucky person?","Ye Jian couldn’t dodge in time when he grabbed her earlobe. She couldn’t help but lower her eyes slightly. In her past life, she was an unlucky person with shallow family ties. In this life, he was right. She thought that she was blessed in this life too.","\"Thank you for your kind words, Captain Xia. Whether I’m lucky or not will depend on you.\" Ye Jian smiled as she looked over. She regretted taking off her helmet. This way, the comrades behind would definitely see her.","The two members sitting at the back didn’t see it. After listening to Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s suggestion, they closed their eyes to rest and reject the stimulation.","The two of them weren’t constantly interacting during the six-hour drive. In the first two hours, they played some tricks. For the next few hours, they just held hands. Ye Jian laid on his shoulder and fell asleep.","The team members rested their heads on their hands and fell asleep. The fatigue brought about by more than 40 days of training couldn’t be overcome overnight."]},{"number":4554,"title":"Chapter 4554: Conscious","paragraphs":["Six hours passed in the blink of an eye. They arrived at the airport to collect their plane tickets and check in. Time passed quickly.","The group of people was too big a target. They didn’t walk through the lobby during the check-in process. They avoided the crowd and entered the departure hall. In the end, they boarded the plane in advance.","Xia Jinyuan watched as Ye Jian walked past the boarding gate and boarded the plane. After standing for a few minutes, he heard that the plane he should be getting on was preparing for boarding too. After standing for a few more minutes, he strode away and returned to his boarding gate.","When he came back alone, his more than 40 comrades welcomed him with smiles. There was no teasing, only comfort.","Xia Jinyuan smiled and took his backpack to board the plane.","All their guns were sent back to the team by the transport plane. There were no dangerous items in their backpacks. Even their combat daggers were sent back by the transport plane. Hence, there was no need to use a special passageway to board the plane.","All 45 of them sat at the back. There were passengers in front. The flight time was five hours and 17 minutes. Ye Jian needed to transit, so her journey would take even longer. She would only arrive at Xiang City around 3:00 am.","The two planes flew in different directions until they landed at their respective locations.","After Xia Jinyuan got off the phone, he sent a message to Ye Jian’s cell phone. Ye Jian only replied to him at 3:30 am.","When she returned to the military school, it was already 5:00 am. She heard the sound of the freshmen waking up for military training.","Ye Jian walked into the campus and heard the thuds their feet made. Although the sounds were loud, they contained no power.","It was obvious that they were new students who had just started military training.","Ye Jian avoided them and returned to the dormitory through the tree-lined path. There was no one in the dormitory. Even the entire floor of the building was empty. Ye Jian was the only one there.","After tidying herself up, Ye Jian sat in the chair and thought for a moment. She took out her cell phone and sent a message to Xu Wen.","Within three minutes after the message was sent, a reply came immediately.","[I specially checked the news just now. Pigs haven’t started to fly! Ye Jian, what’s going on? You actually asked me if I had foundation in the dorm!!!]","The last four exclamation points were not enough to express Xu Wen’s shock at the moment she saw the message!","She was so shocked that she almost dropped her cell phone!","Xu Wen was on leave at home. She had only returned to the capital city for three days. Just as she was about to wake up, she received Ye Jian’s message. She replied immediately.","Ye Jian replied: [I’m seriously tanned. My face is tricolored. I’m afraid that I’ll give the director a heart attack, so I want to prepare in advance.]","[Not bad, you’ve been enlightened! This is my favorite foundation. Please treat it well. If you don’t understand how to use it, you’re welcome to call me.] After confirming that Ye Jian really needed it, Xu Wen was so happy that she pounced on the bed and laughed.","The loud laughter shocked the elders in her family. They knocked on the door and asked about it.","Xu Wen replied that she was fine before her family members left.","Ye Jian opened Xu Wen’s steel cabinet and saw a set of expensive skincare products and a set of cosmetics from the same brand.","She once asked Xu Wen why she didn’t take them with her during the holidays. Xu Wen replied, \"I don’t want to check them in at the airport.\"","Fortunately, she didn’t want to do that as that ended up saving Ye Jian. After reading the instructions carefully, Ye Jian took a bottle of primer, a bottle of foundation, and a compact powder. She followed the steps and started to salvage her face’s condition.","Fortunately, Ye Jian’s skin was not bad. Her skin was smooth and poreless. This was her first time putting on makeup, so she did it seriously. She focused on applying the products to her nose bridge and chin. After 15 minutes, the color of her face in the mirror finally became even!","\"A tree needs its bark and a human needs its face. No wonder girls need a set of cosmetics that can transform us.\" Ye Jian looked at the three simplest products and considered going shopping in the afternoon."]},{"number":4555,"title":"Chapter 4555: Bright and Beautiful","paragraphs":["When she appeared in the director’s office, Ye Jian, who was wearing the summer military uniform, looked energetic. Her gaze was clear. When she walked in from the door, the unique aura of a soldier made the director take a few more glances at her.","The director smiled and said, \"Not bad, Little Ye. You’ve changed a lot after coming back to school. Come, sit.\"","The director had always treated Ye Jian well and didn’t put on any airs. He even stood up and asked Ye Jian if she wanted a cup of tea. How could Ye Jian let the director make tea for her? She hurriedly smiled and said that she would do it.","\"Xia Jinyuan said that he would bring you out for training. Why can’t I tell that you underwent training? You’re not tanned.\"","She was too beautiful. The director was suspicious. It was agreed that her training would increase, but she came back bright and beautiful.","\"43 days of training, not a single day less. Maybe it’s more cloudy than sunny over there, so there aren’t many changes in my skin color.\" Before she came, Ye Jian had already thought of an explanation. She felt guilty, so she quickly explained and changed the topic. \"Director, I’m going to another school tomorrow, right?\"","\"Oh, no, no. The 15 days of military training was changed to ten days of military training. The weather is too hot, so they’re afraid that something will happen to the new students.","\"You still have five days of vacation. Do you want to go home and see your family? You can rush back to school on the fifth day.\"","The dean’s words lit up Ye Jian’s eyes. She was supposed to have these five days of leave to begin with, but it felt like she had an additional five days of leave.","She would definitely go home!","She wanted to go back to the capital city to see Uncle Chen. She hadn’t seen Uncle Chen for a long time. She also wanted to see Commander Xia and see if there was any progress on Uncle Chen’s matter.","After walking out of the director’s office, Ye Jian called home first. No one picked up at home... When she boarded the plane, she called the landline again but to no avail. Old Master Fu and Uncle Fu didn’t pick up their phones either.","Needless to say, Old Master Fu must have gone to the aviation weapons laboratory again, and Uncle Fu went to take care of the old man.","Without contacting Old Master Fu, Ye Jian sent a message to Mr. Fu. Before she could receive a reply, she was reminded to turn her phone off as she was in an aircraft. Ye Jian waited for another ten seconds before turning off her cell phone.","When she got off the plane and turned on her phone, several notifications came one after another. Ye Jian was overjoyed when she saw the word ’Dad’.","As she walked, she finished reading the four messages. Then, she picked up her travel bag and ran toward the arrival gate.","Mr. Fu, who hadn’t seen his daughter for hundreds of days and nights, received a message from his daughter, Ye Jian. After coming out of the military, he ran all the way to the airport. He arrived two hours early and stood at the arrival gate. He waited until a figure rushed over. Mr. Fu was so happy and excited that his eyes turned red.","This was the daughter he had not seen for a long time, the daughter he would owe for the rest of his life.","\"Dad!\"","Ye Jian, who was running over, saw Mr. Fu. She restrained herself until she was close to him before shouting. She threw herself into Mr. Fu’s arms.","\"Dad, when did you come back to the capital city? Did you just come back? I sent you many messages. Did you receive them? Are you tired? Did you wait for me for a long time? Why didn’t you find a place to sit and wait?\"","Mr. Fu didn’t even have the chance to speak when he heard Ye Jian chattering like a chick. The corners of Mr. Fu’s eyes turned even wetter.","Mr. Fu patted Ye Jian’s back lightly and smiled. \"I have to answer your questions one by one. You said so much in one go. Aren’t you afraid of choking?\"","He patiently answered all Ye Jian’s questions and sized up Ye Jian at the same time."]},{"number":4556,"title":"Chapter 4556: Mr. Fu Doesn’t Want To Marry Off His Daughter","paragraphs":["Mr. Fu was a scholar. Even though he had been serving in a missile base in the northwest, he was still a scholar in his military uniform. He was a refined and strict scholar. Due to work reasons, he was also a strict person. He rarely revealed his emotions.","However, in front of his daughter, whom he had not seen for hundreds of days and nights, Mr. Fu was very excited.","His daughter was his spiritual support for the rest of his life. She was also the pillar of support for Old Master Fu’s health. If she was fine, everything in the family was fine. He only hoped that his only descendant would always be fine.","As he answered Ye Jian’s question, Mr. Fu sized up his daughter carefully. Before he could answer all the questions, he asked with heartache, \"Why did you lose so much weight? Is it because you’re under too much pressure? Or did you encounter some difficulties? You’re so skinny that you don’t have much flesh on your face. You haven’t been taking good care of yourself.\"","As he spoke, he rubbed his fingers against Ye Jian’s face that was covered with makeup. As expected, Mr. Fu’s thumb was stained with foundation, revealing the tanned skin that Ye Jian wanted to hide.","Mr. Fu looked at his thumb and then at the spot on Ye Jian’s face that was tanned. With the contrast of the foundation, the exposed spot appeared darker.","\"You...\" Mr. Fu, who understood the situation, sighed heavily. His kind eyes were filled with deep heartache. \"No wonder you’ve lost so much weight. You’re even darker than the sentinels standing guard in the northwest. When we go back, I have to nourish you.\"","Ye Jian couldn’t help but laugh when she heard that she was darker than the sentinels standing guard in the Northwest. \"Dad, stop rubbing my face. In order to conceal the tan lines on my face, I learned how to apply foundation. If you keep doing it, I’ll hide in my room for the next few days.\"","\"Don’t apply too much on your face. A lot of these things are made using harmful substances. I’ll contact an alternative doctor later and see if he has any prescriptions. If your face is sunburned, I’m afraid the back of your neck will be sunburned too.\"","Mr. Fu’s heart ached, but there was nothing he could do. This was the path she had chosen. She was destined to have a harder time than other delicate daughters.","He couldn’t even say something like ’she was suffering’. How could a soldier not be tired? If she didn’t work hard, she wouldn’t be able to achieve anything. What was the use of the military unit keeping her around, then?","Mr. Fu’s heart ached as he took Ye Jian’s luggage. He smiled as he listened to Ye Jian speak. His heart ached for his daughter, but he felt a little better when he saw that she was willing and happy.","His daughter was the best daughter in the world. As a father, he wasn’t the best father. There was no need to talk about the hardships she suffered in the military unit. Even when Uncle Chen passed away unexpectedly... Mr. Fu couldn’t stay by Ye Jian’s side. He let her suffer alone.","As a father, he was too unqualified.","Ye Jian didn’t feel that she had suffered much. The hardships she suffered now were so that she could kill a few more targets in the future. Every time, she would come back alive. Thinking about this, she was willing to suffer no matter what.","Her goal was to chase after Captain Xia and not let go. Her wish was to come back alive every time because her family, who loved her deeply, would wait for her to return safely.","On the way, Ye Jian smiled and talked about many interesting things in the military school. She would talk about the interesting things that happened during training too. She even mentioned that her cousin, Li Jinnian, went to school and had a fight with Xia Jinyuan. The surrounding military school students clapped and cheered.","When Mr. Fu heard this, he, who had personally driven to fetch his daughter, smiled and said, \"Did your cousin beat that brat up for me? He deserves a beating for kidnapping my little princess. Only your cousin can stand up for me in the family.\""]},{"number":4557,"title":"Chapter 4557: Poor Comrade Xia","paragraphs":["As an elder, Mr. Fu actually wanted to do it himself. However, his identity restricted him. Other than glaring at Xia Jinyuan and warning him, he couldn’t do anything else.","His nephew, Jinnian, was the most suitable person to interfere.","Ye Jian knew what Mr. Fu wanted to hear and nodded repeatedly. \"He beat him up. After Cousin beat him up, it was my turn to beat him up. Don’t worry, we won’t be at a disadvantage if we work together.\"","\"You could bear to do it? You must be lying to me.\" Mr. Fu didn’t believe her. It couldn’t be helped. His daughter took the initiative to admit that she liked that brat from the Xia family and even protected him. How could she beat him up?","Ye Jian moved her body and turned to Mr. Fu, who was driving. She said seriously, \"I really hit him. Also, he couldn’t retaliate when I hit him. Dad, your daughter is very powerful. I won’t let myself suffer in anyone’s hands.\"","\"Hahaha, not bad, not bad. Men need to be taught a lesson sometimes. You have to train him well. Although I admit that this brat from the Xia family is steady and reliable and a man I can entrust you to, your grandpa and I are not willing to let him marry the little princess of the Fu family so easily.","\"My daughter, let me make a deal with you. Don’t mention that brat when we chat. Every time he’s mentioned, I feel suffocated.\"","He couldn’t bear to see his daughter being taken away by a wolf. Even though he knew that his daughter would get married one day and become a mother, as a father, he still couldn’t bear to part with her.","Ye Jian was secretly happy to see Mr. Fu’s jealousy. She said seriously, \"Okay, I’ll listen to you.\"","After receiving his daughter’s promise, Mr. Fu smiled happily. He even hummed the national anthem as he drove. Ye Jian was so happy that her stomach cramped.","Later, she sent a message to Xia Jinyuan. [Captain Xia, my father thinks that you kidnapped his little princess. He told me seriously just now that you’re a topic he doesn’t want to talk about. Your road ahead is long and full of hurdles. You have to work hard!]","Xia Jinyuan, who had his cell phone turned off, didn’t see it in time. When he saw the message, it was already past 10:00 pm. Ye Jian sent the message at 6:50 pm.","Xia Jinyuan smiled when he received the message. He naturally dialed her number.","It rang for about five seconds. Just as he thought that Ye Jian had something on and was about to hang up, the call went through. Before Ye Jian could speak, Xia Jinyuan said intimately, \"Baby, you have to put in a good word for me in front of Father-in-law.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Xia Jinyuan heard a cold snort.","\"I’m your baby’s father but I’ve never been promoted to father-in-law. Who are you?!\"","Just like that, Lieutenant Colonel Xia threw his phone out of his hand. Seeing that his cell phone was about to hit the ground, Xia Jinyuan, who was quick-witted, hurriedly went to rescue it. However, he tripped on the office chair. In the end... his cell phone was saved, but he fell down along with the chair.","\"Captain...\"","T6 pushed the door open and entered. He saw the captain of the famous special forces unit in an extremely sorry state after falling down. The chair was on his back.","\"Sigh...\"","That sight made T6 scream in pain for Xia Jinyuan.","Mr. Fu, who picked up his daughter’s call, heard the clanging sounds from the other side. The cold smile in his eyes deepened. He was panicking now? It was too late!","Baby!","Baby!","Who was his baby?!","Who was his father-in-law?!","Ye Jian was the treasure of the Fu family!","Father-in-law? Mr. Fu wouldn’t acknowledge it!"]},{"number":4558,"title":"Chapter 4558: Help My Wife","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who had fallen to the ground and was hissing, was terrified. No matter how he thought about it, he wouldn’t have been able to guess that the person who answered the call would be... his future father-in-law.","His angry future father-in-law was very scary. Even from afar, Xia Jinyuan could feel that his future father-in-law was furious. As for him, his back was drenched in cold sweat.","’Wifey, come and save your man!’","The unlucky lieutenant colonel, who was holding the back of his waist, regretted it. Just as he turned around and lifted his office chair, he saw a figure passing by the open office door from the corners of his eyes. Xia Jinyuan’s expression froze.","When he fell, he seemed to have heard someone pushing the door open without even knocking. That person was just in time to see him fall from shock.","Who was it?","Xia Jinyuan’s brain was slow from his future father-in-law’s scare. His thoughts were a little messy for a while. He couldn’t remember who the person was from his voice. If he could eliminate the 30 new comrades, then that would only leave the veterans.","As for the veterans...","After thinking about it, Xia Jinyuan patted his forehead. At this moment, shouldn’t he be thinking about how to coax his future father-in-law? It was not a problem for his comrades to see him fall!","On the other end of the line, Mr. Fu didn’t want to wait for Xia Jinyuan to explain anything. After he finished speaking, he snorted and hung up.","Baby? Heh!","Father-in-law? Ha!","Put in a good word for him? Ha!","After hanging up, Mr. Fu stared at the cell phone for a long time. The cold smile on his face didn’t disappear for a long time. This brat from the Xia family, heh! To think that Mr. Fu used to call him a calm and reliable person. Now, it seemed like... he was glib-tongued and unreasonable!","With just a few words, the image of the unlucky Lieutenant Colonel Xia in his future father-in-law’s heart came crashing down. He had dug his own grave!","He wanted to take advantage of Mr. Fu’s little princess over the phone. Were the two of them going to meet? Would that brat push his luck? Would he become more glib-tongued?","Mr. Fu knew that Ye Jian was smart. How could she have been coaxed by a brat at such a young age? It turned out that the reason was because the brat from the Xia family was too glib-tongued and had coaxed his innocent daughter long ago.","No! No! He still had to consider it carefully!","Mr. Fu had wanted to keep Ye Jian by his side for just one more year. Before this, because Xia Jinyuan was too outstanding and he couldn’t find any mistakes, Mr. Fu couldn’t make any demands. Now that Mr. Fu had a chance, one could only say that Xia Jinyuan had fallen into his future father-in-law’s hands. He could only pinch his nose and admit it obediently.","Hence, Ye Jian, who had finished getting her sunburn treated in the room, came out smelling of Chinese medicine. She realized that Mr. Fu was sitting on the couch with a serious expression while watching the military channel. Ye Jian, who didn’t know anything, didn’t go over to ask him about it immediately. She said to Mr. Fu, who hadn’t noticed her coming out, \"Dad, I’m done. I’ll see Doctor Wei off first.\"","Mr. Fu, who had already changed into casual clothes, stood up and walked to Doctor Wei. He asked seriously, \"Doctor, what do you think?\"","Doctor Wei was the doctor in charge of this high-end district. When she heard his question, she replied even more seriously, \"Her condition is alright, but she needs to apply the medicine for seven consecutive days. However, Miss Ye said that her time is limited. I’ll treat her for the remaining few days. After that, Miss Ye can find a friend to apply the medicine on her.\"","\"Okay, thank you for your hard work.\"","Mr. Fu felt a little relieved. A large portion of Ye Jian’s skin was red, and some had peeled off. His heart ached when he saw her like this. He could only think of ways to resolve his daughter’s pain."]},{"number":4559,"title":"Chapter 4559: How Can I Save Her?","paragraphs":["On the way back from the airport, Ye Jian unintentionally turned her head and let Mr. Fu see the sunburn on the back of her neck. Mr. Fu’s heart ached so much that he sucked in a breath of cold air. He wasn’t even in the mood to drive. He happened to pass by a stop on the highway and immediately parked the car at the side. He called the doctor who had been treating Old Master Fu. The doctor introduced another doctor to him, but that doctor wasn’t in the capital city, so he sent her disciple, Doctor Wei, over.","Ye Jian sent Doctor Wei off. Mr. Fu watched the military channel with a serious expression. Ye Jian, who had noticed something amiss from the start, walked over and sat beside Mr. Fu. She smiled and said, \"Dad, I already said that it’s a small problem. The doctor said the same thing as well. Why do you still look so serious?","\"I just remembered that I need to see two guests tomorrow, so I can’t accompany you. I’m thinking about how to break the news to you.\" Mr. Fu sighed and raised his hand to touch the back of Ye Jian’s head. He looked at the three different shades on Ye Jian’s face with a kind gaze. His heart ached as he said, \"You have to sacrifice so much in the military. Have you considered serving for a few years and leaving the military?\"","He really wanted to support his daughter’s work, but when he saw the tanned skin on her face and the red and peeling skin on the back of her neck, Mr. Fu wanted to persuade Ye Jian to consider retiring.","Ye Jian smiled and laid her head on Mr. Fu’s shoulder. \"Dad, I won’t consider it. I like the military uniform I’m wearing and life in the military unit. Unless the military unit doesn’t need me anymore, I won’t choose to leave the military.","\"Dad, I’m really fine. It was just normal training. I can still handle it. I don’t think it’s tiring. Also, if I hadn’t joined the military, I wouldn’t have been able to find my way home. I wouldn’t have been able to find you, Grandpa, and my family.","\"Don’t worry. I’ll take good care of myself. I won’t tire myself out or suffer. Don’t worry about me.\"","\"Silly child, there are no parents in the world who don’t worry. You’re... very independent. You’re so independent that I don’t know how to care about you sometimes.","\"We haven’t seen each other for more than 20 years, and my daughter has grown up. You’ve grown up to the point where I feel gratified but also heartache. Other people’s daughters are pampered, but my daughter has had to take care of herself.","\"Thank you for your hard work, my good daughter.\"","Mr. Fu sighed and gently touched the back of Ye Jian’s head. \"The friends I’m meeting tomorrow are two of my students. How about this? Don’t you want to shop? In that case, I’ll change the meeting place to Xidan. Xidan is said to be a place that girls love the most. Go out with me tomorrow morning. I’ll come and look for you after I meet the students. How about that?\"","Of course, Ye Jian agreed. She even agreed happily.","She didn’t expect Mr. Fu to have other intentions.","As for the call, Mr. Fu didn’t tell Ye Jian about it. Meanwhile, Xia Jinyuan was still worried.","T6 didn’t dare to come in again, but he didn’t spread the news. The captain fell out of his chair so hard that it made a loud sound. If word got out, it would damage the captain’s dignity. He would bear with it for now. If he could say it, he would definitely say it!","After all, it was better to be happy alone.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t care who saw him fall. He held his cell phone and stared at it. He looked up and leaned against the back of his chair. He looked at the ceiling and sighed.","Tonight, he caused a huge disaster. His future father-in-law hung up the phone directly. He didn’t want to hear his explanation at all.","But what could he explain?","At that time, he was dumbfounded. Actually, he didn’t know how to explain it. At that moment, he even thought of a lame idea—pretend that it wasn’t him and he made a wrong call.","He really wanted to act out this scene, but his future father-in-law snorted and hung up. It was obvious that Mr. Fu knew who he was."]},{"number":4560,"title":"Chapter 4560: Extreme Joy Gives Rise To Sorrow","paragraphs":["This was the first time Xia Jinyuan was so worried.","The trauma of his future father-in-law picking up his call was huge. He wanted to call Ye Jian again and hear if she had any good ideas to salvage the situation... But he didn’t dare to call again for a long time.","He was really afraid that his future father-in-law would pick up the call. What should he say then?","Extreme joy gave rise to sorrow.","Ever since their relationship was made public, he had been happy in the team. Even when he scolded people... In the words of his team members, it was like a spring breeze!","Heh, heh, like a spring breeze. Right now, Xia Jinyuan was currently being ravaged by a storm.","\"I still have to make a call. The probability of my future father-in-law answering the phone is 50%. The probability of my baby answering the phone is 50% too. Calm down!\"","Taking a deep breath, Xia Jinyuan held his cell phone tightly with both hands and mustered his courage and determination. He prepared to dial the number he had just dialed.","He and Ye Jian didn’t save each other’s cell phone numbers. They had already memorized each other’s cell phone numbers. It didn’t matter if they saved them or not.","He opened the call log and pressed the button. Just as he was about to press the dial button, the number he was about to dial suddenly jumped to the big screen. Xia Jinyuan’s pupils constricted, and his hands trembled.","It was here, it was here!","Who was it?","His future father-in-law?","Ye Jian?","He couldn’t panic. He had to take a deep breath. His future father-in-law wouldn’t take the initiative to call him back after hanging up. This should be his little fox.","Xia Jinyuan took another deep breath and sat up straight. He gently pressed the answer button and said seriously, \"Hello.\"","On the other end of the line, Ye Jian was confused. Did she dial the wrong number? That was impossible. She knew Captain Xia’s phone number by heart. How was that possible?","She looked at the number she dialed. It was correct.","Captain Xia probably didn’t look at whose number it was before answering the call.","\"Captain Xia, it’s me.\"","The clear voice was like the sound of nature. Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who was panicking, felt that hundreds of flowers were blooming around him.","\"Wait, wait. Baby, let me catch my breath. I have to calm down first.\"","He pulled his long legs under the desk and leaned against the office chair. Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had one hand on his chest, kept breathing to calm himself down.","Ye Jian, who was lying on the bed and applying aloe on her face, could tell that something was wrong. After thinking for a while, she vaguely guessed something and couldn’t help but laugh. \"What did my father say to you to scare the devil himself so much?","\"Aren’t you quite bold? You’re shameless too. You wouldn’t be so frightened by my father, right?\"","Ye Jian wanted to see if Xia Jinyuan had replied to her message, so she took her cell phone and looked at it. Seeing that there was no record in the mailbox, she wanted to try to contact him. She pressed a few numbers, and a set of numbers appeared on the call log. She knew that Xia Jinyuan had contacted her half an hour ago. The time of the call was 36 seconds.","At that time, she was getting medicine applied to her shoulder in her room. Her cell phone was placed in the living room. Ye Jian knew that Mr. Fu had answered the call.","Ye Jian could guess what Xia Jinyuan’s reaction was.","Xia Jinyuan, who had recovered, sighed and said, \"I caused a huge disaster. Father-in-law picked up my call, and I said...\" Xia Jinyuan, who had a worried expression on his face, recounted the huge disaster to his girlfriend. He then heard his girlfriend laugh even harder."]},{"number":4561,"title":"Chapter 4561: Baby","paragraphs":["Ye Jian really wanted to laugh out loud, but she felt that it wasn’t very kind. Hence, she tried her best to hold it in until the transparent aloe ointment on her face slid down.","\"Captain Xia... Yes, yes, yes... Captain Xia... Yes, cough...\"","\"Don’t laugh. Be serious. Hurry up and give me an idea. I have to salvage my image.\" Xia Jinyuan could tell that Ye Jian was holding back her laughter. He rubbed his temples helplessly. \"I was so anxious just now that I didn’t even have the courage to call again. Why are you still laughing?\"","This was the first time he had encountered such a misfortune... His future father-in-law asked him who he was!","He even fell to the ground and was seen by T6. Oh right, the veteran who sneaked away when he saw that the situation was bad was T6. This brat dared to spread the news to the team! Xia Jinyuan would beat him up later!","At the same time, he would ask his girlfriend to say a few words to his girlfriend. Xia Jinyuan would see if he dared to talk nonsense in the future.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia always had a way with other people. Even when he was wooing Ye Jian in the past, he coaxed her and reminded Ye Jian from time to time not to fall in love too early as that would guarantee an early breakup. Puppy love wasn’t appropriate and would only delay her... Before Ye Jian was in junior high, those were the things Lieutenant Colonel Xia kept saying to her.","Things changed drastically in senior high. He started saying that it wasn’t a big deal if she fell in love early. However, she had to keep her eyes open. She couldn’t look for someone randomly. If she found someone bad, she would suffer.","Just like him, he was not bad. He was not worse than the hotheads in her school. He did not lack education, looks, or ability. If she really wanted to find someone, she might as well consider him first.","Actually, Mr. Fu was right. This was how Lieutenant Colonel Xia coaxed Ye Jian. He cast an inescapable net and succeeded in bringing the beauty back. Many boys who had a crush on Ye Jian were heartbroken. There was no hope at all.","Now, the very same soldier was defeated by his future father-in-law. The wise Lieutenant Colonel Xia was helpless and anxious.","Why was Xia Jinyuan in such a fluster?","Actually, it was simple.","After talking to Mr. Fu many times and understanding him through his third brother, Xia Yuyi, he knew that although his future father-in-law served in a ballistics base in the northwest and was a true soldier, Mr. Fu was actually a scholar.","All scholars were stubborn, especially Mr. Fu. It was difficult to change his attitude when he had set his mind on something.","Ye Jian was Mr. Fu’s only precious daughter. He was already unhappy that she was snatched away earlier on. Now, the two families had just met, and they hadn’t even gone through the procedures. It was only normal that Mr. Fu was furious.","From Mr. Fu’s perspective, Xia Jinyuan could understand.","\"Calling me ’baby’ and calling him ’Father-in-law’... Captain Xia, didn’t you see the message I sent previously? You walked into the muzzle of the gun. How am I supposed to save you?\"","Ye Jian wasn’t as nervous and worried as Xia Jinyuan. It couldn’t be helped. Mr. Fu was her biological father. Why would she be nervous about him?","Just like Captain Xia. He was not afraid of Old Master Xia or Commander Xia even if they wanted to whip him with their belts.","She was Mr. Fu’s biological daughter. She wasn’t afraid!","Xia Jinyuan sighed. \"I did see it. That’s why I said that. Father-in-law even asked me who I was. I could feel Father-in-law’s anger even in the base.","\"My father-in-law has expressed more than once that he wanted to keep you for a few more years. Then... I, the ’wolf’ who took my father-in-law’s treasure, pretended not to understand. I pretended to be stupid the entire time, leaving my father-in-law helpless.","\"Now... Baby, you have to think of a way out for me.\""]},{"number":4562,"title":"Chapter 4562: Warm Light","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan sighed repeatedly. His black eyebrows were furrowed together. There was nothing he could do.","He really walked into the muzzle of the gun.","It was good to pretend to be stupid. The main point was that the elders in the family liked the little fox very much. They would say that they wanted him to marry the little fox as soon as possible. Every time they chatted, they would ask if he was going to marry her. Father-in-law... was disheartened!","Even Old Master Xia had said several times that Xia Jinyuan shouldn’t mention marrying Ye Jian to Engineer Fu. If he did, it wouldn’t be effective. Instead, it would backfire.","Now, with just one sentence, he was back to square one.","Ye Jian could tell that he was really flustered. Lying on the bed, she felt so sweet that even the air in the room smelled sweet. \"Don’t panic. Don’t be anxious. With me around, your position is very stable. Don’t forget, I said that I’ll cover my man.","\"Captain Xia, I have your back.\"","Because he loved her deeply, he cared. Because he cared, he panicked. This was the case.","Xia Jinyuan thought for a moment. Unexpectedly, Ye Jian heard his low and deep laughter. \"I panicked for a moment there. Father-in-law is indeed not a problem. As long as my little fox doesn’t give up on me, no matter how angry Father-in-law is, he’ll eventually calm down for the sake of his daughter.","\"However, I still have to talk to Father-in-law. How about this? I’ll contact Father-in-law tomorrow night at nine o’clock. I don’t want Father-in-law to hold in his anger. It’s understandable for him to be angry since I snatched his baby away.","\"In the future, when our daughter is kidnapped by a brat one day, I’d probably be like Father-in-law. I’d be so nervous that I’d want to lock our daughter at home...\"","Ye Jian tsked softly. They weren’t even married but he already wanted to give birth to a daughter!","\"I can’t just rely on you to put in a good word for me. Father-in-law might even mistake me for an irresponsible brat. No, no. Little fox, I have to think about how to apologize. I can’t let Father-in-law think that I’m an impolite and irresponsible brat.\"","Xia Jinyuan, who was chatting calmly, started to think about how to salvage his image. He had to make his father-in-law and the old master satisfied with him and feel that he was someone they could entrust Ye Jian to.","From this, one could see Xia Jinyuan’s respect for Mr. Fu and Old Master Fu. Because he loved Ye Jian deeply, he was willing to do everything for her so that the elders could hand Ye Jian to him.","This wasn’t making a mountain out of a molehill. He was showing the right attitude.","His respect made Ye Jian feel the warmth of being loved and pampered. For the sake of this warmth and to not let down his love, she would never give up no matter how hard or tired she was.","He was the brightest and warmest light in her life. He once walked to her side when she was at her darkest and held her hand to tell her how to continue...","If she left the warmth and the light, her world would be dark again. The cold darkness would make her lose her way.","Hence, for his sake, she would never leave the military unit. As long as he was still in the military unit, she vowed to be with him.","\"Don’t worry, Captain Xia. My dad is very satisfied with you. It’s just that he doesn’t say it out loud. He’s angry that you snatched me away early and made him worry that I would marry you early.","\"Why don’t you tell my father that we’ll delay our marriage? I think my father will forgive you quickly and confirm your identity as the Fu family’s son-in-law.\"","Ye Jian smiled and comforted her man. This was the first time she encountered a helpless Captain Xia. It was quite rare."]},{"number":4563,"title":"Chapter 4563: Knowing","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to say that. Delay their marriage?","No, no, no. He wished to marry Ye Jian the day after she graduated.","However, it was true that his future father-in-law was satisfied with him. As long as he was satisfied, everything that would come after would be easy.","The calm Xia Jinyuan looked at the time. It would be midnight soon. He said gently, \"It’s getting late. Rest early... Huh? No, babe, why are you with Father-in-law? Did Father-in-law come to Xiang City?\"","Lieutenant Colonel Xia, who had been panicking for more than half an hour, finally returned to normal and realized a problem.","Only then did Ye Jian remember that she didn’t tell Captain Xia that she had returned home. \"The weather in Xiang City is hot. The temperature is continuously high. Xiang University wants to shorten the 15 days of military training to ten days. I wanted to go back to the capital city to see Uncle Chen... Coincidentally, my father returned to the capital city too. He came to the airport personally to fetch me.\"","So that was the case...","\"It’s good to go back to the capital city. Do you plan to go to the Southern Province to see Uncle Chen? If you go, help me greet Uncle Chen.\" Xia Jinyuan restrained the smile on his handsome face. The two of them fell silent. Their hearts were heavy.","Ye Jian replied in a low voice, \"Yes. I plan to return to the Southern Province the day after tomorrow. Today... I want to go to the military headquarters to look for Commander Xia first. There’s been no news. I want to ask him in person. I’m afraid that... Commander Xia won’t tell me the truth over the phone.\"","After a while, Xia Jinyuan replied, \"Okay. It’s just that you’ll be a little tired from flying back and forth.\"","It had been so long since the military revealed any news regarding Uncle Chen’s matter. It was good to let the little fox ask Old Xia personally.","\"It’s getting late. Captain Xia, you should rest early too. You were the most tired during the desert training. You have to treat the sunburn on your face and back, especially your back. Remember to apply medicine.\"","Receiving his girlfriend’s concern, Xia Jinyuan’s gaze softened. \"Roger that! I’ll definitely be serious and obedient. Take good care of yourself. Good night, babe.\"","\"Good night.\" Then, she continued in her heart, ’...my light.’","After Ye Jian finished speaking softly, she heard the sound of kissing from the other side. She smiled faintly. When she heard him say ’good night’, she hung up reluctantly.","If she didn’t hang up first, he would definitely keep waiting.","The next morning, Ye Jian wanted to find an opportunity to tell Mr. Fu that she wanted to visit Uncle Chen. Mr. Fu seemed to have seen through Ye Jian’s thoughts. He rubbed Ye Jian’s head gently and said softly, \"I’ll go with you to visit your Uncle Chen in the morning.\"","Ye Jian was tidying up the bowls and chopsticks used for breakfast. Unexpectedly, a porcelain bowl slipped from her hand and spun on the solid wooden dining table.","\"Dad...\" Her voice was very dry, as if it was rusty.","Mr. Fu picked up the spinning bowl silently and sighed. \"I was in the military yesterday and chatted with Commander Xia for a while. I know about your Uncle Chen’s murder.\"","\"You didn’t contact your grandpa and me but insisted on returning to the capital city. You didn’t contact the Xia family either. I guessed yesterday that you must be returning to the capital city to visit your Uncle Chen.","\"My daughter, I feel guilty towards you. Such a huge thing happened, but I didn’t know anything.\" Even Commander Xia knew about it, but Mr. Fu himself didn’t know anything.","Ye Jian lowered her head. She felt the urge to cry.","\"You were on a mission and couldn’t contact your family. I’ve never blamed you for it. You don’t have to feel guilty about it.\" Ye Jian sniffled. Her eyes were a little red. She raised her head and smiled at Mr. Fu. \"Really, Dad, I’ve never blamed you. Don’t blame yourself.","\"I plan to return to the Southern Province to visit Uncle Chen the day after tomorrow. Don’t you have an appointment with your two students today? You don’t have to accompany me. I want to go to the military headquarters today to ask Commander Xia about the situation.\"","\"I’ll change it to tomorrow. I’ll go with you to look for Commander Xia today. I’ll go to the Southern Province with you the day after tomorrow. I should go and take a look... Let’s go.\""]},{"number":4564,"title":"Chapter 4564: Great Progress In The Case","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t insist. Although Mr. Fu and Uncle Chen hadn’t met much, because of their relationship with Ye Jian, the two of them could chat well.","They would talk about politics, the country, and military intelligence. The two men who shared the same military uniform would chat the entire night when they met.","Uncle Chen’s ashes were scattered in the Yellow River. Under the stone tablet at the shooting range of the Southern Province sniper base, there was only an urn and a sniper rifle that Uncle Chen used for teaching.","The sniper base in the Southern Province was Uncle Chen’s home. Uncle Chen’s favorite sniper rifles were also there. Naturally, Ye Jian chose to return to the Southern Province to pay her respects to Uncle Chen.","Before flying to the Southern Province, she planned to go to the military to ask about the progress of the matter. Then, she would fly to the Southern Province and kneel in front of Uncle Chen’s grave to tell him everything she knew. She wouldn’t give up on finding the real culprit. As long as she found the real culprit, even if it wasn’t just one person but an organization, she would take revenge for Uncle Chen.","Commander Xia was quite surprised to receive Ye Jian’s call. When he knew that she would come over, Commander Xia paused for a few seconds. He roughly guessed the reason and sighed. \"Come, girl. I have time in the morning. I’ll bring you to the National Defense.\"","The National Defense had always been in charge of investigating Uncle Chen’s assassination. Commander Xia didn’t know much about the case.","Ye Jian pursed her lips slightly. She knew that this matter made things difficult for Commander Xia. Before she could say anything, Commander Xia smiled as if he could see Ye Jian’s expression. \"Don’t feel embarrassed. I want to know how the progress is too. Since you’re here, we can go over and ask.\"","\"Thank you. Should my dad and I go to the military directly to look for you? Or should we go to the National Defense?\"","The National Defense was a distance away from the military headquarters and not far from Beihai Park. It was relatively close to Dangui Garden, so Commander Xia asked Ye Jian to wait for him at the National Defense. Then, he chatted with Mr. Fu for a while before leaving for the National Defense.","Along the way, Commander Xia contacted Minister Xia, Xia Jinyuan’s uncle, Xia Anguo. Although they were brothers, they had to make an appointment before he went to prevent a situation where Minister Xia was out of the office from arising.","When Minister Xia knew that his niece-in-law was coming, he hung up and immediately asked the person in charge of Uncle Chen’s investigation to come to his office. When Commander Xia, Mr. Fu, and Ye Jian arrived, Minister Xia was already prepared.","\"We highly suspect that Chen Dongfeng’s case involves two major organizations. Two old cases...\" In the conference room, Minister Xia told Ye Jian all the useful information they had. He didn’t skim over the details and told her everything.","The details made Commander Xia’s eyebrows jump a few times. His expression became even more serious.","It was completely unlike the style of the National Defense. Even though he had official business with the National Defense in the past, his brother had never explained things in such detail. Minister Xia would covertly pick a few points he wanted to know and send him away.","This time, he was so detailed. It was abnormal!","Ye Jian and Mr. Fu had never interacted with the National Defense before, so they didn’t know about it. They thought that Minister Xia was reporting to them in detail because of his brother, Commander Xia, and because of Xia Jinyuan.","\"Chen Dongfeng carried out countless high-level missions and had countless enemies. I can’t reveal the details of the missions he was on. That year, he retired secretly because he was being watched by these two organizations. They offered one million USD to buy his life. In the early 1990s and late 1980s, one million USD was a huge fortune.","\"Back then, after Chen Dongfeng met with danger a few times, the military had no choice but to arrange for him to fake his death and retire for the sake of his safety. The next 20 years were peaceful.","\"However, after investigating Li Chuhai, the two organizations that we investigated started to make a move. That’s why we highly suspect that Chen Dongfeng’s assassination is very likely related to these two organizations."]},{"number":4565,"title":"Chapter 4565: Shock","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s gaze was extremely vicious. Mr. Fu’s heart tightened when he saw this. He was afraid that his daughter would do something shocking.","Minister Xia couldn’t help but take a few more glances at Ye Jian’s cold expression. Then, he took out two photos from a sealed leather document bag and handed them over.","These two photos were of members of the two major organizations who were active internationally. Minister Xia handed these two photos to Ye Jian and Mr. Fu.","\"These two people come from two different organizations. They have outstanding assassination abilities. However, the two of them didn’t enter the country at that time. They were operating in the war-torn country.\"","Ye Jian took the photos and looked at them. Her pupils constricted instantly. The photo she was holding was of a mixed-race woman. She had green eyes and black hair. She was beautiful and dangerous.","What was even more dangerous was that... she was wearing a silver bracelet on her right wrist. It was a killing weapon that could be used as a bracelet.","This was the first time she saw the same accessory.","In her mind, Ye Jian suddenly remembered an operation in Lin Country. Quentin, who helped her, told her not to reveal the thing she was wearing on her wrist in front of the people of Lin Country and Sun Island. It would cause trouble.","After Quentin’s reminder, she rarely revealed it. Even when she went overseas for missions, she only revealed it at the last critical moment.","She had never seen a similar accessory before, but today, she saw it around the wrist of a woman in this photo. The person she killed in the past... was also a woman.","They were both women, so they must have come from the same organization.","Ye Jian’s gaze turned colder and colder. Could it be that the two people who were killed by her and Captain Xia in the past were actually spies in disguise to confuse the public?","Their real target was Uncle Chen, who was still the principal of Fujun Town Middle School back then. Did she and Captain Xia accidentally get rid of them, preventing Principal Chen’s exposure?","Ye Jian felt a chill on her back. She was still staring at the photo. Minister Xia gave her a look. The person in charge of Principal Chen’s investigation apologized and asked Ye Jian to pass the photo back to her.","Mr. Fu wanted to look at the photo in Ye Jian’s hand, but Ye Jian quickly passed the photo over. Mr. Fu, who didn’t see anything, passed the photo in his hand to Ye Jian and said, \"Remember their faces.\"","Ye Jian nodded slightly. She took the photo and sized it up carefully. She memorized the face of the foreign man in the photo before returning it.","Minister Xia, who was sitting at the head of the table, placed the photos back into the sealed bag and looked straight at Ye Jian. His habitually serious voice carried strength as he said, \"The National Defense will continue to find clues. We haven’t given up.","\"The National Defense isn’t giving up on the investigation, but we can’t find clues overnight. What we’ve discovered about the two organizations is only the tip of the iceberg. It’s very difficult to make progress like this.","\"Little Ye, I can understand that you want to resolve this as soon as possible. However, are you sure that you’ve already prepared yourself for the danger you might face in the future?","\"Think about it carefully...\"","\"Cough...\"","Halfway through his sentence, Commander Xia suddenly felt an itch in his throat. He coughed loudly. Mr. Fu glanced at Commander Xia, who was sitting opposite him.","Minister Xia changed his words naturally. \"Think about what I said. I hope you can take my words to heart.\"","Ye Jian’s gaze moved slightly. Soon, she nodded with a solemn expression. \"I understand. Thank you for your reminder, Minister Xia. I’ll remember it and reflect on it.\""]},{"number":4566,"title":"Chapter 4566: Shocking News","paragraphs":["\"Alright. I still have something on. See you next time.\" Minister Xia nodded and smiled subtly. As he spoke, he stood up and walked in front of Mr. Fu. His sternness from before was gone. He smiled and said, \"Engineer Fu, I’m sorry that I can’t accompany you today. Please be careful.\"","\"Minister Xia, you’re being too polite. I’m very grateful that you took the time to see us even though you’re so busy. If there’s a chance, I’ll definitely have a good chat with you.\"","The elegant Mr. Fu smiled back. His tone was sincere and polite, causing the smile on Minister Xia’s face to deepen. He reached out his hand and gestured for Mr. Fu to leave first. He was polite and sincere.","As Xia Jinyuan’s eldest uncle, he naturally had to show his respect to his nephew’s father-in-law.","Ye Jian stood at the side silently. She was the junior. She should be the last.","After walking out of the conference room, the guard beside Minister Xia immediately walked over and saluted the three chiefs. After the salute, he said, \"Minister, the car is ready.\"","\"Okay.\" Minister Xia nodded slightly. Then, he turned around and said to Mr. Fu, \"I’ll make a move first. Excuse me.\"","\"Take care.\"","Since Minister Xia had given him a certain amount of respect, Mr. Fu naturally wouldn’t be rude. They chatted happily. Although they were polite, they weren’t strangers.","Commander Xia watched as his eldest brother left. He couldn’t help but smile. His eldest brother was a busy person. It wasn’t easy for him to take an hour out of his schedule.","\"Commander Xia, I have to thank you for today. If not, my daughter and I wouldn’t have been able to see Minister Xia so easily. Thank you.\"","Today was probably the day Mr. Fu thanked someone the most. Even if it was... even if it was the Xia family that might become his in-laws in the future, Mr. Fu wouldn’t dare be casual about it.","In-laws were not exactly close family members. It was reasonable for them not to help out.","They chose to help out of kindness, not out of duty. Mr. Fu wasn’t a scholar who couldn’t tell right from wrong.","Commander Xia didn’t want his in-law to be polite with him. He smiled and said, \"There’s no need to be so polite. I promised Little Ye that I would find out the truth. Everything is still shrouded in mystery now. How can I give up halfway?","\"I’ll send you and Little Ye out first. How about we have dinner tonight? Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia wish to invite Little Ye home. They always think about her.\"","What else could Mr. Fu say? He naturally smiled and agreed.","After walking out of the heavily guarded building of the National Defense, Commander Xia left first under Ye Jian’s escort. He was busy with work too. Just like Minister Xia, he took time out.","Ye Jian watched as Commander Xia’s car disappeared from her sight before returning to the car with Mr. Fu.","After getting into the car, Mr. Fu, whose expression was slightly restrained, said in a serious tone, \"The National Defense is investigating. The real culprit will be found one day. However, I don’t understand why Minister Xia mentioned that you’ll face danger in the future. Is there anything else that’s inconvenient to reveal?\"","Mr. Fu couldn’t guess it, but Ye Jian understood a little. Minister Xia purposely showed her the photo with the same silver wire. In the end, he took it back promptly. The meaning was obvious.","He was telling her that she had already met someone from the two organizations.","Afraid that Mr. Fu would be worried, Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Don’t think too much. Minister Xia must’ve seen that I’m chasing after the perpetrators and is worried that I would take the initiative and get into trouble. That’s why he reminded me. There’s no hidden secret.\"","There was a secret, but it was inconvenient to say it out loud. Ye Jian lowered her eyes slightly and lowered the corner of her lips.","Mr. Fu felt a little uneasy. Even his expression turned cold. After a while, he said, \"No, what he said made me very worried. I need to ask him clearly.\""]},{"number":4567,"title":"Chapter 4567: Wind Rises","paragraphs":["\"Dad, you’re thinking too much. What danger can I be in? My day-to-day life is so limited. I only have military school training and military unit training. Besides that, I rarely go back home. What danger can I be in?","\"It’s precisely because I’m not in any danger now that Minister Xia said that I should be prepared to face danger in the future. He’s reminding me not to investigate it myself because I don’t have the ability to face danger in the future.","\"That’s why I thanked Minister Xia for his advice. I’ll definitely remember it and reflect on it. Can’t you see that Minister Xia is just showing goodwill and concern for your daughter?\"","...","After hearing Ye Jian’s explanation, Mr. Fu felt that it made sense. Was he really thinking too much?","\"Dad, can you go shopping with me? You haven’t gone shopping with me yet.\"","Ye Jian was really afraid that Mr. Fu would continue thinking about it, so she quickly changed the topic. Mr. Fu fell for this trick and immediately smiled. \"Sure. You don’t have to worry over my finances. Buy whatever you want. I can even hand my wages to you for safekeeping.\"","Ye Jian laughed continuously. \"I rarely touch my card. If you give me your card, it’ll probably collect dust too.\"","\"That’s true.\"","After he finished speaking, Mr. Fu laughed heartily too. The heavy atmosphere in the car just now was instantly swept away. The father and daughter chatted and laughed as they went to Xidan.","On the other hand, Commander Xia was on the phone with Minister Xia.","\"The National Defense doesn’t even know if the two organizations know about it. You still need to remind Little Ye personally to pay more attention to her safety.\" Sitting in the car, Minister Xia’s tone was even more serious than when he was in the conference room. \"A few years ago, she already had a life-or-death battle with the members of the two organizations. I’ve already reminded her. I specially chose a photo of a member that I knew she could figure out the problem with. I observed her reaction and response carefully. I can confirm that the child understood what I wanted to tell her.","\"You can remind her again. She shouldn’t act alone if there’s a problem. If she makes decisions on her own, it won’t be a small matter! If it’s serious, she’ll die on the spot.\"","Commander Xia’s expression was stern and cold. His military might was so strong that even the guards were nervous. He said in a low voice, \"Okay, I’ve already invited my in-law to the old residence as a guest. After I finish my work, I’ll return to the old residence immediately. I’ll definitely talk to the child alone.\"","\"Yes, you have to pay attention to your in-law. He’s not someone who can be fooled easily.\"","\"Okay, I’ll make the necessary arrangements.\"","\"I’ll try my best to find time to return to the old residence tonight and accompany your in-law with you. I like Little Ye very much. Little Six isn’t in the capital city. As Little Six’s father, you can’t drag him down. Treat him well.\"","Commander Xia couldn’t help but smile when he heard his eldest brother’s instructions. Even though they were already old, his eldest brother was still as worried as when he was young.","The two brothers chatted for a while before hanging up. Mr. Fu and Ye Jian went home and changed into casual clothes. They then went straight to Xidan. When they reached Xidan, Ye Jian was dazzled and didn’t know where to start.","Mr. Fu was even more shocked than Ye Jian. He looked at the crowded place and laughed. \"I haven’t been to Xidan in six years. I was even planning to look for the mall.\"","When they reached Xidan, they didn’t need to look for a mall. There were rows of buildings on both sides of the street.","Ye Jian wanted to end the battle as quickly as possible, but Mr. Fu didn’t agree. He insisted on browsing carefully. If he didn’t know anything, he would ask the salesperson seriously.","When the salesperson saw that Mr. Fu didn’t know anything and couldn’t make up his mind, she asked Ye Jian. Ye Jian, who also didn’t know anything, called Xu Wen. When Xu Wen found out that Ye Jian was in the capital city and was still in Xidan, she immediately said that she wanted to come over.","When Ye Jian told Xu Wen that her dad was with her, Xu Wen gave up on that idea."]},{"number":4568,"title":"Chapter 4568: A Good Father","paragraphs":["Xu Wen, who didn’t join the shopping spree, became Ye Jian’s virtual consultant. Xu Wen casually told Ye Jian what brand was good and what brand was suitable for her,","It was probably because this was the first time that Ye Jian was shopping for skincare products, so Xu Wen didn’t notice Ye Jian’s mistake when Ye Jian said that her father was accompanying her. He Jing and Xu Wen knew that Ye Jian’s parents had passed away.","Mr. Fu bought everything Xu Wen recommended. \"Your comrade said that it’s not bad, so it must be true. Buy it, buy everything.\"","\"Facial cleanser? You can probably use it to shower too. Do you want to buy more?\"","\"Toner? It cools and soothes the skin? You can apply it on your face and your body too. You still need to go to other schools for training. You should buy a few more bottles.\"","As long as Xu Wen recommended it, Mr. Fu wouldn’t just buy one; he would buy a few bottles of it. Sometimes, when Ye Jian was a little distracted, Mr. Fu would take the sales slip and line up to pay.","\"Girl, your father treats you so well. He’s so generous. He’s so concerned about you. You’re really lucky to have such a good father.\"","The salesperson was even happier. The customer said they could bathe with facial cleanser and apply toner to the body. She really hoped that she would meet more wealthy customers like this.","Ye Jian was distracted again and didn’t hear what the other party said. She only sobered up when the other party passed her a heavy bag. She stared at the several bottles and said in surprise, \"Did you make a mistake? I don’t want so many. One bottle of each is enough. Why did you give me so many?\"","\"Young lady, you...\" She was standing here just now but didn’t hear anything? The salesperson then explained again with a smile.","Ye Jian was dumbfounded. She... didn’t listen much just now. She was thinking about the photo and Uncle Chen.","\"Can I return the items? I want to return them.\"","\"No, no. I’ve already bought it. No.\" Mr. Fu, who had returned from settling the bill, interrupted her in time. The salesperson’s smile, which was about to freeze, bloomed again.","\"Thank you for your patronage. Welcome next time. Have a safe trip.\" After sending off the generous customer, the salesperson turned around and started chatting with her colleagues. They talked about how much they envied Ye Jian for having such a good father.","They didn’t shop for long. Ye Jian wanted to go home and sleep because she had been very tired recently. Mr. Fu didn’t suspect anything. The sunburn on Ye Jian’s body showed that she had been really tired recently. After shopping for almost an hour and a half, Ye Jian returned to Dan Gui Garden and went back to her room to sleep. Mr. Fu entered the study.","During dinner, Xu Wen mentioned to her parents that Ye Jian was also in Beijing. When Mr. Xu heard this, he immediately said, \"What a coincidence. Contact her later and ask her if she’s free tomorrow. Your mom and I will treat her to a meal to thank her for taking care of you for so many years.\"","Xu Wen was able to get to where she was today and change all her habits because of Ye Jian. Mr. and Mrs. Xu knew that very well. If it weren’t for Ye Jian, Xu Wen wouldn’t be where she was today.","Looking at her daughter who was getting better and better every day, Mrs. Xu smiled kindly and said, \"Her parents are dead. You have to take care of her more often. You can’t let Little Ye take care of you.","\"See if you can ask her out tomorrow. We must thank her for all the help she’s given you in the past few years. It’s all thanks to her that you’re where you are today.\"","Xu Wen, who was picking up food, nodded and smiled. \"Okay, I’ll contact her later to see if she’s free tomorrow. Dad, Mom, Little Jian’s parents... Huh, that’s not right...\""]},{"number":4569,"title":"Chapter 4569: Don’t Misunderstand","paragraphs":["No, no, no!","Mrs. Xu was stunned. \"What’s wrong? What’s on your mind?\"","Xu Wen didn’t answer. She narrowed her eyes and recalled every conversation she had with Ye Jian.","\"My dad is accompanying me...\" At that time, Ye Jian said this, which was why Xu Wen gave up on the idea of shopping with Ye Jian.","\"Dad, Mom, I’m done. Enjoy your food.\" Xu Wen hurriedly stuffed the food into her mouth. Without waiting for her parents to speak, she put down her chopsticks and ran back to her room.","Both of Ye Jian’s parents had passed away... In that case, who was the dad Ye Jian was talking about today?","No, she had to ask clearly. Her curiosity was completely piqued.","When Mrs. Xu saw this, she smiled and sighed. She said to Mr. Xu, \"Look at this child. She’s more mature when she isn’t praised. Now she’s like a child again.\"","\"You just have too many expectations. Wen has improved a lot. Don’t be too harsh.\" Mr. Xu doted on his daughter and smiled as he picked up some vegetables for Mrs. Xu and placed them in her bowl. \"Eat some vegetables. After you’re done, the three of us will take a walk.\"","\"You always let her do whatever she wants.\" Mrs. Xu glared at her husband, who pretended to be clueless.","It couldn’t be helped. Mr. Xu didn’t return home all year round, so he naturally had to dote on his daughter, whom he didn’t see often.","Ye Jian was chatting with Old Master Xia and Old Madam Xia at the Xia family’s old residence. When the two elders found out that their granddaughter-in-law was coming to the old residence tonight, they were overjoyed. They instructed the family to make early preparations, afraid that their granddaughter-in-law would be neglected.","They also told Commander Xia that he had to come back tonight to drink with his in-law. They didn’t need to drink until they were drunk. Just a little to heighten the atmosphere would do.","Commander Xia and Minister Xia entered the house one after another. Mr. Fu and Ye Jian were around half an hour earlier and were already chatting with the Xia family members present.","After dinner, they went to the garden behind the old Xia residence. They walked slowly in the cold wind. The entire time, they laughed and chatted.","As Old Madam Xia injured her knee when she was young, it was not suitable for her to walk for long. She walked around the back garden before going to the octagonal pavilion to rest. When Xu Wen called, Ye Jian was chatting and laughing with her.","Afraid that Ye Jian would be too embarrassed to speak, Old Madam Xia said, \"Young people need to have their own social circle. They can’t accompany the elderly all the time. My good granddaughter-in-law, go ahead and talk.\"","Ye Jian liked the elders in the family very much. Old Master Fu, Old Master Xia, and Old Madam Xia were all kind elders who were always considerate toward the younger generation. They were wise, knowledgeable, and magnanimous. They had a positive and optimistic heart. They weren’t like the old madam of the Ye family who used her selfish desires to control her children. She didn’t even let the younger generation off.","Holding her cell phone, Ye Jian stood up and picked up Xu Wen’s call under the gentle gaze of Old Madam Xia.","After picking up the call, Xu Wen said, \"Jian, did you say your father accompanied you today?\"","Ye Jian raised her eyebrows. When did this girl become so smart?","At that time, she was so happy that she blurted it out. Later, Xu Wen didn’t ask her about it, so she thought that Xu Wen didn’t take it to heart. Ye Jian didn’t expect Xu Wen to call her to ask about it at night.","She pondered for a moment and thought about how to answer Xu Wen. Xu Wen continued, \"Is it inconvenient for you to tell me? If it’s not convenient, just pretend that I didn’t ask.\"","Xu Wen suddenly felt that there was no need to ask clearly. Anyway, Jian wouldn’t do anything bad.","Ye Jian smiled and said, \"It’s not inconvenient. I just don’t know how to start. I mentioned my father to you before. At that time, you and Jing thought that he was my godfather, so I didn’t explain further."]},{"number":4570,"title":"Chapter 4570: Cruel Truth","paragraphs":["Since Xu Wen asked, Ye Jian didn’t plan to hide it. She just wanted to get to the main point. \"He’s not my godfather. He’s my biological father. It’s a little complicated. It has to do with the past generation. It’s too complicated. It can’t be explained in a few words. It’s fine as long as you know that my father is my biological father.\"","Xu Wen, who was hiding in the room to make the call, felt dizzy. \"It’s indeed complicated. I don’t plan to ask anymore. I’m afraid I’m not smart enough to understand. It’s fine as long as you know that your father is your biological father. You can tell me the other things next time if you want.\"","That was Ye Jian’s family matter. As a good friend, she shouldn’t ask for details. She just needed to know the most important thing.","Xu Wen, who had always had a high EQ, stopped asking and quickly changed the topic. \"Jian, my parents know that you’re in the capital city and want to ask you out for a meal. I wonder if you have time?\"","Tomorrow... she really didn’t have time.","\"I’m sorry, Wen. My dad and I haven’t seen each other in a long time. I’ll only be back in the capital city for two days. I’m going to accompany my dad to see his students tomorrow. I’ll be leaving the capital city the day after tomorrow.\"","\"That fast? That means you won’t have time to grab a meal with us. Alright, I’ll talk to my parents. We still have a lot of chances to have a meal together,\" Xu Wen said with a smile. She didn’t force Ye Jian at all. The two of them laughed and chatted for a while before ending the call.","Ye Jian turned around and saw her uncle, Minister Xia, who was supposed to be resting in the pavilion, walking toward her. Ye Jian was about to walk over when Minister Xia waved his hand and gestured for her to stand on the spot.","The location where his niece-in-law answered the call was good. It was suitable for chatting.","Ye Jian knew that her uncle had something to tell her. It might be about the photo she saw during the day.","Minister Xia indeed wanted to talk about the photo. He didn’t say anything when he walked closer. Ye Jian greeted him, and Minister Xia smiled as he nodded his head. Then, he went straight to the point.","\"I’m sure you know what I’m going to say. When you were in junior high, you fought with the members of the organization and even worked with Little Six to kill two members. You even have the assassination weapon of one of the female members...\"","At the mention of the silver wire, Ye Jian’s heart turned cold. She interrupted Minister Xia anxiously, \"Uncle, that’s because I like it...\" She didn’t want Xia Jinyuan to be punished because of her, so she quickly took responsibility for intercepting the evidence.","After all, she was still a student at that time. If this matter was escalated, she would at most be criticized harshly. However, Captain Xia was different. He would be punished.","Minister Xia raised his hand and didn’t let Ye Jian continue. \"I know what you want to say. I’m not holding you accountable now. I just want to tell you that the organization has never given up on looking for Chen Dongfeng. Many years ago, they found Anyang, which is enough to prove that they were investigating in the right direction. Later, they were intercepted by you and Little Six. They thought that their mission was exposed, so they immediately stopped and lay low.","\"A few years later, they made a comeback and killed Chen Dongfeng. Did you think about this in the afternoon? Or perhaps, do you have your own opinion?\"","Ye Jian lowered her head. The atmosphere around her turned gloomy. There was sorrow in her eyes. \"Uncle, I’ve always wondered why Uncle Chen suddenly came to the capital city from the sniper base without alerting anyone. Previously, I never understood why Uncle Chen knew that there was danger but still came to the capital city.","\"It wasn’t until I saw the photo at your place this morning that I... think I understood why Uncle Chen suddenly wanted to come to the capital city and why he didn’t want to alarm anyone. It was because of me... It was all because of me.\""]},{"number":4571,"title":"Chapter 4571: Blame","paragraphs":["Ever since she came out of the National Defense building, Ye Jian’s mood had been very serious. Even when she went shopping later, she didn’t have any thoughts about it. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have realized too late that Mr. Fu had bought a few bottles of everything.","It was because she had been distracted and was thinking about the person in the photo. A few years later, she saw the same silver wire again. Hence, in the end, she found an excuse to tell Mr. Fu that she was very tired and wanted to go home.","She kept thinking about it, even when she went home and locked herself in her room.","She finally connected the dots and thought of the reason why Uncle Chen came to the capital city.","If it weren’t for her, Uncle Chen would never have come to the capital city. Never!","Her tears hit the ground one by one, causing small splashes. Ye Jian, who didn’t raise her head, was choking from the tears.","\"It was because of me. It was because of me... Uncle Chen came to the capital city. If it weren’t for me, Uncle Chen... Uncle Chen wouldn’t have come to the capital city. Many years ago, Captain Xia and I killed the members of the organization. These people might have found out about me and my relationship with Uncle Chen. Hence, they threatened Uncle Chen and asked him to leave the sniper base and come to the capital city.","\"It was all because of me. Uncle Chen came to the capital city because of me...","Afraid of alerting the elders in the pavilion, Ye Jian suppressed her cries. Her voice was filled with sorrow. The overwhelming pain made Minister Xia close his eyes. It was indeed extraordinary that Little Six found her to be the daughter-in-law of the Xia family!","To be able to subdue a girl like Little Six, he must have known that she was extraordinary. He knew that this child was powerful. Now, Minister Xia knew that he had underestimated her in the past!","She was as beautiful as a bamboo in the wind... She was elegant and pleasant, and her heart was strong!","A photo, a past, and a reminder from him... Just like that, she connected the dots and finally thought of the cause of the incident that the National Defense... had been investigating for a long time.","Why did Chen Dongfeng come to the capital city without alerting anyone? It was indeed because he didn’t want to see Ye Jian, whom he raised like his own daughter, in any danger.","He didn’t alert anyone because he knew that once he told others, he wouldn’t be able to come to the capital city. At the same time, Ye Jian would stop him.","However, he knew that he might be in danger, so someone needed to know in time. Hence, he pretended to meet the instructor from the base who came to the capital city. The two of them came to the capital city and walked out of the train station together.","However, Chen Dongfeng didn’t expect the members of the organization to have already set up an ambush nearby. They waited for him to come out and took action immediately. They didn’t even think of meeting him.","The world-class King of Sniper Rifles fell just like that. The military lost a good general. How could they not be angry?","However, the members of the two organizations were all skilled, and their whereabouts were uncertain. The military didn’t know how many members there were in the organization. It wasn’t easy to find the culprit.","It was not easy to investigate. They needed to find the culprit and intimidate the two organizations!","Minister Xia, who was standing with his hands behind his back, did not speak immediately. His niece-in-law in front of him had probably thought of the crux of the matter and had been suppressing herself. It was good to cry now. Crying was also a way to ease her emotions and release her pressure.","\"In order to protect me, Uncle Chen had no choice but to leave the sniper base. He thought he could take care of those people himself, so he came to the capital city alone. In the end, he was afraid that these people would continue to stay in the country, so he deliberately traveled with a sniper instructor who came to the capital city for a business trip.\"","Ye Jian covered her face in pain and sobbed softly. Hot tears flowed out from between her fingers and wet the back of her hand. \"Actually, Uncle Chen was determined to die from the very start, but he didn’t want to die silently. He wanted the members of the organization who killed him to stay. He needed someone beside him...\""]},{"number":4572,"title":"Chapter 4572: Extreme Intelligence Will Hurt You","paragraphs":["\"Before Uncle Chen left, he kept telling me not to take revenge for him and not to put myself in danger. Actually, what Uncle Chen wanted to say was that everything would end with his death.","\"I’m too stupid, too stupid... I didn’t think of the crux of the matter immediately. I thought that Uncle just didn’t want me to take revenge for him. I was too stupid. If I had thought that Uncle Chen secretly came to the capital city because of me, the National Defense’s investigation might have made faster progress. Maybe they would’ve been able to start taking action by now.\"","Ye Jian didn’t understand why Principal Chen would enter the capital city before this. The moment she saw the photo, she couldn’t help but make guesses until she finally understood.","Minister Xia sighed softly. \"You’re wrong, child. You’re not stupid. You just didn’t know that the other party was involved. You didn’t know that the other party had never given up.","\"Even if you guessed that he came to the capital city for you, the National Defense wouldn’t have the ability to immediately look into the case from a few years ago.","\"Child, you’re not stupid. You’re not stupid at all. Instead, you’re so smart. You’ve shocked me. Extreme intelligence can hurt you. I would rather you be stupid. That way, you wouldn’t have too many shackles on your heart and you wouldn’t be tired.","\"I just wanted to remind you that you might be in danger too. From the looks of it, I was wrong. I shouldn’t have given you the photo. I just wanted to remind you to be careful in the future. I didn’t want you to cry so sadly.\"","Minister Xia really regretted it. He underestimated Ye Jian’s sharpness. He underestimated Ye Jian’s sharp analysis of the matter. That was why this scene happened.","\"No, Uncle. I’m very grateful to you. Thank you for letting me see the photo.\" Ye Jian raised her hand to wipe the tears from the corners of her eyes and cheeks. She raised her head and looked at Minister Xia with red eyes. Her choked voice was like a trembling guitar string. \"If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have known that Uncle Chen was assassinated because of me. Thank you, Uncle. Thank you very much.\"","After she finished speaking, Ye Jian bowed deeply. Minister Xia hurriedly took a step forward and helped Ye Jian up with both hands. \"Child, get up quickly. I’m the one who should be apologizing to you. I made you so sad.\"","\"Don’t cry anymore. It’s a done deal. Since you want to seek justice for him, you should take good care of yourself. Also, you might not be safe now. You should understand what you should do.\"","\"Let’s not talk about anything else. First, you have to see if you can stand up for your Uncle Chen and come back alive.\"","\"Child, the dead are gone. The living need to do more and more things. You need to be calm and not regret it. Do you understand?\"","Every word was a gem. Ye Jian remembered them clearly.","Ye Jian wiped her tears with a handkerchief. Then, she took some ice and placed it over her eyes. She didn’t return to the pavilion until Minister Xia nodded.","When Commander Xia saw Ye Jian coming back, he knew that his eldest brother had settled the matter and left.","Mr. Fu retracted his gaze secretly. He could tell that Ye Jian’s mood was not stable. However, she was smiling when she came over. Mr. Fu felt a little uneasy.","His instincts told him that his daughter had something to hide.","It was time to return to Dan Gui Garden. Ye Jian sat down and chatted with the two elders for a while before leaving the Xia family’s old residence with Mr. Fu. Commander Xia stood at the entrance of the two stone lions until the car drove out.","The car drove out. Commander Xia immediately called Minister Xia, who had left. From this, he learned that his daughter-in-law had guessed the cause of the incident by herself. Commander Xia was silent for a long time."]},{"number":4573,"title":"Chapter 4573: Step By Step","paragraphs":["\"Remind Little Six that Little Ye is a loyal child. It’s easy for her to hurt herself. Let him comfort her. She shouldn’t blame herself.","\"I was careless. I didn’t expect this child to be so smart.\"","Commander Xia smiled bitterly. \"Brother, you were careless, but I’m... even more shocked. I knew that Little Six’s future wife was smart, but this time, she has let me seen how outstanding she is.\"","\"Don’t worry about Little Ye. I’ll ask Little Six to comfort her. Please inform me in advance if the National Defense has any updates.\"","\"Yes, I’ll inform you if anything happens. It’s getting late. Take care of the two elders and rest.\" After that, Minister Xia hung up the phone. He lay his head on the headrest of the car seat and closed his eyes to rest.","Although progress was difficult, there would always be progress. Now, the National Defense needed to hurry up and investigate if Little Ye was being targeted.","The light from the street lamps outside flashed past the car quickly. It made Minister Xia’s facial expression even darker. He closed his eyes until he got out of the car.","Dan Gui Garden was a short distance away. On the way back, Mr. Fu asked Ye Jian again if she had any problems and if she could tell him. Ye Jian acted coquettishly, refusing to say anything. She just said that if Mr. Fu didn’t believe her, he could contact Commander Xia and Minister Xia immediately.","Seeing that Mr. Fu wasn’t completely convinced, Ye Jian said in a low voice, \"Dad, I’m just thinking about Uncle Chen... I’m sad. There are two other organizations involved in this. I wonder how the National Defense will act.\"","Mr. Fu finally believed her.","Uncle Chen’s death was indeed a hurdle that his daughter couldn’t overcome. Mr. Fu lowered his voice and advised kindly, \"We’ll visit your Uncle Chen the day after tomorrow. I believe that he hopes that you can move on with your life and not be so troubled. One look at you and you can tell that he wouldn’t be happy.","\"Be happy when you go over to see him. That way, Uncle Chen will feel at ease in the afterlife. As for your mother... The plane ticket is at 3:00 pm tomorrow. We’ll visit your mother tomorrow afternoon. How about that?\"","Seeing that Mr. Fu didn’t ask anymore, Ye Jian heaved a sigh of relief. She didn’t want Mr. Fu to worry, so she immediately nodded heavily. \"Okay, let’s visit Mom together tomorrow and talk to her.\"","The father and daughter arranged everything for tomorrow.","The next morning, at eight o’clock, Ye Jian left Dan Gui Garden with Mr. Fu. When Ye Jian came to the capital city, she only brought long-sleeved military uniforms. As Mr. Fu drove, he regretted not buying a few sets of casual clothes for Ye Jian yesterday.","Ye Jian, who was wearing the standard military uniform, smiled and said, \"My casual clothes are the same as my card. I bought them but haven’t worn them yet. Before long, I’d realize that the season is over. It’s good to wear the military uniform. It makes me feel more at ease.\"","She was used to wearing standard military uniforms and camouflage suits all year round. It was especially awkward to suddenly wear casual clothes. Even when she walked, she would feel that something was wrong.","Now, she was wearing a military uniform with a long-sleeved shirt. It was a female student’s uniform. Ye Jian felt that it was just right.","Mr. Fu, who was also used to wearing military uniforms, understood his daughter well and didn’t say anything else.","However, he was worried about whether his two students would be wearing casual clothes.","When they arrived at the tea room where they were supposed to meet, Mr. Fu pushed open the wooden door and knew that his worry was unnecessary. The two students who arrived early were also wearing long-sleeved military uniforms. The difference was that they had military ranks, and Ye Jian just had the student’s epaulet.","The two students knew that their teacher would bring his daughter over last night, so they weren’t surprised when they saw Ye Jian. They only knew that their teacher had a daughter last night!","In the past, everyone said that the teacher’s wife passed away early and he didn’t have any children. Why did a daughter suddenly appear?","They even wondered if she was an adopted daughter.","Seeing her, they knew that she was definitely not an adopted daughter!","The female student who came in looked like their teacher. One look and they could tell that she was his biological daughter. She was quite beautiful too."]},{"number":4574,"title":"Chapter 4574: Fatherly Love","paragraphs":["Mr. Fu’s two students were not old. They were from the capital city and were around 27 or 28 years old. They looked to be upright men and were considered handsome. They probably came to the laboratory often like Mr. Fu, so their skin was slightly fair. They were also very calm and polite. One look and you could tell that they came from well-educated families.","They were both graduate students. After the two outstanding professionals were assigned to a base in the northwest, they were always led by Mr. Fu. Mr. Fu had a high opinion of their ability and character. If not, he wouldn’t have brought Ye Jian to meet them.","The two of them were a little surprised when Ye Jian first came in, but after Mr. Fu introduced her to the two of them, they promptly called her ’Junior’.","It was right for them to call her that given that she was the daughter of their teacher.","As they chatted, Ye Jian could tell from their words and actions that they respected Mr. Fu and were taking good care of her.","They weren’t trying to please her, and they didn’t make her uncomfortable. Instead, they would talk about topics that Ye Jian could participate in. They didn’t neglect Ye Jian.","During the conversation, Ye Jian knew that the two of them had arrived a week ago to attend a briefing. They didn’t talk about the details of the briefing. Mr. Fu invited the two of them out for a chat, but he didn’t mention anything about the base.","When it came to missiles, it was all about what the Western countries had developed and what projects they had started. Ye Jian, who had never come into contact with this field, didn’t understand it at all, but... she listened with interest.","This was a blank field that she couldn’t come into contact with or understand.","\"Junior, you seem very interested. Do you plan to develop in another field?\" One of the students with the surname Shao smiled and asked Ye Jian. He teased her, \"I’m afraid the teacher will be reluctant.\"","Ye Jian hurriedly shook her head and denied it with a smile. \"No, no. I’ve never come into contact with this before. I’m just very curious. I don’t have the courage to change fields.\"","\"It’s always good for the child to follow in their parent’s footsteps.\" Another student with the surname Jin joined in the teasing. They could all tell that Ye Jian had taken after their teacher’s easy-going personality. However, they didn’t want her to be bored by listening to them alone, so they teased her appropriately to liven up the atmosphere.","Mr. Fu smiled and said, \"Don’t tease my daughter. She’s shy and can’t stand your teasing.\" Mr. Fu looked at Ye Jian with a kind smile. \"I brought her out because I want to see that there’s always someone better. She shouldn’t always think that her boyfriend is the best person out there.","\"There are actually many good men outside.\"","The two students laughed softly when they heard that. Although they knew that their teacher would bring his daughter over last night, they had never thought of anything else. It was impossible.","Their teacher only went home once or twice a year. He knew that he had let down his family. How could he bear to let his daughter find a husband who rarely went home too?","As for why their teacher suddenly said that he wanted to bring his daughter to see them, they thought that Ye Jian wanted to understand more about their teacher’s life in the base. Hence, just now, many topics centered on their teacher. Ye Jian listened attentively and was very interested.","It was only now that they realized that it wasn’t what they thought. Their teacher... Cough, he was worried that his daughter cared too much about her boyfriend and was at a disadvantage.","\"Junior, to be honest, there are many young elites in our base. The two of us are average. Thanks to the teacher’s love, we managed to show off in front of you.\""]},{"number":4575,"title":"Chapter 4575: Goddaughter","paragraphs":["The student surnamed Shao was a little outgoing. He wasn’t as restrained as the student surnamed Jin. He was a bright person. After knowing Mr. Fu’s intentions, he very considerately stood on Mr. Fu’s side, making Mr. Fu extremely satisfied.","The student with the surname Jin filled Ye Jian’s cup with tea and smiled. \"Junior, you’re outstanding. Your boyfriend must be extraordinary. The teacher is actually very satisfied with your boyfriend. He’s just a little unhappy that a man snatched you away too early, right?\"","He was right.","Mr. Fu smiled and said, \"The two of you should teach your junior well so that she won’t be stuck in a rut. She needs to broaden her horizons.\"","As for why Mr. Fu insisted on bringing Ye Jian out to meet his students?","It was actually very simple. He just wanted Ye Jian to broaden her horizons and interact with more outstanding men so that she could know what kind of man she wanted to spend the rest of her life with.","He didn’t deny that Little Six was very outstanding. He was definitely one of the best. He was far more experienced than Ye Jian and was more mature than her in handling matters. As Ye Jian’s father, Mr. Fu didn’t want his daughter to be at a disadvantage in these aspects.","He hoped that the two of them could always stand in a fair, equal, and broad-minded position and treat each other seriously with a more mature attitude.","He only hoped that his daughter could always rely on her excellence to remain invincible. Even if the two of them separated one day, his daughter shouldn’t lose herself because of it.","This was the self-esteem, self-reliance, and carefreeness that a father should teach his daughter. Only then could she have her true self.","Ye Jian pursed her lips and smiled at the two students’ teasing. \"Seniors, you’re too humble. You’re the real dragons and phoenixes among men. You’re the pillars of the country. Come, let me toast you with tea in place of wine.\"","Mr. Fu smiled and patted Ye Jian’s head lightly. He reprimanded her with a smile, \"Using tea as wine? Where did you learn these habits? The two of them are also from the capital city. I brought you out today to let you see that other than that brat from the Xia family, there are many outstanding men in the city. Secondly, I wanted them to see you. If you can’t find me in the future, you can look for me through the two of them.\"","Besides that, Mr. Fu didn’t have any other intentions.","The Xia family was kind. He wouldn’t be unkind just because of that brat from the Xia family. He, Fu Yusheng, wouldn’t do such a thing.","The two students took the opportunity to save Ye Jian’s cell phone number. In the future, as long as Ye Jian contacted them, they would be able to tell their teacher who might be too busy to answer calls.","The two of them weren’t like their teacher who couldn’t come out of the laboratory for many days at a time. After all, they hadn’t come into contact with the core material yet.","Ye Jian naturally memorized their phone numbers. If anything happened in the future, she would have two more ways to find Mr. Fu.","It was not until they finished their lunch that the four of them separated.","On the way to the cemetery, Mr. Fu smiled and asked Ye Jian, \"What do you think of the two students I introduced to you? What do you think of them in terms of character, knowledge, and speech?\"","\"I don’t dare to comment on their knowledge. You have high expectations, so I’m sure the two of them must be knowledgeable. They’re quite good at taking care of people too. They have high EQ and IQ. They’re very polite. They should come from families with good upbringing.\"","Ye Jian gave a pertinent answer. She truly thought so."]},{"number":4576,"title":"Chapter 4576: Everything In The World","paragraphs":["When they were at a red light, Mr. Fu slowly stepped on the brakes and stopped the car steadily. He pulled the handbrake and said to Ye Jian seriously, \"My daughter, I admit that Little Six is outstanding, but you can’t not have your own circle of friends because of this.","\"I think about the time you spend in the capital city. Besides going to the Xia family’s house, you spend most of your time at home. You don’t even receive a single message on your cell phone. I think it’s too quiet.","\"I hope that you can come into contact with more outstanding people—men and women, old and young. The more outstanding friends you come into contact with, the more helpful it’ll be for your own improvement.","\"When you see the light on outstanding people, you’ll unconsciously raise your expectations of yourself and become more and more outstanding. You’ll become more and more confident and mature.","\"I hope you’ll be outstanding and confident. Even if you lose everything one day, you’ll still be your outstanding self who can make a comeback and fight again.\"","This was an outstanding father’s deepest advice to his daughter. It was as deep as the sea and as majestic as a mountain.","Ye Jian nodded vigorously. She would. She would definitely be that.","If a mother taught her daughter to be gentle, kind, and calm, then a father would definitely teach his daughter to be independent, confident, and strong.","Ye Jian was unfortunate when she was young, but she was lucky enough to start all over again. Finally, under the guidance of her elders, she completely abandoned the unfortunate Ye Jian in the past. Just like that, she became the outstanding Ye Jian she was today.","Ye Jian knelt in front of the tomb and kowtowed three times to her mother respectfully. Because of Old Master Li, the photo of Martyr Sun Xueqing was not placed on the tombstone anymore. Mr. Fu took good care of it and placed it at home. Now, only the words ’Husband: Fu Yusheng’ and ’Daughter: Ye Jian’ were carved below the tombstone.","\"It’s been hard on you, Red Plum. I wanted to put the photo up, but the Li family has deep roots. Old Master Li is very cautious, and it’s difficult to talk about all the complicated things. Please forgive me. I also hope that you’ll be able to keep our daughter safe from where you are.\"","Mr. Fu placed the white flowers in front of the tomb and said in a low voice. It had been decades, but his love had not faded. Even though many years had passed, his love was still deep.","Fu Yusheng and Sun Xueqing’s love represented an era.","After leaving the cemetery, Mr. Fu’s heart was even heavier than Ye Jian’s. Ye Jian even comforted Mr. Fu and asked him to relax and not hurt his body because of this.","Mr. Fu smiled and didn’t say anything.","The woman he loved the most had already gone to another world, taking with her all his love. It would never be seen again.","This was good. This was good too. He would guard their love for the rest of his life and not let it be tainted.","At 10:00 pm, Ye Jian was about to go to bed when she received a call from Commander Xia.","Commander Xia had already left the capital city. He arrived at the Nanguang Military District at six in the afternoon. He called to tell Ye Jian about Mr. Fu contacting him just now.","\"Your father can tell that you’re hiding something from him. He couldn’t force you to speak, so he called me to ask. Little Ye, I didn’t say anything. But you have to collect yourself.\"","It was very likely that Ye Jian was targeted... Commander Xia didn’t dare to tell Mr. Fu. He could only hide it. Even if Mr. Fu could tell that something was wrong, it didn’t matter as long as he didn’t know the details."]},{"number":4577,"title":"Chapter 4577: Sorrow, Joy, Reunion","paragraphs":["Yesterday, Mr. Fu kept asking Ye Jian questions. Ye Jian knew that Mr. Fu wouldn’t stop just like that. As long as the insiders didn’t say anything, Mr. Fu wouldn’t know.","\"Dad, it’s been hard on you. Don’t worry, I’ll collect my emotions. I won’t cause trouble for you and Uncle.\"","\"You won’t be causing trouble. I’m just worried that your father will think too much. You have to try to make your father calm down and not suspect anything again. Do you understand?\" Commander Xia had always been resigned to his future daughter-in-law’s politeness. They were family. There was no need to talk like this.","Old Master Fu had said that the Fu family was like this. They adhered to etiquette.","It was impossible for them to be impolite.","Ye Jian responded to all his reminders. She planned to completely dispel Mr. Fu’s uneasiness in a few days.","When they arrived at the Southern Province, it was drizzling. There was no need to hold an umbrella. They passed through the drizzle that was as fine as an ox’s fur. Their hair was slightly wet, forming a layer of light white water droplets.","Mr. Fu knelt on the wet grass and looked at the photo with a serious expression. In the photo, Uncle Chen was looking straight ahead. Facing him, Mr. Fu kowtowed three times. He kowtowed a little too hard. Mr. Fu’s forehead, which was stained by the grass, was slightly red.","\"Brother, you left so suddenly. I only heard the bad news a few days ago. I apologize to you!\" As he spoke, Mr. Fu kowtowed again. Ye Jian, who was kneeling, kowtowed heavily with red eyes.","Yesterday, she was able to control herself in front of her mother’s grave. Today, when she arrived at Uncle Chen’s cenotaph, Ye Jian couldn’t control herself anymore. She walked into the sniper base with tears in her eyes.","Familiar people, familiar place... The only thing missing was her family member.","The path Uncle Chen walked on was still there. The targets that Uncle Chen shot at were still there. The bench that Uncle Chen sat on when he was resting was still here. The dormitory that Uncle Chen stayed in was still the same. It was cleaned by his comrades from the sniper base every day. It was as if Uncle Chen would push the door open and enter the room the next second.","Mr. Fu’s eyes were red too. His brother had taken care of his daughter for so long. Before he could thank him properly, they were already separated.","The father and daughter were kneeling and chatting with Uncle Chen. Mr. Fu talked about the recent military situation. He talked about the huge success of the missile launched by the base some time ago. He also talked about how some Western countries felt threatened by the success of their missile. He talked about many things, including the topics surrounding Uncle Chen’s life when he was still alive.","When it was Ye Jian’s turn, Ye Jian talked about her school life, her training, and the current investigation of the National Defense.","\"Uncle Chen, don’t worry. I listened to you and didn’t investigate it myself. It’s all an in-depth investigation by the National Defense. The National Defense won’t let your murderer off.\"","The father and daughter knelt and talked for a long time. When they got up, Mr. Fu almost fell forward. Fortunately, Ye Jian was fast enough to hold him.","\"Brother, Ye Jian and I will come and see you next time. This child is busy. I hope you can forgive her for not coming to see you from time to time. If there’s any latest news from the National Defense, I will definitely come and tell you. I hope you can forgive us for not being able to come and chat with you for a long time.\"","\"Uncle Chen, I’ll visit you next time. Goodbye, Uncle Chen.\"","In the drizzle, Ye Jian, who had gotten up, knelt down again and kowtowed heavily to bid farewell. The wind blew past her fine black hair. A few raindrops dripped down her face from the roots of her hair. The tears in her eyes flowed out and merged with the rainwater. Finally, they slowly slid down her cheeks.","In the photo, Uncle Chen was still looking straight ahead with a sharp gaze. He was staring at the entire sniper base as if he had never left."]},{"number":4578,"title":"Chapter 4578: There Is Peace Because Of You","paragraphs":["The officer and instructor of the sniper base wanted to keep Ye Jian for the night. Ye Jian and Mr. Fu wanted to go to the Southern Province Martyr Memorial Park to visit Grandpa Gen, so they rejected him politely.","Grandpa Gen and Uncle Chen were Ye Jian’s closest relatives. The passing of the two elders made Ye Jian feel heartbroken. Every time she thought about it, tears would fall.","It had been three years since Grandpa Gen passed away. The sorrow in Ye Jian’s heart didn’t fluctuate as much as when she was facing Uncle Chen. However, when she saw the kind-looking Grandpa Gen in the photo and called him ’Grandpa Gen’, Ye Jian choked.","That day, Ye Jian and Mr. Fu stayed in the Southern Province. The hotel they stayed in was none other than Hotel Caesar, which was owned by Hou Zi. The lobby manager was the one who had seen Ye Jian before. When he saw Ye Jian coming over, he recognized her and welcomed her personally.","Boss Hou had already instructed the staff that since Miss Ye had come to their hotel, they had to receive her properly.","The room Ye Jian stayed in was the room that Xia Jinyuan stayed in when he came to the Southern Province in the past. Mr. Fu was arranged to stay in another room. Hou Zi was the one who stayed in that room in the past.","When Hou Zi found out that Ye Jian was staying in his hotel, he carried one baby in each hand and said to his wife, Xia Yiwei, \"Little Six’s wife went to our hotel. Unfortunately, we’re not in the Southern Province. If not, we could have met.\"","Following Xia Yiwei’s orders, Hou Zi insisted on going wherever his wife went. He kept following Xia Yiwei. This boss, who used to be famous in the underworld, no longer had the viciousness he had when he was young. Although his iconic peach blossom eyes were still shining, he was more reserved now. It was obvious that he was a successful man and not a underworld boss.","Xia Yiwei was preparing dinner. When she heard this, she looked at her husband, who had squeezed into the kitchen countless times. She said with disdain, \"I understand. Hurry up and bring Da Bao and Xiao Bao out. Don’t you know that you’re a big person and are a hindrance?\"","She had a husband who wanted to stick to her 24 hours a day. Sometimes, Xia Yiwei wanted to keep Hou Zi away with a small leather whip.","\"Da Bao, Xiao Bao, your mother despises me again. Alas, why is my life so tragic...\"","\"Hou Zi, do you want to sleep in the study tonight?\"","Before Hou Zi could finish acting pitifully, Xia Yiwei picked up the kitchen knife and glared at Hou Zi, who was getting more and more cheeky in front of her.","Hou Zi didn’t want to sleep in the study. He quickly changed his attitude and said, \"I have to work hard to make Mom happy. Da Bao and Xiao Bao, you guys will go out to play. I have to cook dinner with your mom...\"","He immediately carried Da Bao and Little Treasure out of the kitchen. In less than a minute, he snuck back. He coaxed and teased her. Looking at the man who was about to turn 40 years old, Xia Yiwei found it funny but at the same time, she felt sweet.","It had been more than ten years. Fortunately, they didn’t let go of each other. Fortunately, they persevered even when they were bleeding.","The love she wanted and the home she wanted were all given to her by this man who was still as charming as before and even more attractive.","There was peace because of him.","Ye Jian, who was far away in the Southern Province, didn’t know that Hou Zi and his wife knew that she was staying in the hotel. She had to return to school the day after tomorrow. In order to spend more time with his daughter, Mr. Fu asked where the busiest place in the provincial city was and brought Ye Jian around.","It was rare for the father and daughter to get together. They walked around the city and tasted snacks at the same time. On the fifth day, the father and daughter left the Southern Province in satisfaction.","When they arrived at the airport, the father and daughter didn’t travel together anymore. Mr. Fu flew to the capital city. Ye Jian carried her camouflage bag that smelled like Chinese medicine and flew back to Xiang City to start her ten-day training."]},{"number":4579,"title":"Chapter 4579: Urgent","paragraphs":["After five days of rest, although she had been flying around, Ye Jian was still energetic. After recuperation, even the tri-colored skin on her face had turned paler and lighter. With a little makeup, she was still the school belle.","When Ye Jian arrived at the school, she sent a message to Mr. Fu saying that she had arrived safely. Then, she received a message from Song Zhiqiu. He informed her that the students from the school would gather at the conference room on the fifth floor of Teaching Building No. 4 to participate in the pre-training meeting. It could be considered a meeting for the students.","It was already 12:40 pm when she arrived at the airport. Ye Jian saw that time was tight and gave up on taking the bus. She hurriedly ran to the parking lot to take a taxi back to school.","She was only ten minutes away from the designated meeting time when she arrived at the school. She didn’t even have time to put her luggage back in her dormitory. She ran all the way to Teaching Building No. 4.","She sprinted almost the entire time, afraid that she would be late.","To a soldier, being late was an unforgivable mistake. It was an absolutely unforgivable mistake. Ye Jian had been in the military for many years and had never been late.","In the conference room, Song Zhiqiu looked at his watch a few times. From time to time, he would look up at the door of the conference room. He didn’t show it on his face, but he was actually anxious.","This wasn’t a casual meeting. Besides the leaders of the department, there were also the leaders of the school. There were as many as five high-ranking leaders in school like Commissar Yue!","If Ye Jian was late, she would leave a bad impression on the leaders. Song Zhiqiu was very worried that it would affect Ye Jian’s graduation.","Ye Jian, who was running under the scorching sun, didn’t think about the future consequences. She just thought that she mustn’t be late. Ye Jian ran up to the fifth floor like a shadow and looked at the time. There were still two minutes left. She rushed to the bathroom and changed into the summer military uniform. Then, she rushed into the conference room within 30 seconds.","Song Zhiqiu heard footsteps outside. After all, they had been classmates for three years. The moment he heard the footsteps, Song Zhiqiu couldn’t help but close his eyes slightly and exhale softly.","At two o’clock sharp, Ye Jian arrived at the conference room. The conference room was filled with third-year students. There were 35 of them in total. They were all in charge of training students outside the school for ten days starting tomorrow. When they saw Ye Jian enter, 35 gazes landed on the door.","Ye Jian...","For some reason, everyone secretly adjusted their breathing. Even their backs stiffened slightly. They were even straighter than before Ye Jian came. The atmosphere seemed a little tense.","Everyone wanted to come in first, even if it was an out-of-school training. However, with a powerful person added to the mix, it would be difficult to compete with her. It would indeed make the other members nervous and pressured.","\"Ye Jian.\"","Song Zhiqiu smiled and called out to her. He was in the same class as Ye Jian. Song Zhiqiu, who arrived earlier, left an empty seat for Ye Jian.","Ye Jian smiled and sat down. She apologized softly, \"Thank you. Fortunately, I saw your message when I got off the plane. If not, I would’ve been late.\"","\"I was worried too. Fortunately, you arrived in time. Look, you’re sweating.\" Song Zhiqiu pretended to raise his hand to wipe the non-existent cold sweat on his forehead. As he spoke softly, the worry in his heart slowly dissipated. \"The dean told me a few days ago that you had already returned to school, but you rushed back to the capital city in the afternoon. When I received the notice at 11:00 am, I contacted you immediately. Your cell phone was turned off, so I guessed you were on the plane.","\"Fortunately, it was a morning flight. If it had been a later flight, you would’ve been late and considered absent.\""]},{"number":4580,"title":"Chapter 4580: Unique","paragraphs":["Ye Jian nodded with lingering fear. That was right. Fortunately, she rushed over from the Southern Province. \"I rushed over from the Southern Province. I boarded the plane at 11:00 am, but there was a half an hour delay. If not, I would have reached the school early.\"","If she had rushed over from the capital city, just like what Song Zhiqiu said... she would’ve been considered absent.","Ye Jian’s record had been kept stain-free in her three years of military school. Ye Jian would find it hard to accept being absent from a meeting in her fourth year.","Fortunately, she arrived on time.","The five leaders of the school and the two leaders from Xiangnan University chatted as they walked toward Teaching Building No. 4. The 36 third-year students sitting in the conference room sat down neatly. No one leaned against the seat and raised their legs. They sat upright like spears.","\"This is our conference room. All the students are here. Director Guan, Teacher Li, this way, please.\"","Commissar Yue’s voice came from outside. The 36 students sat upright and waited for the leaders to enter the conference room.","The chief instructor entered first. When Director Guan and Teacher Li, who were sent by the other schools for a meeting, entered the conference room, the chief instructor shouted, \"Stand up!\"","Swoosh...","The 36 students stood up at the same time.","\"Salute!\"","Whoosh...","When they saluted at the same time, they showed the temperament of a military school student. Director Guan and Teacher Li stopped in their tracks.","Their school was one of the top 985 universities in Xiang City. Anyone who managed to get into their university would be the cream of the crop. However, compared to the students from this university... they were not as energetic.","After the salute, the 36 students sat down in unison. No one was faster or slower than the other. They were so orderly that it was as if they were the same person doing the same thing.","Inviting the leaders of the university who were in charge of military training to the military school for a meeting was an indispensable process. Only with an exchange between the two sides would the follow-up work be smoother.","After introducing Principal Guan and Teacher Li, the students gave an applause. Commissar Yue then started the meeting.","Director Guan and Teacher Li also had a preliminary understanding of the 36 students. They knew that the students sent by the National Science University this time were all third-year students with outstanding comprehensive qualities. They sat down and glanced at the 36 students in the summer military uniform. When they reached Ye Jian, their gazes paused for a moment.","\"Find that female student’s information for me.\" Director Guan leaned forward slightly and whispered to Teacher Li, who was holding the personal information of the 36 students. \"She’s the only girl among the 36 students.\"","Teacher Li also noticed the only female student at the event location. She quickly found Ye Jian’s personal information.","The personal information provided to them was very simple. It contained the students’ name, gender, age, and outstanding results in school. There was no other information.","Ye Jian’s results were enough to convince Director Guan. He was surprised. \"I didn’t expect her to be an all-rounder. It’s not easy for a girl to get first place in the territory where the boys fight.\"","He almost underestimated the other party.","\"She’s indeed not simple...\" Teacher Li compared the information of the other students. She knew that although Ye Jian was the only female student, she was not inferior to the male students.","The National Science University didn’t list out all of Ye Jian’s results. They only needed to list three or four things. But Director Guan and Teacher Li from Xiangnan University already had a rough idea of Ye Jian’s capability.","The meeting lasted for two hours. It was mainly for the 36 students who were having their first out-of-school training. As for the director and teacher sent by Xiangnan University, they could just sit at the side and listen."]},{"number":4581,"title":"Chapter 4581: Demerit","paragraphs":["It was only now that the 36 students knew the school they would be going to was called Xiangnan University.","In order to ensure the effective completion of the training mission and standardize the management of the instructors during the training, they had to show the good image of the military unit. When the school instructors went to the other school, they would be reminded of all the requirements and rules. Once the chief instructor found out that the instructors had violated the rules, it wouldn’t be a small matter. They would be punished together.","Although the 36 students would be at Xiangnan University for ten days, their lifestyle was still in sync with the military unit. There was nothing special about it. They had to obey orders and listen to commands. They had to remember the rules and regulations of the military unit. At the same time, they had to strictly abide by the school’s rules and regulations. Outside of the set eight hours, the students would not participate in the school’s management.","Commissar Yue read out the rules and regulations that the students needed to abide by during the military training. Director Guan and Teacher Li, who came from Xiangnan University, were a little nervous.","This wasn’t the ordinary kind of strict. The most obvious difference between military schools and ordinary universities was revealed to them.","\"After the school’s military training is over, students can move around freely, but instructors are absolutely not allowed to move around freely. They’re not allowed to participate in any activities unrelated to military training. Even student invitations must be clearly rejected. Any violation will be recorded as a demerit!","\"The instructors must always maintain the bearings of a soldier. They must not do anything that will damage the image of a soldier, such as smoking, drinking, and asking for a student’s contact method. At the same time, they must explicitly reject the student’s request for contact methods. If they violate this, they’ll be demerited!","\"Civilized training must be carried out step by step. You can’t be simple and crude. It’s strictly prohibited to hit, scold, and punish the students in training! You must practice strict discipline. You can’t ask the students for drinks, money, or gifts in any form. Once you’re discovered, you’ll be demerited!","\"In case of an emergency, report to the leader and ensure the safety of the students.\"","The ’demerits’ were thrown down one after another. The expressions of the 36 students became more and more serious. To them, the training was not just a mission but a test.","\"Director Guan, Teacher Li, do you have anything else to add?\" Commissar Yue put down the document in his hand and smiled at the person in charge of the military training. \"If your school has any requests, our students will abide by them.\"","Commissar Yue explained the military training rules and regulations that the instructors had to abide by one by one. Director Guan and Teacher Li felt that their presence was not needed.","\"There’s nothing to add. Your school has clearly stipulated what we’re worried about and what we want. There’s nothing to add.\"","Director Guan smiled and nodded. \"After listening to your strict requirements for the 36 instructors, our school is at ease to hand over more than 1,300 students to your instructors.","\"I hope that in the next ten days, we’ll cooperate and understand each other’s principles and successfully complete the ten days of military training together. I also hope that after the ten days of military training, we’ll be able to see a new side of the new students. Not to mention that the 36 instructors here are so upright, we only hope that the more than 1,300 new students can see a transformation.\"","Commissar Yue smiled. \"Of course, we’ll cooperate with your school and successfully complete the ten-day military training.\" After he finished speaking, he retracted his smile and asked the 36 students present, \"Do you have the confidence to fulfill Director Guan’s request?\"","\"Yes!\"","36 loud voices were heard. Their voices were so loud that their eardrums were buzzing."]},{"number":4582,"title":"Chapter 4582: Color Change During Training","paragraphs":["\"Director Guan, we students are confident that we can do it. When the time comes, please assess the results of the military training.\" Commissar Yue was very satisfied with the students’ response. Soldiers needed to have the aura of soldiers!","Director Guan, who initially wanted to talk about some things that the students needed to pay attention to, didn’t even take out the documents from his briefcase. The leader of the National Science University had already explained everything in detail. Director Guan didn’t have anything else to add.","Then, he sent out a document that required the 36 students to sign and express their determination. The 36 students signed their names. Ten minutes later, the 36 students would board the bus to Xiangnan University and start the training.","As for the military school’s arrangements, Director Guan and Teacher Li, who were in charge of the military training in the school, chose to smile and watch the entire process. They felt that ten minutes was a short time. They could leave in an hour. However, the military school had strict rules. Hence, they decided to just take a look as they could learn some things at the same time.","Ye Jian, who didn’t even go back to the dorm upon arriving at school, quickly carried her luggage back to the dormitory. She took out the ointment she had prepared in her bag and placed it in the cabinet. It was definitely inconvenient to bring this to Xiangnan University.","Looking at the pile of skincare products, Ye Jian thought for a moment and took out a bottle of facial cleanser and a bottle of foundation. As for toner, lotion, and serum, Ye Jian didn’t bring them with her.","If it weren’t for the tri-colored skin color on her face, she would only bring the facial cleanser and nothing else.","Although her skin was still a little red after recovering from the sunburn on the back of her shoulder, new and tender skin had already grown on her skin. She didn’t have to worry.","She needed to bring her bedding, toiletries, camouflage uniform, and military boots. She couldn’t leave her water bottle behind either. When Ye Jian walked out of the dormitory, the bed she slept in was empty. The bathroom rack was empty too. It was as clean as if she was leaving the military school after graduating.","She packed her luggage as quickly as possible and took a pen. She left a note for Xu Wen and He Jing, who had yet to return to school. Ye Jian carried her backpack and rushed out of the female dormitory building, rushing to the gathering point.","The 35 boys rushed out of the dormitory building only a few seconds after Ye Jian. Ten minutes hadn’t passed. Director Guan, Teacher Li, and the chauffeur who would be escorting the 36 students to Xiangnan University saw the 36 students gathering in less than ten minutes.","The chief Instructor was in charge of the assembly and having the students board the car.","The two schools were not far apart. After crossing the bridge and going onto the riverside road, they quickly arrived at Xiangnan University, which was built beside mountains and rivers.","From the notification letter, more than 1,300 new students knew that the military training would start tomorrow. However, there were still a few new students who had not completed their reporting, but they would all complete it today.","The instructors hadn’t arrived yet, so the new students finished reporting and rested in the dormitory. The topics of the new students’ conversations were all related to military training. They talked most about the instructors.","Boys and girls were no exception.","The girls’ expressions changed when they talked about the military training. Some girls even looked for their teachers in hopes that they could be exempted from the military training. They found all kinds of excuses. Besides some who could not participate because of their health, the other new students had no excuse. Their exemption requests were rejected. They had to obediently wait for the military training tomorrow.","Some parents felt sorry for their daughters, especially when they imagined their daughters getting hurt under the sun. They went to look for the class director. They hoped that on account of them, their daughters would not have to suffer.","The military training in the university had been going on for four years. The teachers were all very experienced. They were able to communicate with any parents who came to look for them. All the university students in the country needed to participate in the military training. There was no special treatment."]},{"number":4583,"title":"Chapter 4583: Argument","paragraphs":["The delicate girls who were brought here by their parents knew that there was no room for discussion. Looking at the sun outside that could make them faint, some girls threw themselves on the bed and cried.","They had to participate even if they cried. No matter how sad they were, there was no room for discussion.","The girls who had received military training would persuade the girls who were crying. They smiled and said, \"We’ve been through it before. We’ll share some information with you. The people coming aren’t soldiers from the military unit. The instructors are all military school students. They’re university students too. They’re definitely easier to talk to than the instructors from the military unit.\"","\"It’s useless even if you cry now. The class director won’t let you find a way out of this. You won’t be able to take leave even if you cry. But if you really can’t hold on, the instructor won’t make things difficult for you.\"","\"That’s right, that’s right. Don’t cry anymore. Actually, the military training isn’t too tiring. My classmates who got into the National Arts University told me that they got 15 days of military training. It’s still alright for our university. We only have ten days. It’s only ten days. You can grit your teeth and overcome it.\"","\"That’s right. It’s only ten days of military training. It’ll be over soon. Don’t cry anymore. Do you want to eat some specialties from my hometown? They’re delicious!\"","\"Alright, alright. Let’s forget about our sorrows with some food! Since we can’t escape, we’ll face it.\"","They were all freshmen who had left home for the first time. They managed to persuade the crying girls. The girls in the female dorm had good personalities and knew how to comfort others.","But there were also those who were hot-tempered. They would get into a bad mood when they saw people running over to say that they didn’t want to go for military training. They would shout at the girls and say things like, \"If you have the ability, go and beg the class director. Don’t complain in the dormitory, okay?\"","\"Didn’t you read about the military training when you received the notice? Didn’t you prepare yourself at home? Did you only find out about it today? If you don’t want to undergo military training, tell the class director yourself! How annoying!\"","\"Why are you yelling? I’m just saying. If you don’t want to listen to me, you can leave! I’m talking about me. What does it have to do with you?\"","\"This is my dormitory too. What right do you have to ask me to leave? Since you can speak your mind, I can do it too. If you don’t wish to listen, you can leave! What I say is none of your business!\"","The hot-tempered girls were not to be outdone. Since they had spoken, they would not be refuted by the other party.","At first, everyone felt a little scared when they thought about the ten days of military training. After all, none of them had suffered like that before. They heard from their seniors that the military training was indeed tough. They were all afraid of standing for hours under the hot sun.","Although they were afraid, they accepted the reality.","At this moment, someone who kept sighing. She said, \"I don’t want to participate. I don’t want to get a heatstroke. I don’t want to think about this or that.\" With that, everyone became even more downcast.","The hot-tempered girls rushed over and started arguing. When the others saw this, they hurriedly pulled the people fighting apart. Some girls hurriedly closed the dormitory door. They didn’t want to alarm the dormitory teacher. That would be bad.","\"Stop complaining. We have to participate in military training. We’ll be staying in the same dormitory for four years in the future. Calm down and get along peacefully. We need to get along peacefully.\"","\"Everyone, give way. Don’t be angry. We’re in the same class. If we fight like this, everyone else will feel uncomfortable, right? If we alert the class director and you guys are reprimanded, that’ll be a heavy blow to your reputation, right?\"","\"We definitely have to participate in the military training. The seniors who reported clearly said that we have to do it.\"","It was normal for such arguments to happen. They were settled privately without alerting the class director."]},{"number":4584,"title":"Chapter 4584: Each With Their Own Thoughts","paragraphs":["There were also people in the dormitory who were looking forward to the military training. When they talked about the military training, they were all very excited. They wished that they could start tonight.","\"We’re much luckier than the seniors from the previous three batches. The people we invited are all high-quality military school students. They’re all from the military school known as the National Science University. They must be very powerful.\"","\"Hahaha, I don’t think you want to see how powerful they are. You just want to see how handsome they are. Don’t think too highly of yourself. Reality is cruel!\"","\"No, that’s the only thing making me look forward to the ten days of military training. I have to think about it. I can’t give up! Do you think they have a good temper? They should be better than the soldiers in the military unit. They’re university students, after all.\"","\"Stop dreaming, young lady. Although they’re university students, they’re military school students. Besides having lessons, they’re the same as the military unit. My brother is a military school student. When he came back in the first semester of his freshman year, my mother cried and cooked an entire table of food for him. He was so tanned that he was no different from a laborer.\"","\"Is your brother handsome? Is it possible that he’s among this batch of instructors? If your brother is here, won’t it be easier for us to request for leave?\"","\"You’re thinking too much again. My brother is only a second-year student. The people who are giving us military training this year are all third-year students. Don’t think too much. Whether they’re ugly or handsome, it’s up to fate. We can’t possibly request a change of instructors just because they’re ugly, right?\"","Suddenly, there was a burst of light laughter in the dormitory. The atmosphere in this dormitory was quite good. It would allow those girls who were a little resistant to it to accept it quickly.","Most of the girls had accepted the idea of military training, and only a few resisted it. However, it was easy for these few people to spread their negative emotions to the other students. At this moment, it was up to the entire group to resolve this problem.","The girls were refined, and the group was able to calm them down by having a chat.","There were also boys who secretly went to the class director’s office to request for exemption. It was even more impossible for the boys’ requests to be approved. When the class director saw a boy coming over to request for exemption, the first thing he said was, \"No way. None of the girls came over to request for exemption. Are you really a boy?\"","Just this one sentence was enough to make the boys leave dejectedly, not daring to stay any longer.","At least they had some self-esteem. They couldn’t admit that they were inferior to the girls. That would be embarrassing.","There was probably only one boy from every class who wanted to escape the military training. The other boys yearned for it. After all, all men had hot-blooded dreams. Hence, they had a lot of objections to shortening the 15 days of military training to ten days.","\"It’s only ten days. Damn, ten days isn’t enough. Even 15 days is too little!\"","\"Ten days is really not enough. It’ll just be like we’re standing around. We won’t feel anything. I heard that there’ll be shooting practice. Is it true? Is there a shooting range in our school? Is there?\"","\"There’s nothing we can do about it if ten days isn’t enough. There’ll be shooting practice. I asked our seniors about it. Everyone has an opportunity to shoot with real guns, but they don’t use real bullets. It’s a blank cartridge.\"","\"I’m not interested in anything else. My biggest interest is shooting. Also, I hope the instructors aren’t bad-tempered. I don’t want to fight with them.\"","\"There’s no need to fight. This time, they’re all military school students. None of them are soldiers. They’re university students, after all. That itself is a testament to their skills. I just don’t know how good they are. Huh, aren’t you the second runner-up in Taekwondo? Are you thinking of competing with the instructors?\"","\"Hahaha, if he defeats the instructors, the instructors will be so embarrassed! They probably won’t compete.\"","\"If we kick up a fuss, the instructors will be embarrassed and will definitely accept the challenge.\"","\"Alright, alright. It’s settled, then. Let’s watch a good show!\""]},{"number":4585,"title":"Chapter 4585: Worried","paragraphs":["The freshmen from Xiangnan University, who were waiting for the instructors of the military training, had already had rounds of discussions in the dormitory. Overall, they were quite happy.","Ye Jian and the other military school students were actually very happy too. However, their happiness was hidden in their hearts. All of them had serious expressions on their faces. Even when they were sitting in the bus, they looked solemn. This made Teacher Li, who was on the bus as well, feel very pressured.","Teacher Li wanted to talk to the only female student several times. However, she swallowed her words when she saw the female instructor sitting opposite her with a serious expression.","She felt that she would appear too abrupt if she opened her mouth. Teacher Li, who didn’t say anything, decided to chat with the chief instructor in a low voice. The atmosphere in the bus was so serious that as a teacher in charge of the logistics, she felt uncomfortable.","After talking for a while, Ye Jian was mentioned. Teacher Li mentioned the private discussion she had with Director Guan just now. \"I don’t know if she can suppress those students. If she can’t, she can inform the teacher immediately. The teacher will definitely help to bring the class under control.\"","Ye Jian was outstanding, but she was still a girl. Girls were usually shy and reserved. What if... she cried because of those naughty boys? That wouldn’t be good.","\"Teacher Li, Little Ye is outstanding in all aspects. She might be able to suppress everyone there. There might be a few opinionated students who want to cause trouble, but with Little Ye’s ability, it’s easy to deal with them. She won’t trouble the school.","\"Since it’s military training, the discipline of the class will definitely follow the strict requirements of the military unit. At that time, I’m afraid there’ll be students who will come and complain. Please investigate this matter properly when that issue arises.\"","The chief instructor had been in charge of coordinating this program for a few consecutive years. With his rich experience, he gave Teacher Li a heads-up in advance. He didn’t want the school to only listen to one side of the story and criticize the students from the National Science University.","The teachers of every school would naturally side with their students. As the chief instructor, he was no exception.","Teacher Li smiled and nodded. \"Don’t worry, don’t worry. Our school participates in military training every year. We’ve encountered many types of incidents.","\"Some students deliberately distort the truth to pressure the instructors in order to gain sympathy and sway public opinion. Our school will never listen to our students’ one-sided words and have opinions about the instructors. We’ll investigate carefully and give both sides a satisfactory explanation.\"","With Teacher Li’s words, the chief instructor felt more at ease.","This was the first time they had a military training partnership with Xiangnan University. This was the first time they established a military training relationship. Some things should be discussed in advance to prevent unnecessary misunderstandings.","Teacher Li was quite satisfied with the 36 students from the military school. They were as good as the soldiers in the military unit.","The bus drove into the campus of Xiangnan University at around 5:40 pm. There were no banners plastered on the bus. Hence, even though the bus passed through the campus’ driveway, the students walking on the two sides of the lane didn’t notice that the instructors of the freshman military training had arrived at the school.","At first, there was a banner in front of the bus. When the bus drove into the National Science University, the officer in charge of reception smiled and said, \"There’s no need to be so high-profile.\" After receiving Director Guan’s approval, he took down the red and white banner that said, ’Welcome, instructors of the National Science University for the military training.’","The freshmen were still discussing the instructors of the military training when they quietly entered the school. They got out of the bus and walked into the dormitory arranged by the school.","The male students gathered and headed to their temporary rooms. There were four people in one dormitory, and two students were in the same dormitory as the chief instructor."]},{"number":4586,"title":"Chapter 4586: Sucking Fans Along The Way","paragraphs":["Song Zhiqiu was one of the male students who was unfortunately assigned to the same dormitory as the chief instructor. He exchanged glances with the other male student. Only they knew what this feeling was like.","Who wanted to be in the same dormitory as the chief instructor?","They really didn’t want to!","Ye Jian, the only female student, wasn’t assigned to a dorm room by herself. During the meeting, Director Guan mentioned that he would arrange a dormitory for Ye Jian. Political Commissar Yue felt that it wasn’t appropriate and asked which female dormitory wasn’t full. Thus, Ye Jian went from a single room to sharing a dormitory with the new students.","It didn’t matter. Ye Jian accepted it happily and had no objections.","Regarding the arrangement of the leader of the National Science University, the female students had no objections and Director Guan naturally had no objections either.","Led by Teacher Li, the 35 male students lined up and headed to the male dormitory building. Ye Jian was led to the female dormitory by a female teacher in charge of military training logistics.","It was dinner time. The 35 students who had quietly entered the university’s gate were led to the boys’ dormitory. The place was no longer quiet. Instead, there were crowds of people that kept gathering to watch the sight.","Led by the chief instructor, the 35 students walked in an orderly manner with their heads held high. Their valiance caught the eyes of the boys.","Boys were more reserved than girls. Even if they stared for a long time, they wouldn’t say anything about it.","It was different for the girls. Even though the 35 students were carrying heavy backpacks on their backs, their backs were still straight. When they walked, they exuded the might of a soldier. Their valiant aura was perfectly displayed by the 35 boys.","As the representatives of the military unit, they couldn’t lose their momentum.","\"Left turn!\"","The chief instructor leading the way shouted in a low voice. The soldier in the front, Song Zhiqiu, completed the left turn.","\"F*ck, they can even maintain a straight line when turning a corner! Impressive!\"","\"It’s so cool! Even the way they walk is different.\"","\"Hahaha, your epilepsy-like walking posture is different from everyone else.\"","\"F*ck, get lost! I look cool when I walk too!\"","The friendship between boys usually took a few minutes. They were in the same dormitory and chatted for a day and a half. They spoke more casually.","Friendships between girls were formed much slower than those between boys. They often needed to click in one aspect, but once they clicked, a friendship would be instantly formed.","Normally, they would be reserved first and go from being polite to fooling around.","While the boys were laughing, the 35 students walked into the boys’ dormitory. A girl who had been silently looking at them walked away and said excitedly, \"The instructor at the front, did you see him? Did you see him? He’s so handsome! I wonder which class he’ll be in charge of!\"","\"Could he be our instructor? He just needs to be in charge of our class. He’s really handsome.\"","\"I saw him. He’s really cool! So cool! I want him to be in charge of our class. I hope he can be in charge of our class!\"","\"Hurry up and leave. Go back and tell the rest that the instructors who came back are all so handsome!\"","\"The most handsome person is the first instructor. He’s tall, handsome, and has a temperament. Oh no... I feel like I’ve fallen in love at first sight.\"","\"Hehehe, you’re dreaming. He might even have a girlfriend.\"","Before the military training started, the news that the instructors were very handsome had already spread. The second and third-year students who stayed in school to receive the new students couldn’t help but join in the conversations."]},{"number":4587,"title":"Chapter 4587: Coming, Coming","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was much calmer. She was alone and was led by Teacher Lu in charge of the logistics. The first time the girls saw Ye Jian, they weren’t attracted by her identity as an instructor. They were attracted by her appearance.","\"She’s not an instructor of the military training, right? She’s so beautiful. It’s impossible, right?\"","\"She can’t become an instructor if she’s beautiful? What kind of logic is that? She’s beautiful, but don’t you think her temperament is more outstanding? She looks perfect.\"","\"She’s quite elegant. She’s prettier and more elegant than the female soldiers on television.\"","\"The female soldiers on television aren’t female soldiers. They’re actresses. She’s a female soldier. Of course, she has a stronger temperament.\"","\"She’s so beautiful that she’d be able to enter film school without a problem. Why did she become a soldier?\"","\"Hahaha, she got into the National Science University’s military school. Her qualifications are not lower than the qualifications to enroll into our school. Do you think she’s an ordinary soldier? No, she’ll become an officer after graduation. We graduate to look for a job. After she graduates, she’ll already have a job. The country will assign one to her.\"","Previously, she wanted to enter the military school but failed because of her health. Hence, she didn’t question Ye Jian’s credentials.","The male instructors were all handsome, and the female instructor was prettier than the celebrities on television. Before the 36 instructors officially appeared in front of more than 1,300 students, they were already popular.","Ye Jian, who never once looked sideways, received the attention of everyone along the way. She followed Teacher Lu to her dorm.","Before arriving, Ye Jian didn’t expect to encounter... a war of words between girls.","Teacher Lu didn’t expect this either. She looked awkward as she said to Ye Jian, \"I’m sorry. Please wait for a moment, Instructor. I’ll go in and see what’s going on.\"","Ye Jian didn’t know whether to advance or retreat. Hearing that, she immediately smiled and said, \"Okay, there’s no hurry.\"","Her dorm was on the fourth floor. The rooms on the fourth, fifth, and sixth floors were all for freshmen. Ye Jian, who was in her military uniform, stood at the door of the dorm room like a mascot. Some girls stuck their heads out of their rooms before quickly pulling back...","\"Erm... Hello, are you... an instructor of the military training?\"","Ye Jian had been standing for about two minutes. A bold girl walked over and asked embarrassedly, \"You should be an instructor in charge of our military training. Are you... in charge of our class?\"","After she finished speaking, she was afraid that Ye Jian would misunderstand. \"This dormitory belongs to our class. The two dorms here aren’t full yet.\"","There had always been very few female students in engineering. Being able to gather ten female students was basically the highest index.","Ye Jian definitely wouldn’t tell her which class she was in charge of. She smiled and replied, \"I’m one of the instructors in charge of the new students’ military training. However, I’m not sure if I’m in charge of your class’ military training.\"","\"You’re really an instructor!\"","When Ye Jian replied, it seemed to have given the other party a lot of courage. Her small voice just now instantly became louder, scaring Ye Jian so much that her heart skipped a beat.","\"We followed you all the way here just now. We were wondering if you were really an instructor of the military training. Why is there such a beautiful instructor? You’re really beautiful...\"","Her words attracted the attention of five or six girls. Ye Jian thought that she should’ve kept silent.","The freshmen from Xiangnan University were too enthusiastic. She needed to take turns answering these girls.","She had to take care of her image. She couldn’t embarrass the military unit or the military school!","This was the first time Ye Jian was surrounded by people in military uniforms. She thought to herself and smiled as she answered the girls’ questions."]},{"number":4588,"title":"Chapter 4588: Close","paragraphs":["Girls had a deep affinity for soldiers, which had a lot to do with the country’s national conditions. Soldiers and civilians were one. Soldiers protect the country and their people by wearing their military uniforms. Even if they stood still without speaking, they would give the people around them an inexplicable sense of security.","At this moment, Ye Jian, who was surrounded by several girls, became the focus of the entire fourth floor.","The quarreling in the dorm room hadn’t stopped. Ye Jian could even hear Teacher Lu’s angry shout. Ye Jian, who wouldn’t be able to enter for a while, decided to continue standing and receive a wave of admiring gazes.","Ye Jian felt that her back had become very stiff. She wasn’t used to being surrounded by so many people.","Everyone in the military school was the same. They didn’t think that anyone was special. Besides being watched during competitions, Ye Jian had never been treated like this.","Hence, as she smiled, she felt even more uncomfortable. Fortunately, she was good at pretending, and the girls didn’t notice anything amiss.","The girls who thought that the instructor was gentle were even more enthusiastic. They even invited Ye Jian to their dorm for a while. Anyway, the people in Room 405 were still quarreling. They probably wouldn’t be able to reach a resolution for a while.","A girl whispered, \"Instructor, you should change dorm rooms. There’s a very strong-headed girl inside. Yesterday, she came over and quarreled with her dormitory mates over a cabinet. The instructor had no choice but to persuade the other girl to give up the cabinet.","\"Her mother is even more impressive. That girl said that she wanted to sleep on the bed by the window, so her mother took the mattress and blanket away from the local girl who went home last night. The person who’s arguing with her now is the local girl who went home. The counselor hasn’t appeared yet, but you’ve already arrived.\"","\"Why don’t you come to our dorm? You can go over after the counselor comes and takes Huang Yawen away.\"","\"That’s right, Instructor. It must be tiring for you to stand now. Why are you carrying such a huge backpack? Come and sit in our dorm for a while. Instructor, have you eaten? Do you want me to bring you to the cafeteria to eat? We haven’t eaten either.\"","\"Is it Huang Yawen who quarreled fiercely yesterday? Oh my god, who did this weirdo make things difficult for this time? Such a fierce one, that Yawen.\"","Ye Jian didn’t see who the person was, but she remembered the name.","Huang Yawen... She was a new student in the class. It seemed like this girl was going to have a hard time.","She snatched the cabinet of her classmate. In order to sleep on the bed that she liked, she secretly moved the bedding that her classmate had laid out without her consent... She was able to do such a thing that angered everyone. Just by her name, one could tell that she was not an easy girl to get along with.","It didn’t matter to Ye Jian if Huang Yawen wasn’t easy to get along with. Ye Jian would follow the normal training process. Huang Yawen wouldn’t be beaten or scolded. She would only be punished normally. Even if her parents kicked up a fuss in school, Ye Jian wasn’t worried.","\"Thank you for your kind intentions. After I go in to put my luggage, I’ll go down to the cafeteria. You haven’t eaten, right? Hurry up and eat. Otherwise, the food you like will all be snatched up if you go any later.\"","\"Instructor, you’re so humorous. Is your military school like our school? The good food is snatched up too?\"","\"When we queue up to receive our food, the most delicious foods will be snatched up in minutes. It’s the same as your school. There’s no difference.\"","The girls were very curious about military school life. Or rather, they were very curious about military unit life. Now that they had met a good soldier, they took the opportunity to chatter like little sparrows.","If it were a male student, they wouldn’t dare to get so close. Their shyness would make them very reserved."]},{"number":4589,"title":"Chapter 4589: Problematic Student","paragraphs":["Ye Jian was a girl. Naturally, the girls got close to her and felt that she was easy to get along with.","That was what they thought now. When the military training started, they would realize how strict the female instructor was at this moment. During training, she didn’t even look over when everyone was crying. She didn’t even look at them.","Ye Jian’s reply made the girls laugh. As it turned out, things were the same between both schools.","\"What about the military unit? Is it the same in the military unit?\"","\"Of course, but normally, that won’t happen. You can eat anything you like.\"","\"Is the military school’s training the same as the military unit’s?\"","\"There’s no difference. The military unit and the military school are all managed militarily. It’s no different to us.\"","\"Is it very tiring? I know that soldiers have to stand for several hours at a time. Even if the sun is as hot as today, you can’t hide in the shadows. How do you keep standing like that?\"","Ye Jian smiled. She was elegant and refined like a blooming orchid. \"Take your time. Do it for ten minutes first, then half an hour. Then, one hour, two hours... It’s all cumulative.\"","\"Instructor, how many hours can you stand?\"","\"I’ll just stand until I can’t stand anymore.\"","\"It sounds tiring. Instructor, will we have to stand tomorrow? Will we stand for a few hours?\"","\"Standing in the military stance is an indispensable part of military training. You’ll have to do it tomorrow. The instructors will arrange it for you.\" Ye Jian’s mouth was dry as she replied. At this moment, the counselor finally rushed over.","At first, the two counselors didn’t see Ye Jian. They only saw a group of girls surrounding her. The angry counselors strode over and shouted, \"Why are you all surrounding her? Why are you joining in the fun? Hurry up and go back to your dormitory.\"","The girls didn’t notice the counselors coming over. Ye Jian, who was surrounded, didn’t notice them either. When they heard the voices, the girls hurriedly turned around. That was when the counselors saw Ye Jian.","The counselors’ expressions froze for a moment before they realized that there would be a female instructor staying in Room 405 until the military training ended.","Now that the people in Room 405 were arguing, the instructor in charge of the military training had to wait outside.","\"I’m sorry, I’m sorry. Hello, Instructor. I’m a counselor. There’s a small conflict between the students inside. Sorry to keep you waiting,\" one of the counselors hurriedly apologized. She was already having a headache over the new students who hadn’t stopped causing trouble since the day they reported.","She had seen disobedient new students, but most of them had conflicts with the teachers of the school. This new student was quite impressive. She directly had conflicts with her dormitory mates.","A self-righteous voice came from inside. \"My mother said that if you don’t like it, you can move out. You can move wherever you want.\"","\"It’s the same no matter who comes. Yesterday, the counselor let me change my cabinet. Today, the counselor will let me change my bed too. Ha, I only moved your things to another bed. It’s already good enough that I didn’t throw yours out.\"","Ye Jian was dumbfounded when she heard that.","She was wrong, but she expected the student in the right to be grateful to her instead?","Fortunately, this girl would be under Ye Jian. If a male student had to deal with this kind of girl, the male student would only have a headache!","Veins popped up on the counselor’s forehead when she heard that. She had been working in the university for many years and had seen all kinds of students. However, today was the first time she saw someone like Huang Yawen!","\"How about this? We still need some time to settle this. Instructor, why don’t you go to Room 406 and sit for a while?\" The counselor, who was suppressing her anger, had already barged into the dorm room.","Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Then I’ll put my backpack in first and come back later. What do you think?\"","Ye Jian didn’t want to continue playing the role of a mascot. She chose to leave. They would be gathering for dinner at 6:20 pm. It was almost time."]},{"number":4590,"title":"Chapter 4590: First Hurdle Of The Military Training","paragraphs":["The counselor nodded immediately. However, she didn’t want Ye Jian to enter the dorm room. Ye Jian could tell that she was in a difficult position, so she took the initiative to take off her backpack.","A girl was smart. She quickly took the backpack and smiled brightly. \"Instructor, let me put it in for you. There are two empty beds in Room 405.\"","\"Thank you for your hard work.\" Ye Jian, who had handed over her backpack, saw the girl enter the dorm room and come out while clapping her hands. Then, she left.","Ye Jian turned around and left. The counselor’s expression turned dark.","An hour ago, when she knew that a military training instructor would be staying in Room 405, she specially reminded the students staying there in advance. In the end... the instructor came and they happened to quarrel.","The reason was simple. The local girl was furious when she saw that her bedding was thrown onto a bed that had not been cleaned at all. The bed that originally belonged to her was occupied by someone else.","She questioned Huang Yawen on the spot.","If Huang Yawen had admitted her mistake and apologized, it wouldn’t have escalated to a fight.","However, she didn’t do that. Relying on the fact that she was taller than the average girl, Huang Yawen, who was stronger than the rest, reached out her hand and pushed the local girl. The local girl didn’t expect the other party to attack. She was caught off guard and fell. Her head even hit the ladder that led to the upper berth.","No matter how good-tempered a person was, they would flare up in that situation. Moreover, the local girl was already furious to begin with.","When Ye Jian arrived, the two people who were fighting had just been pulled apart. Teacher Lu went in to ask about the situation. She didn’t dare to let the instructor who was waiting outside go in.","Damn it, not only was Huang Yawen in the wrong, but she even hit someone!","When the counselor came in, Teacher Lu quickly handed the matter to the counselor to settle. This kind of student had twisted principles and values. It was not something a logistics teacher could handle.","Before Ye Jian could walk far, she heard the counselor shouting from behind, \"Huang Yawen, stand up!\"","As it turned out, even when she was being reprimanded by the counselor, she was sitting down instead of standing up.","For tomorrow’s military training, Ye Jian guessed that this girl would become the most difficult student to train in the class. This was also the problem she would have to face soon.","The other girls kept a respectful distance from Huang Yawen. When they saw Ye Jian leaving, the girls who hadn’t eaten wanted to go with Ye Jian but were rejected by her.","There was a rule in military training. Unless necessary, the instructors were not allowed to interact too closely with the students. Actually, it was mainly targeted at male instructors and female students. There were no other rigid rules.","Ye Jian just felt that it was better to abide by the rules. It wasn’t a good thing to get too close to the students.","There was an advantage to staying in Room 405. With Huang Yawen around, as an instructor, Ye Jian could keep her distance from any girl.","After dinner, it was time for the 36 students to have a meeting. They discussed things from 7:00 pm to 8:30 pm. The next day, it was time to welcome the 1,300 new students.","After the meeting ended, Teacher Lu looked for Ye Jian and apologized sincerely. Then, she told Ye Jian that the university had decided to arrange a single room for her and she wouldn’t be staying with the girls anymore.","As for the reason, Teacher Lu didn’t hide it from Ye Jian. She said with a headache, \"Huang Yawen is very uncooperative. In order not to affect your rest, it’s better for you to have a room alone. The other three girls also strongly requested to change dorm rooms. They don’t want to be in the same room as her.\"","Ye Jian smiled. \"It’s been hard on you, Counselor.\"","Living with a girl like Huang Yawen would make anyone want to move out.","If they had to share the same room with Huang Yawen, every minute would be torture. The earlier they moved out, the happier they would be."]},{"number":4591,"title":"Chapter 4591: Ye Jian Is Angry","paragraphs":["At the mention of Huang Yawen, Teacher Lu was at a loss for words. She sighed and said, \"Alas, the counselor and the leaders of the department will talk to her again. If she doesn’t cooperate, we can only ask her parents to come to school.\"","Asking Huang Yawen’s parents to intervene... Teacher Lu thought that even if her parents came, it wouldn’t have any effect. They would still think that Huang Yawen was in the right.","Today, she had heard of Huang Yawen’s parents’ ’magnificence.’ Even if they came, it wouldn’t be to cooperate with the university but to support their daughter.","Due to Huang Yawen’s misdeeds on the second day of reporting, the university didn’t arrange for Ye Jian to stay with her. They quickly arranged for a separate room so that Huang Yawen wouldn’t do anything shocking and infuriating in front of the instructor.","In that case, Ye Jian didn’t need to think about how to face the girls after the training ended.","Without saying anything else to Ye Jian, Teacher Lu brought Ye Jian back to Room 405 and took her backpack.","The lights in the dorm room were lit up. The lights in the bathroom at the side were lit up as well. Ye Jian, who came in, glanced at the bathroom, where breathing sounds could be heard.","At this moment, there shouldn’t be anyone in the dormitory. All the new students were in their classroom. The instructor would announce the rules that the students had to follow for tomorrow’s military training and tell them in advance that they had to obey the instructors’ orders.","Some girls in Room 405 didn’t go to the classroom.","Ye Jian retracted her gaze and walked into the dormitory. She saw the backpack on the bed and frowned.","Teacher Lu smiled and said, \"Fortunately, you only took out the blanket. Instructor Ye, did you take out anything else? Don’t leave it behind.\"","\"Teacher Lu, I didn’t take out my personal belongings. Someone has touched my backpack.\" Ye Jian pursed her lips. A glint of coldness was seen in her eyes. \"Teacher Lu, please help me ask the students who didn’t go to the classroom if they saw anyone touching my backpack.\"","\"What?!\"","Teacher Lu was shocked. Someone actually dared to rummage through the instructor’s luggage. Her expression changed as she immediately said, \"Instructor Ye, quickly take a look and see if there’s anything missing—\"","Before she could finish her sentence, she was interrupted by the sound of running water and a cheerful humming from the bathroom. Right on the heels of that, the bathroom door opened and a tall and strong girl of at least 1.7 meters walked out.","When Teacher Lu saw who it was, her expression turned dark. \"Huang Yawen, why didn’t you go to the classroom?\"","As it turned out, she was Huang Yawen.","She was not afraid of hitting someone... With her physique, she really did have an advantage. Her arms were also very strong... It seemed like she had learned some type of martial arts.","Huang Yawen pursed her lips when she heard that. She said indifferently, \"I had diarrhea and came back after taking leave.\" She glanced at Ye Jian. \"Are you the instructor? Why are you so skinny? You look like a bamboo pole. You look weak.\"","She sized up Ye Jian with an impolite gaze. Then, she questioned, \"A person like you can get into military school? I’m so powerful but I didn’t pass the face-to-face review. Hey, did you bribe the officers? If not, how did you pass?\"","\"Who did you look for? Can you introduce your contact to me? I’ll give you twice as much as what you offered. Can you get me into your military school too?\"","Ye Jian’s gaze turned cold as she looked at this arrogant girl. She pointed at her backpack and asked calmly, \"Do you know who touched my backpack?\"","\"It can’t be. With such IQ, how could you get into the military school? Is there a need to ask? Who else is in the dormitory? That’s the person who touched it. Why is there nothing inside? I thought there was a gun or something. I heard that we can shoot during the training. Will anything happen if the bullets hit someone? Have you tried it?\""]},{"number":4592,"title":"Chapter 4592: Bad","paragraphs":["Huang Yawen’s attitude made Teacher Lu tremble in anger. Even her fingers were trembling. She, she, she... she didn’t act like a student at all. She was clearly a female tyrant!","\"Huang Yawen! Shut up! Shut up!\" Teacher Lu was so angry that her face was distorted. She pointed at the camouflage backpack on the bed and shouted, \"You messed it up, didn’t you? Tell me!\"","How could there be such a student? How could there be such a student in Xiangnan University?","Huang Yawen glanced at Teacher Lu and pursed her lips nonchalantly. \"What’s the big deal about flipping through it? I didn’t throw it out. Why are you making a fuss?\"","She didn’t take Teacher Lu’s anger to heart. Instead, she asked Ye Jian, who had a cold expression on her face, \"Hey, I asked you a question. Why aren’t you answering?\"","\"Huang Yawen! Get out! Get out!\" Teacher Lu was furious. She rushed over and wanted to chase out this person who didn’t even have the most basic morals.","Ye Jian raised her hand and stopped Teacher Lu. \"Teacher Lu, let me talk to her first.\"","\"There’s nothing to say. Her attitude is too bad! I’ve never seen such a girl before! No, we have to get her counselor here!\" Teacher Lu was so angry that her face turned green. She couldn’t control her burning anger. How could such a student come to this university?","Teacher Lu took out her phone and called the counselor. \"Counselor Liao, hurry up and come to Room 405. Huang Yawen even dares to rummage through the luggage that the instructor left in the dorm room. She even talked nonsense in front of the instructor. Hurry up and come over.\"","Tonight was the first time the new students in the class met. They took turns introducing themselves, and the atmosphere was quite harmonious.","The smile on the conductor’s face froze when she received Teacher Lu’s call. She said to the new students, \"I have something to do. Please continue.\" Then, she quickly left the classroom.","There was a certain distance between the teaching building and the female dormitory. After walking out of the dormitory, the teacher immediately started running. Huang Yawen even dared to rummage through the instructor’s luggage. This student simply had a bad character!","Huang Yawen, who was in the dormitory, had an ugly expression on her face too. \"What’s wrong with you? You asked the teacher to come over for such a small matter. She didn’t even say anything. Why are you, a logistics teacher, interfering? You’re being nosy!\"","\"Huang Yawen, look at yourself. You don’t look like a student at all! Do you even respect your teachers or instructors? Do you know how to respect your superiors?\"","After being criticized by the student for being nosy, Teacher Lu’s blood pressure soared. This was the first time she saw a student who didn’t respect her teachers!","From primary school to senior high... How did she survive? Had she ever taken any of her teachers seriously?","\"I didn’t talk to you just now. You were the one who talked to me.\" Huang Yawen glanced at Teacher Lu, who was angered by her. She pursed her lips and smiled in disdain. \"If you think that I don’t respect you, why don’t you just leave? I didn’t ask you to stay.\"","\"You...\"","\"Teacher Lu, I’ll talk to her.\" Seeing that Teacher Lu was about to faint from anger, Ye Jian stood up and pulled Teacher Lu away. \"She messed with my backpack. I’ll talk to her.\"","\"Instructor Ye, this kind of student can’t be taught. Let’s wait for the teacher to come over and see how she handles things. I’m sorry to make you suffer grievances.\" Teacher Lu heaved a sigh of relief. As a teacher, she didn’t want to talk to this arrogant and unrepentant student anymore.","\"That’s right, that’s right. You can just talk to me. Wait a moment, I’ll take my cell phone.\" Huang Yawen, who didn’t think much of Teacher Lu, was quite happy. She smiled and ran to the bed she had forcefully occupied to take her cell phone.","Ye Jian raised her hand and blocked her way."]},{"number":4593,"title":"Chapter 4593: Warning","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s voice was as cold as metal when facing a girl who didn’t even have the basic morals of a human. \"You don’t have to take your cell phone. You messed with my backpack, didn’t you?\"","\"That’s right. Didn’t I just say that I just flipped through it? Alright, alright, don’t be so petty. I didn’t do anything wrong. Hurry up and tell me, did you bribe your way into the military school? Introduce your contact to me. I can offer several times more than what you offered back then.","\"I really don’t like this school. A bunch of girls are making a fuss. They don’t know how to cooperate with me at all. I just changed my bed and my cabinet, but they kicked up such a fuss. They need to be taught a lesson.","\"Give me the cell phone number of the person who brought you in. I need to memorize it. Instructor, I didn’t expect you to be so smart. This is a good arrangement. Everyone will have nothing to worry about.\"","Ye Jian smiled faintly. There was a hint of bloodlust in her eyes. \"You owe me and Teacher Lu an apology now. Also, you rummaged through my backpack without my consent. Should I call the police?\"","\"Apologize? Hahaha, Instructor, are you kidding me? I didn’t do anything wrong. Call the police? Are you trying to scare me? Will the police deal with such a small matter?","\"Don’t scare me. I’ve seen these tactics too many times. I’m not afraid. Stop dawdling and give me the phone number.\"","As she spoke, she waved her hand at Ye Jian’s arm. Teacher Lu was so frightened that her pupils constricted. She screamed, \"Huang Yawen, are you going to hit the instructor?! Huang Yawen! Get out! Get out!\"","Ye Jian narrowed her eyes slightly. She didn’t let Huang Yawen hit her. She took a step back and continued to block her. She said calmly, \"This is my first warning. Apologize.\"","Huang Yawen was very arrogant. Even if Ye Jian called the police on Huang Yawen for rummaging through other people’s belongings... the police wouldn’t deal with her. At most, they would mediate.","Huang Yawen knew this very well, so she wasn’t afraid of the police being called.","Teacher Lu wasn’t shouting anymore. She stood up and grabbed Huang Yawen’s arm. She dragged her out of the dormitory. \"Get out! Get out!\"","The tall and strong Huang Yawen couldn’t be dragged by Teacher Lu. She swung her arm forcefully and easily shook off Teacher Lu’s hand.","\"Are you a teacher? Are you going to hit a student?\"","Huang Yawen rubbed her wrist and glared at Teacher Lu who shouted at her and hit her again. \"I only gave in to you because you’re a teacher. Try hitting me again! Don’t think that I don’t dare to retaliate!","\"Scram? This is my dormitory! Who’s kicking who out? So what if I touched someone else’s luggage? Did I steal anything? Did I break anything? It’s a pile of crap. No one would want it even if I were to throw it in the trash can! Apologize? Dream on!\"","After she finished speaking, she glared at Ye Jian. \"Are you happy now? Give me the phone number and leave with your luggage! Don’t waste time, okay?\"","Teacher Lu was so angry that she clutched her chest. Even her face was a little pale. She didn’t forget to say to Ye Jian, \"Instructor Ye, ignore her. Wait for the teacher to come and deal with her! Ignore her! She’ll really hit people.\"","\"As long as I don’t beat someone to death, hitting people is nothing. Instructor, don’t think that you’re so great. I, Huang Yawen, have never failed to get what I want.","\"Give me the phone number and you can leave. If not...\"","The corners of Ye Jian’s lips curled up slightly. She revealed a faint smile. \"Otherwise, what will you do? Hit me?\"","It was a gentle smile, but it was no longer as harmless as it was when Ye Jian was in front of the students from before.","She had carried out many missions, big and small. As her voice turned colder, her entire aura changed drastically."]},{"number":4594,"title":"Chapter 4594: Frightened","paragraphs":["As the viciousness in her eyes got stronger, Huang Yawen, who had always been arrogant, felt her heart tighten. Her face was filled with fear.","\"You, you, you... What do you want? Who are you trying to scare...\"","Huang Yawen, who was seemingly afraid for no reason, glared at Ye Jian. However, she felt that her aura was too weak. She didn’t manage to suppress Ye Jian’s aura and make the other party afraid of her. She swallowed her saliva with a frown. She said fiercely, \"Don’t think that I don’t dare to beat you up. Even if I beat you up, you can’t do anything about it because I’m a student!\"","Yes, even if she beat up Ye Jian, there was nothing Ye Jian could do about it as Huang Yawen was a student.","It was impossible for Ye Jian to teach Huang Yawen a lesson. Even if the other party made a move first, Ye Jian could only defend herself.","The military training hadn’t started. Ye Jian didn’t want to have a conflict with any students, including Huang Yawen, who didn’t have any basic morals and thought she could do whatever she wanted.","There was a strict rule that instructors were not allowed to have any conflicts with students. Violators would be demerited!","As an instructor and a soldier, Ye Jian didn’t care if the students were reasonable or not. This wasn’t a reason for her to fight with the students.","If the students weren’t understanding, she had to be!","It was obvious that this arrogant and self-centered student also knew this very well.","Huang Yawen wasn’t stupid. She knew her strengths. She could use her ’rogue logic’ to get her teachers to be lenient to her. She could also use her ’rogue logic’ to get her classmates to cooperate with her.","She was low in IQ, but she knew how to make use of her advantage too well. She knew too well that the squeaky wheel would get the grease.","She was already used to the benefits brought to her by ’rogue logic’. She also gained a sense of accomplishment from it.","She was not worried about Teacher Lu because Teacher Lu was just a logistics teacher. She couldn’t control her.","The teacher was worried because she knew that it was impossible for Ye Jian, an instructor, to hit a student. As a student, as long as Huang Yawen didn’t injure or cripple the instructor, she wouldn’t be at a disadvantage.","Huang Yawen, who had a set of rules for survival, wanted to glare at Ye Jian even more fiercely. Several times, she had just mustered her arrogance when, in the blink of an eye, she felt frightened again.","Ye Jian, who had killed countless enemies and had her hands stained with blood, stared at the overly presumptuous girl with a vicious look in her eyes. Her aura was oppressive as she approached Huang Yawen, who was three to four centimeters taller and weighed at least 34 catties heavier than her...","Huang Yawen, who had always been the queen, wanted to puff out her chest and scare Ye Jian with her physique. Unexpectedly, Ye Jian’s aura changed, and the terrifying aura surged towards her. Huang Yawen was so frightened that she took a few steps back.","\"You, you, you... What do you want? Do you want to hit me?\"","No matter how powerful Huang Yawen was, she had never been on the battlefield and killed enemies. Facing a real soldier whose hands were stained with blood, her arrogance disappeared instantly like a bubble hitting a towering mountain.","Ye Jian was so close that the arrogant girl took a few steps back until she was forced to the corner of the last bed.","At this moment, Huang Yawen’s physique was useless. Her knees were already trembling from Ye Jian’s bloodthirsty gaze.","\"This is your second warning. Apologize.\" The voice was like a sharp dagger stabbing into Huang Yawen’s heart.","\"Yes, yes, yes... Sorry...\"","\"What did you do wrong?\" Ye Jian asked calmly."]},{"number":4595,"title":"Chapter 4595: Shaking","paragraphs":["Huang Yawen, who was trapped against the bed, was trembling in fear.","She was afraid. She was really afraid. The instructor in front of her was staring down at her. From time to time, she would glance at her neck as if she was considering... what to use to cut her throat so that she could die faster.","This feeling was too terrifying.","Out of human instinct toward danger, Huang Yawen gave up resisting and cried, \"My mistake was that I shouldn’t have gone through your backpack, Instructor.\"","Huang Yawen’s voice trembled as she apologized.","She was afraid. She was really afraid now!","Ye Jian smiled coldly. \"Very good. I’ll accept your apology for now. Who else do you need to apologize to?\"","She took a step back and retracted the terrifying killing intent on her body. The oxygen in the space instantly returned, making Huang Yawen feel like she had survived a calamity and came back to life.","\"I-I should apologize to the logistics teacher.\" She panted heavily. Her voice was still trembling.","Ye Jian turned sideways so that Huang Yawen could walk over and apologize to Teacher Lu.","Huang Yawen tried a few times to regain her balance. When she walked past Ye Jian, her steps became bigger.","\"Teacher, I’m sorry. I was wrong...\"","Ever since Ye Jian forced Huang Yawen against the bed, Teacher Lu didn’t dare to move. She was stunned. She couldn’t believe what she was seeing. She was completely stunned.","Teacher Lu still found it unbelievable that Huang Yawen had walked over and apologized.","No wonder the military training was enforced. If there was such an effect, it would save the teachers a lot of trouble!","Even with the apology, the anger in Teacher Lu’s heart didn’t disappear completely. She looked at Ye Jian first. When she received a smile from Ye Jian, she turned to look at Huang Yawen. Her voice was stiff and cold as she said in a low voice, \"It’s good that you know your mistake!","\"You even dare to rummage through an instructor’s luggage. What else would you dare to do? This is a university, not your home. You can’t mess around! You should abide by the rules!","\"Huang Yawen, I’ll forgive you this time. But there won’t be a next time! Do you hear me?\"","Huang Yawen didn’t heed Teacher Lu’s criticism. Ye Jian opened her mouth again. \"Huang Yawen, did you hear that?\"","As she spoke, Ye Jian walked over and stood beside her. Her gaze swept past Huang Yawen’s neck again. Huang Yawen’s body tensed up. She gritted her teeth and replied with a trembling face, \"I heard you, Teacher. I won’t... There won’t be a next time. There won’t be a next time.\"","Teacher Lu’s expression turned slightly better when she heard this.","The sound of the teacher running could be heard from the corridor. When she received Teacher Lu’s call, the teacher ran all the way to the fourth floor. She ran until her lungs were about to explode.","Panting heavily, she ran into Room 405. However, she found out that Huang Yawen had already apologized to Instructor Ye and Teacher Lu. At this moment, Instructor Ye was packing her backpack and preparing to leave the dormitory.","The officer couldn’t believe that Huang Yawen would apologize.","Yesterday and today, she caused such a huge ruckus. She insisted that she was in the right and that other people were in the wrong. This time, she actually apologized to Teacher Lu and admitted her mistake?","\"Am I mistaken? Did I get the wrong person? Teacher Lu, did you hear her apology?\" The teacher, who was still panting, asked repeatedly, expressing her disbelief."]},{"number":4596,"title":"Chapter 4596: Killing Eyes","paragraphs":["Teacher Lu smiled and nodded repeatedly. \"She admitted her mistake. It’s true. Instructor Ye is smart. She didn’t criticize her. She just stared at Huang Yawen until she backed up against the bed. Huang Yawen apologized to Instructor Ye first and then to me under Instructor Ye’s instructions.","\"Teacher Liao, you really have to thank Instructor Ye. For the next ten days of military training, you must get Instructor Ye to correct the students’ problems.\"","Teacher Lu felt emotional.","The teacher who had been having a headache over Huang Yawen couldn’t remain calm anymore.","When she saw that Instructor Ye, who was in charge of her class’ military training, had easily taken care of her most troublesome student, she couldn’t care about talking to Teacher Lu anymore. She hurriedly apologized to Ye Jian and asked embarrassedly, \"Instructor Ye, can I talk to you in private?\"","As a result, Ye Jian didn’t change rooms and continued staying in Room 405.","When Huang Yawen heard that the instructor she was afraid of was sleeping in Room 405, she changed her bed and cabinet. She then hurried to her classroom.","She was very afraid of this beautiful instructor who looked like she could defeat her with one punch. Ye Jian’s gaze was too scary. Even Huang Yawen’s free combat instructor didn’t have that kind of gaze that could scare her.","Huang Yawen, whose face was pale, walked out of the dormitory and realized that her back was covered in cold sweat.","She knew that her life would not be as good as before. She would not be able to do whatever she wanted and make everyone afraid of her so that they would listen to her every word.","The teacher was still thanking Ye Jian in the dorm room.","She really didn’t know what Instructor Ye, who was the same age as the third-year students, did to make the lawless Huang Yawen obediently change the cabinet and bed she snatched yesterday. Huang Yawen also made up the beds of the two girls who cried because of her and tidied up the cabinets.","Ye Jian, who hadn’t left, smiled and said, \"It’s not a big deal. I can’t guarantee that Huang Yawen can change her bad habits. I just want her to understand that she has to bear the consequences of her mistakes.\"","\"That’s good, that’s good! Thank you in advance for your hard work for the next ten days, Instructor Ye. Thank you, thank you very much.\" The teacher thanked her again and again before leaving the dormitory and rushing to the classroom.","Ye Jian, who chose the outermost bed, smiled and sent the teacher off before starting to make her bed. Actually, she didn’t stay because of the teacher’s request. She just felt that it was a challenge to train a student like Huang Yawen to abide by the rules. She wanted to give it a try and see if she could complete the challenge.","As for what method she would use, when she was training in the military unit deep in the mountains of Fujun Town, she had seen too many examples of troublesome recruits being taught a lesson and becoming a different person.","This was her first time training students. She couldn’t treat it as an ordinary military training. She should treat it as a training before entering the military unit.","To deal with students like Huang Yawen, Teacher Lu and Teacher Liao had used gentle methods to educate her. Without a doubt, their plan ended up backfiring and hurting themselves instead.","With some students, the teacher needed to adopt gentle methods to educate them.","With some students, the teacher needed to be tough. For instance, those who were strong-willed and unconvinced; those who thought that they were the best in the world.","For someone like Huang Yawen who would bully others when she made a mistake and play the blame game, both gentle and tough methods would not work.","Ye Jian would have to think of a new method."]},{"number":4597,"title":"Chapter 4597: Tricks","paragraphs":["If a gentle method was used, Huang Yawen would think that the other party was a pushover.","Just now, she relied on her identity as a student to refuse to admit to her mistake and fought with her teacher to no end. As for the teacher, how could she allow such a student to waste so much of her time?","Normally, teachers would reprimand the students first before educating them. Then, they would comfort the students who had suffered a grievance and the matter would be settled just like that.","After all, teachers couldn’t help too much. Normally, families that could raise such children were influenced by their parents.","Huang Yawen came from a small city. Her family was wealthy, and her parents doted on her. Hence, she developed an arrogant personality, thinking that everyone had to give in to her.","However, her parents still pampered her. They felt that it was fine as long as their daughter didn’t suffer grievances.","Huang Yawen, who had learned free combat for a few years and started hiring tutors to help with her homework in junior high, had always been domineering. She never thought that she would end up in this situation today.","Around 9:10 pm, the other three girls from Room 405 came back together. When they pushed open the door and saw Ye Jian, two girls suddenly became very tense and didn’t let go of the door handle.","\"Hello, Instructor.\"","\"Hello, Instructor.\"","\"Sorry for disturbing you, Instructor. Did we disturb your rest?\"","Ye Jian, who had washed up in advance, smiled and said, \"No, I’m the one disturbing you. My surname is Ye. You can call me instructor Ye. I’ll be staying with you for the next ten days.\"","\"Welcome, welcome. The other classmates are very envious of you staying with us, Instructor.\"","\"Instructor, go ahead. The three of us will tidy up first.\"","Ye Jian saw that they were all very restrained, so she didn’t talk much. Soon, a girl said in surprise, \"Your bed, your bed! Look! It’s been changed back!\"","\"Ah, that’s true! Hurry up and see if you’ve got your cabinet back.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes. Let me take a look! Ah... It’s been changed back too!\"","The two girls who got their bed and cabinet snatched from them were so happy that they were jumping. The third girl hurriedly pulled them aside and whispered, \"The instructor is here. Lower your voice.\"","The two girls stuck out their tongues and apologized to Ye Jian.","Seeing that they were so happy, Ye Jian was affected too. There was a deep smile in her eyes. \"Huang Yawen realized her mistake and changed back the bed and cabinet that she forcefully swapped. If you face any difficulties in the next ten days, you can tell me. I’ll think of a way to help you.\"","She couldn’t directly call out Huang Yawen. She had to treat everyone equally.","However, she believed that the smart new students would understand her meaning.","The three girls were extremely happy. Even when Huang Yawen stepped in, they continued to have a smile on their faces. Then, something happened that shocked them so much that their jaws almost dropped to the ground. Huang Yawen, who still dared to hit people today, actually apologized to them!","She even said that... she would never do it again!","Ye Jian nodded in satisfaction. She didn’t expect her to be like Captain Xia one day. She could scare people with just her gaze.","The next morning, at 8:30 am, the standard music of the military training started playing. More than 1,300 new students lined up on the sports ground. On the stage, the school leaders, the instructors, and the leaders of the military school sat down. The host introduced the leaders and guests, representing the official start of the military training.","The participating instructors were represented by Ye Jian and the student representative Luan Qi. Then, the leaders of the military school gave their speeches. At ten o’clock, the opening ended. The 36 classes finally welcomed their military instructors.","The training programs of each class had already been planned. As the instructor led their teams into the military training areas, the first day of military training started.","The boys in Ye Jian’s class chatted as they walked."]},{"number":4598,"title":"Chapter 4598: Show Mercy","paragraphs":["Unexpectedly, the female instructor who was rumored to be really beautiful was indeed really beautiful. She was even assigned to their class for military training. They were blessed!","\"Damn, she’s really beautiful. I thought that it was a fake rumor. It’s better to see it with my own eyes. I now know that it’s true.\"","\"Her facial features are exquisite. Her face is small and her skin is fair... She’s not a military school student, she’s a celebrity.\"","\"The boys in our class will be envied by the boys from the other classes. Hehe, do you see that? The boys from the next class keep glancing over.\"","\"They’re definitely envious. The only female instructor was assigned to our class, and she’s so beautiful. Tsk, tsk, tsk. It can’t be helped. We’re lucky!\"","Ye Jian smiled. Were they lucky?","She wanted to see if he would still say the same thing afterward. She hoped that he would be able to maintain his smile and mood until the military training ended.","\"Tao Yi, as a Taekwondo fighter, I don’t think you should fight with the female instructor. I don’t think that the female instructor is very skilled. We’ll just cooperate with this form of military training. We won’t expect to experience life in the military unit like we said before.\"","\"It’s alright. We can look for the male instructor from the next class. We’ll show mercy to the female instructor.\"","Ye Jian, who was observing the new students, continued to smile. Not bad. There was still the Taekwondo fighter. When the time came, they could compete. She had never interacted with this Taekwondo fighter.","Smiling, Ye Jian memorized the boy’s name, Tao Yi.","After 9:00 am, the sun was already scorching. It was almost 10:00 am now, and the heat had increased by a few levels. Perhaps it was because the new students were very enthusiastic about the military training and because the university had arranged for them to be in the area where there were camphor trees on both sides to block the sun, so their enthusiasm didn’t decrease. The chatter never stopped.","Ye Jian didn’t care. She just stood in front and memorized the faces of all the students.","There were 43 students in this class. They would be divided into four large groups. Each group needed a squad leader. She needed to observe and choose the squad leaders.","Her smile made the new students think that she wasn’t strict. They started messing around even more. Suddenly, they heard the male instructor’s shout from the next class. His majestic and bright voice made their hearts tremble. Many new students were glad that the female instructor was very easy-going and let them be...","Fortunately, it was a female instructor. Fortunately, it wasn’t a male instructor!","Male instructors were much stricter. It was obvious from their display yesterday.","Yesterday, the instructors took a bus and entered the school secretly. The male instructors formed a huge team and headed to the dormitory. They were all dressed in olive green and carried huge backpacks. Their footsteps were neat. They could maintain a straight line even when they turned a corner. Wherever they went, they would be in a straight line.","It was said that apart from buckets and washbasins, they even brought their own bed covers!","Also, the boys who stayed on the same floor as the instructors were fortunate enough to witness another scene that they had only seen on television. All their blankets were folded into cubes. They were square and flat... It was as if they had been pressed by machinery. It was amazing!","Their towels, cups, and shoes were all lined up in a straight line too. The boys with OCD felt good for a long time. They were so neat that the observing boys were in awe. When they returned to the dormitory, they said with fear, \"They’re so strict. I’m afraid the military training will make us suffer!\""]},{"number":4599,"title":"Chapter 4599: Look At Me","paragraphs":["Everyone was talking about the male instructors, and only the female instructor remained mysterious. When they knew that the female instructor was as beautiful as a celebrity, the boys wanted to meet her by chance after dinner. However, they didn’t know which path the female instructor took. In the end, they didn’t meet her.","She continued to maintain her mysteriousness until... the opening ceremony started. They saw 36 instructors standing in front of all the new students. They formed a line from the side. The new students who were standing glanced at the instructors.","Of course, they glanced at the female instructor the most. She stood with her hands behind her back. Her legs were hidden under her camouflage uniform, and her feet were positioned as wide as her shoulders. Her belt was tied tightly around her waist. Her waist was so slender... The boys from science and engineering couldn’t help but wonder how small her waist was.","Her back was straight like a pine tree that grew under the sun. She was unyielding, and her temperament was so good that people would want to look at her again and again.","After looking at her for a long time, they could tell that the female instructor’s aura was stronger than the 35 male instructors. They also had an inexplicable fear and did not dare to look at the back of her head. It seemed that if they stared at her for another second, she would immediately turn her head and accurately catch someone looking at her.","Looking at Ye Jian’s back view, the boys who were the closest to her felt inexplicably afraid. The boys who were farther away only felt that the female instructor’s back view was very slender. As for the rest... they didn’t feel anything at all.","They just watched and listened until one and a half hours passed and the instructors left with their teams.","Now that they heard the shouts of the male instructors, the new students, who were frightened by the male instructors, looked at the class led by the only female instructor and felt even more envious.","\"Why aren’t we trained by the female instructor? Why did we get a male instructor? Male instructors are too scary. I want to go over. I want to go over...\"","\"There’s still no movement from their class. The female instructor looks like she has a good temper. I want to go over too.\"","\"Stop nagging. We’re considered lucky! We’re being trained by the military school. Those from the branches are in a much worse state!\"","There were more than 3,000 new students from Xiangnan University this year. There were more than 1,300 students from the main university and more than 2,000 students from the branch. The 36 military school students from the National Science University were in charge of the military training for the main university. The soldiers from the Xiangnan City Armed Forces were in charge of the 2,000 students from the branch. The two military trainings were carried out at the same time.","The boys, who were flustered by the male instructors’ cold voices, thought of the new students in the branch and finally felt more at ease.","After all, their instructors were military school students and university students...","The freshmen were in a good mood. As they spoke, they couldn’t even maintain the basic formation. Ye Jian, who was standing in front, had already finished observing. At the same time, her smile slowly disappeared. The dark eyes under the brim of her camouflage cap were already filled with a cold light.","Huang Yawen, who was standing in the last row among the girls, accidentally met Ye Jian’s gaze. Instantly, Huang Yawen, who had been trying to be smart, shivered under the sun.","\"Don’t look at me, don’t look at me, don’t look at me... I didn’t say anything, I didn’t say anything. They’re the ones talking. Don’t look at me, don’t look at me...\"","She muttered to herself silently and lowered her gaze. If her mother saw this, she would definitely be flabbergasted. She couldn’t believe that her precious daughter had become as obedient as a little white rabbit. She no longer had the arrogant offensive power she had in the past."]},{"number":4600,"title":"Chapter 4600: Inexplicably Scared","paragraphs":["Huang Yawen only moved her mouth slightly. She thought that Ye Jian couldn’t hear what she said, but in fact, Ye Jian knew everything through the shape of her mouth.","Ever since last night, the female tyrant had been very well-behaved. Not bad, intimidation was definitely effective.","Ye Jian didn’t know that when her gaze turned cold, the killing intent hidden in the depths of her dark eyes would sweep over with a hint of ruthlessness.","Huang Yawen, who studied free combat, was not unfamiliar with this kind of killing intent. Hence, Huang Yawen, who had always been a female tyrant from primary school to senior high, became the first freshman in the class who was most afraid of Ye Jian.","Tao Yi, who didn’t say anything to Ye Jian, didn’t feel anything for the time being. However, he soon felt that something was wrong.","The female instructor standing in front had a slight smile just now. Now, her smile had disappeared. Her expression was as cold as the snow in winter. Although it was beautiful, it was so cold that it made people feel cold on a hot day like today.","\"Stop talking. Stand properly,\" Tao Yi reminded the others in a low voice. \"The instructor seems a little angry. Stand properly.\"","Those in the first row were the first to stop moving. They were the closest to Ye Jian, so they could see the changes in Ye Jian’s expression clearly. The beautiful instructor who didn’t smile used her aura to make them stop talking.","There was no sound from the front row, and there was no sound from the second row either. Gradually, a tense atmosphere enveloped the entire class. It was like a transparent net that covered everyone tightly, making them gradually not dare to move and speak nonsense.","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","The soles of their shoes rubbed against the cement. As it turned out, someone who hadn’t been standing properly started to straighten up. Gradually, everyone subconsciously straightened their backs and closed their mouths. They looked at the female instructor who was still silent in front of them and felt a little flustered.","They felt that something was amiss with the female instructor in charge of their military training... She was a completely different person when she smiled. When she smiled, she made them feel no pressure. Now that she was not smiling, why did it make them panic?","After counting down to ten minutes silently in her heart, Ye Jian finally moved. She took a few steps closer to the students and stood less than a meter away from the front row. Her gaze slowly swept across everyone’s faces like a sword. Her cold aura entered the hearts of the new students and made the 43 of them panic. At the same time, they started to be afraid.","She had changed. Their female instructor had changed!","She had completely changed into another person. She had become a person that made them feel that something was wrong!","\"My name is Ye Jian. You can call me Instructor Ye. I’ll be in charge of your military training for the next ten days.\"","A clear voice tore through the air. While the new students remembered Ye Jian’s name, they also remembered her cold voice.","The bad premonition was here, and it was about to come true.","\"I don’t have high requirements. First, you have to obey orders. No disobedience is allowed. Second, obey all arrangements. No disobedience is allowed. Third, abide by discipline. No disobedience is allowed. Fourth, if you have any objections, please refer to the first, second, and third rules.\"","There was no room for discussion. They had to follow her orders and arrangements to the end.","\"I’m calling out the names now. Whoever I call will shout ’Arrive’. There’s no need to walk out. Just stand at the same spot and answer.\"","Ye Jian took out the squarish name list from the pocket of her camouflage training uniform. The names of the 43 students were all on it. She needed to do a roll call."]}]);
